#: docs/index.md:24
msgid "How to read it"
msgstr "如何阅读本书"

#: docs/index.md:26
msgid ""
"**Designing a new agent?** Read [The Agent Birth Stack](birth-stack.md), "
"then walk the [Birth checklist](lifecycle/birth.md). Fill in a [Birth "
"Profile](manifest.md) as you go; the gaps are your to-do list."
msgstr ""
"<strong>在设计新智能体？</strong> 先阅读[智能体诞生栈](birth-"
"stack.md)，再按[诞生检查清单](lifecycle/birth.md)逐项走查。过程中填写一份[诞生档案](manifest.md)；未填的空白就是你的待办事项。"

#: docs/index.md:27
msgid ""
"**Choosing a vendor for one thing?** Go straight to the matching [provider "
"chapter](providers/README.md). Each starts with the interfaces, then a "
"comparison table."
msgstr ""
"<strong>要为某一项功能选择供应商？</strong> "
"直接查看对应的[提供方章节](providers/README.md)。每章先介绍接口，再给出对比表格。"

#: docs/index.md:28
msgid ""
"**Evaluating a standard?** The [standards map](standards/README.md) shows "
"which layer it fills and what it competes with."
msgstr ""
"<strong>在评估某项标准？</strong> [标准地图](standards/README.md)展示了它填补哪一层以及与哪些标准竞争。"

#: docs/index.md:29
msgid ""
"**Auditing an existing agent?** Use [Governance](stack/10-governance.md) and"
" [Death](lifecycle/death.md): if you cannot answer \"who can stop it, and "
"how\", start there."
msgstr ""
"<strong>在审计现有智能体？</strong> "
"使用[治理](stack/10-governance.md)和[死亡](lifecycle/death.md)章节：如果你无法回答“谁能停止它，以及如何停止”，就从这里开始。"

