#: docs/birth-stack.md:3
msgid ""
"The Birth Stack is the concept model behind this book. It answers one "
"question in ten parts:"
msgstr "诞生栈是本书背后的概念模型。它用十个部分回答一个问题："

#: docs/birth-stack.md:5
msgid ""
"What must an autonomous agent be given in order to exist and act in the "
"digital world?"
msgstr "一个自主智能体必须被赋予什么，才能在数字世界中存在并行动？"

#: docs/birth-stack.md:7
msgid ""
"Each layer is a _kind of thing an agent needs_, not a product or a protocol."
" Products and protocols live one level down, as "
"[providers](providers/README.md) and [standards](standards/README.md) that "
"satisfy a layer."
msgstr ""
"每一层是<em>智能体所需的一类事物</em>，而非某个产品或协议。产品和协议位于下一层级，作为满足某层需求的[提供方](providers/README.md)和[标准](standards/README.md)。"

