"    ID --> AU[\"3 身份验证\"]\n"
"    ID --> EC[\"5 经济身份\"]\n"
"    ID --> TR[\"9 信任\"]\n"
"    PR --> AU\n"
"    AU --> CA[\"6 能力\"]\n"
"    CO[\"4 计算资源\"] --> CA\n"
"    CO --> ME[\"7 记忆\"]\n"
"    EC --> CA\n"
"    ID --> AT[\"8 权限\"]\n"
"    AT --> CA\n"
"    AT --> EC\n"
"    CA --> TR\n"
"    AT --> GO[\"10 治理\"]\n"
"    EC --> GO\n"
"    CO --> GO\n"
"    TR --> GO\n"
"```"

#: docs/birth-stack.md:81
msgid ""
"**Identity comes first.** Nearly everything else binds to a key or an "
"identifier: an email account has an owner, a wallet has a signer, a "
"delegation has a grantee, a credential has a subject."
msgstr ""
"<strong>身份最先。</strong> "
"几乎所有其他内容都绑定到某个密钥或标识符：电子邮件账户有所有者，钱包有签名者，委托授权有受托方，凭证有主体。"

#: docs/birth-stack.md:82
msgid ""
"**Presence unlocks Authentication.** Most services still bootstrap accounts "
"through an email address or a phone number. An agent with no inbox cannot "
"finish an OAuth signup."
msgstr ""
"<strong>在线存在解锁身份验证。</strong> 大多数服务仍然通过电子邮件地址或电话号码来引导账户创建。没有收件箱的智能体无法完成 OAuth"
" 注册。"

#: docs/birth-stack.md:83
msgid ""
"**Authority gates Capabilities and Economy.** A tool or a wallet the agent "
"_has_ is not a tool or wallet it may _use_. The permission model sits above "
"both."
msgstr ""
"<strong>权限约束能力与经济。</strong> "
"智能体<em>拥有</em>的工具或钱包并不等于它可以<em>使用</em>的工具或钱包。权限模型位于两者之上。"

#: docs/birth-stack.md:84
msgid ""
"**Governance observes everything.** Audit logging, limits, and the kill "
"switch have to reach into compute, money, credentials, and trust registries "
"— which is why it is the top layer and the last one provisioned."
msgstr ""
"<strong>治理观察一切。</strong> "
"审计日志、限制和紧急停止开关必须触达计算资源、资金、凭证和信任注册表——这就是它位于最顶层、并且最后一个被配置的原因。"

