#: docs/stack/01-identity.md:35
msgid ""
"The trade-off is not subtle: the more freely the agent can sign, the harder "
"it is for the owner to recover or revoke. Provider custody with a policy "
"engine is the common middle because revocation is a single API call and the "
"owner never handles raw key material."
msgstr ""
"这一权衡并不微妙：智能体越能自由签名，所有者就越难恢复或撤销。带策略引擎的服务提供方托管是常见的折中方案，因为撤销只需一次 API "
"调用，且所有者从不接触原始密钥材料。"

