#: docs/stack/01-identity.md:56
msgid ""
"**Key on the agent host.** A prompt-injected agent with `self` custody can "
"exfiltrate its own key. Anything that signs for money should not be `self`."
msgstr ""
"<strong>密钥存放在智能体主机上。</strong> 被提示注入攻击的智能体如果采用 `self` "
"托管，可能泄露自己的密钥。任何为资金签名的密钥都不应使用 `self`。"

#: docs/stack/01-identity.md:57
msgid ""
"**`did:key` in production.** No rotation means a leaked key is a new "
"identity and every registration has to be redone."
msgstr "**在生产环境中使用 `did:key`。** 无法轮换意味着密钥一旦泄露就等于一个新身份，所有注册都必须重做。"

#: docs/stack/01-identity.md:58
msgid ""
"**Domain expiry.** A `did:web` dies with the domain. Auto-renew, and keep "
"the registrar account under the owner, not the agent (see [Domains & "
"DNS](../providers/domains.md))."
msgstr ""
"<strong>域名过期。</strong> `did:web` 随域名一同消亡。开启自动续费，并让注册商账户归所有者而非智能体（见 [域名与 "
"DNS](../providers/domains.md)）。"

#: docs/stack/01-identity.md:59
msgid ""
"**Owner is a person who leaves.** Put the owner on a role or legal entity "
"DID, not an employee's personal one; see "
"[Migration](../lifecycle/migration.md)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>所有者是会离职的个人。</strong> 将所有者设为角色或法律实体 DID，而非员工个人 DID；见 "
"[迁移](../lifecycle/migration.md)。"

#: docs/stack/01-identity.md:60
msgid ""
"**Registration drift.** The ERC-8004 card, the A2A card and the DID document"
" each list keys and endpoints. Generate all three from the manifest or they "
"will disagree."
msgstr ""
"<strong>注册信息漂移。</strong> ERC-8004 卡片、A2A 卡片和 DID "
"文档各自列出密钥和端点。请从清单生成这三者，否则它们会不一致。"

#: docs/stack/01-identity.md:61
msgid ""
"**One key for everything.** Use distinct keys for signing statements and for"
" moving funds so that revoking one does not strand the other."
msgstr "<strong>一把密钥用于所有场景。</strong> 为签署声明和转移资金使用不同的密钥，这样撤销其中一个不会使另一个失效搁浅。"

