msgid ""
"Bounded by [8. Authority](08-authority.md): scopes granted here should never"
" exceed delegations declared there."
msgstr "受 [8. 权限](08-authority.md)约束：此处授予的权限范围绝不应超过该层声明的委托授权。"

#: docs/stack/03-authentication.md:54
msgid ""
"**Secrets in the manifest or repo.** A `birth.yaml` with an API key in it is"
" an incident. Only `secretRef`."
msgstr ""
"<strong>密钥出现在清单或仓库中。</strong> 含有 API 密钥的 `birth.yaml` 就是一次安全事件。只能用 "
"`secretRef`。"

#: docs/stack/03-authentication.md:55
msgid ""
"**Owner's personal token reused.** The agent becomes indistinguishable from "
"the owner in every log; revoking it locks the owner out. Use a separate "
"grant with `act`."
msgstr ""
"<strong>复用所有者的个人令牌。</strong> 智能体在所有日志中都与所有者无法区分；吊销它会把所有者锁在门外。使用带 `act` "
"的独立授权。"

#: docs/stack/03-authentication.md:56
msgid ""
"**Scope creep.** Every OAuth prompt asks for more than needed. Request the "
"minimum and record scopes in the manifest so drift is visible."
msgstr ""
"<strong>权限范围蔓延。</strong> 每个 OAuth 提示都会索取超出需要的权限。请求最小权限，并将权限范围记录在清单中，让漂移可见。"

#: docs/stack/03-authentication.md:57
msgid ""
"**Long-lived tokens.** A leaked one-year token is a one-year breach. Prefer "
"short access tokens plus refresh in the store; set `rotation` on everything."
msgstr ""
"<strong>长期有效的令牌。</strong> 泄露一个一年期令牌就是一年的安全漏洞。优先使用短期访问令牌加存储中的刷新令牌；为所有凭证设置 "
"`rotation`。"

#: docs/stack/03-authentication.md:58
msgid ""
"**Token replay across servers.** Without resource indicators, one MCP server"
" can use the token it received against another. Insist on `resource` and "
"audience checks."
msgstr ""
"<strong>令牌跨服务器重放。</strong> 没有资源指示器，一个 MCP 服务器可以把收到的令牌用于另一个服务器。坚持使用 "
"`resource` 和受众校验。"

#: docs/stack/03-authentication.md:59
msgid ""
"**Secret store with agent-writable policy.** If the agent can grant itself "
"new secrets the store is decoration. Policy changes are an owner action."
msgstr "<strong>智能体可写策略的密钥存储。</strong> 如果智能体能给自己授予新密钥，存储就形同虚设。策略变更必须是所有者操作。"

#: docs/stack/03-authentication.md:60
msgid ""
"**Dynamic client registration abuse.** MCP clients often register on the "
"fly; make sure the authorization server binds registrations to the agent's "
"identity, not to whoever asks."
msgstr ""
"<strong>动态客户端注册滥用。</strong> MCP 客户端经常即时注册；确保授权服务器将注册绑定到智能体的身份，而不是任何发起请求者。"

