#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:3
msgid ""
"Compute is where the agent's code executes and what that execution can "
"touch: a runtime with some isolation level, optionally a browser, a network "
"policy, and disk. It is the first layer of the Action band: the agent can "
"now _do_ things, and the choices made here decide how much damage a wrong "
"action can do."
msgstr ""
"计算资源是智能体代码执行的地方，也是这些执行所能触及的范围：一个具有某种隔离级别的运行时、可选的浏览器、网络策略和磁盘。它是行动带的第一层：智能体现在可以<em>做</em>事情了，而这里做出的选择决定了一次错误行动能造成多大破坏。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:7
msgid ""
"An agent's runtime differs from a normal service in one way that dominates "
"everything else: the code path is chosen at run time by a model reading "
"untrusted input. A web page, an email or a tool result can steer the agent "
"into running a command nobody wrote. Compute therefore has to be designed as"
" if the workload were hostile, which is a different posture from deploying a"
" service whose code you reviewed. The isolation level in "
"`spec.compute.isolation` names that posture:"
msgstr ""
"智能体的运行时与普通服务的区别集中体现在一点上：代码路径是由模型在运行时读取不受信任的输入而决定的。一个网页、一封电子邮件或一个工具结果都可能引导智能体去执行没人写过的命令。因此，计算资源必须按工作负载可能怀有敌意来设计，这与部署一个你审查过代码的服务是完全不同的姿态。`spec.compute.isolation`"
" 中的隔离级别就命名了这种姿态："

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:9 docs/stack/04-compute.md:29
msgid "Isolation"
msgstr "隔离级别"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:9
msgid "What it is"
msgstr "是什么"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:9
msgid "Fine when"
msgstr "适用场景"

