msgstr ""
"受 [10. 治理](10-governance.md)控制：`suspend-runtime` 是紧急停止开关机制之一；运行时小时数是一项治理限制。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:44
msgid ""
"**Owner's laptop as production.** The agent has the owner's SSH keys, "
"browser cookies and cloud CLI sessions. One injection and it is the owner."
msgstr ""
"<strong>把所有者的笔记本电脑当生产环境。</strong>智能体拥有所有者的 SSH 密钥、浏览器 Cookie 和云 CLI "
"会话。一次注入攻击，它就成了所有者本人。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:45
msgid ""
"**Open egress.** Every leaked secret has somewhere to go. Allowlist first, "
"widen when a real call fails."
msgstr "<strong>开放出站访问。</strong>每个泄露的机密都有去处。先设白名单，等真实调用失败时再放宽。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:46
msgid ""
"**Docker socket or cloud metadata endpoint reachable.** Container isolation "
"with `/var/run/docker.sock` mounted or `169.254.169.254` open is `none` in "
"practice."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Docker socket 或云元数据端点可达。</strong>挂载了 `/var/run/docker.sock` 或开放了 "
"`169.254.169.254` 的容器隔离，实际上等同于 `none`。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:47
msgid ""
"**State hiding in a persistent runtime.** Cron jobs, cached tokens and half-"
"finished files accumulate where no memory store or audit log sees them."
msgstr "<strong>状态藏匿在持久运行时中。</strong>Cron 任务、缓存令牌和写了一半的文件在记忆存储和审计日志都看不到的地方积累。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:48
msgid ""
"**Browser sessions as forgotten credentials.** A hosted browser logged into "
"the owner's accounts outlives the task that needed it. Expire sessions, list"
" them under authentication."
msgstr ""
"<strong>浏览器会话成为被遗忘的凭证。</strong>登录了所有者账户的托管浏览器比需要它的任务活得更久。要让会话过期，并将其列入身份验证之下。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:49
msgid ""
"**Runaway compute bill.** Loops, retries and always-on sandboxes. Set "
"`maxRuntimeHoursPerDay` in `spec.governance.limits` and a provider-side "
"spend cap."
msgstr ""
"<strong>计算账单失控。</strong>循环、重试和常驻沙箱。在 `spec.governance.limits` 中设置 "
"`maxRuntimeHoursPerDay`，并在服务商侧设置支出上限。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:50
msgid ""
"**Residency.** A sandbox provider's region choice is a data-residency "
"decision the owner may be accountable for."
msgstr "<strong>数据驻留。</strong>沙箱服务商的区域选择是一项所有者可能需要负责的数据驻留决策。"

#: docs/stack/04-compute.md:54
