#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:45
msgid ""
"Depends on [1. Identity](01-identity.md): the wallet key is one of the "
"agent's keys, with the same custody choices."
msgstr "依赖[1. 身份](01-identity.md)：钱包密钥是智能体密钥之一，托管方式相同。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:46
msgid ""
"Gated by [8. Authority](08-authority.md): budgets are the economic form of a"
" delegation; over-limit is an approval."
msgstr "受[8. 权限](08-authority.md)约束：预算是委托授权的经济形式；超限即为一项审批。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:47
msgid ""
"Enables [6. Capabilities](06-capabilities.md): paid APIs and compute become "
"usable without the owner pre-registering."
msgstr "赋能[6. 能力](06-capabilities.md)：付费 API 与计算资源无需所有者预先注册即可使用。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:48
msgid ""
"Observed by [10. Governance](10-governance.md): `freeze-wallet` is a kill-"
"switch mechanism; spend is a governance limit."
msgstr "由[10. 治理](10-governance.md)监督：`freeze-wallet` 是一种紧急停止开关机制；支出是一项治理限制。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:52
msgid ""
"**Wallet key on the agent host.** Irreversible on-chain loss with no "
"chargeback. Use `provider`, `tee` or `mpc` custody for anything funded."
msgstr ""
"<strong>钱包密钥放在智能体主机上。</strong>链上损失不可逆且无法退款。凡有资金的场景请使用 `provider`、`tee` 或 "
"`mpc` 托管。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:53
msgid ""
"**Soft limits only.** The model is asked not to overspend; a prompt "
"injection asks it to. Enforce at the custodian."
msgstr "<strong>仅有软性限额。</strong>模型被要求不要超支；一次提示注入就能让它超支。请在托管方处强制执行。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:54
msgid ""
"**Owner's personal card in the agent's config.** Every agent purchase is now"
" the owner's, and the card number is a secret in plain text."
msgstr "<strong>所有者的个人银行卡写在智能体配置中。</strong>智能体的每次购买现在都算在所有者头上，且卡号以明文形式存放。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:55
msgid ""
"**Consumer virtual-card services.** ToS written for individuals; automated "
"use can close the account."
msgstr "<strong>消费级虚拟卡服务。</strong> 其服务条款面向个人用户；自动化使用可能导致账户被关闭。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:56
msgid ""
"**Chargebacks.** The issuer may hold the owner liable for agent purchases "
"nobody reviewed. Merchant allowlists on the card reduce the surface."
msgstr "<strong>拒付。</strong> 发卡方可能让所有者对无人审核的智能体购买行为承担责任。在卡上设置商户白名单可以缩小风险面。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:57
msgid ""
"**Wrong chain.** A wallet on one chain cannot pay a merchant on another "
"without a bridge, which is another custody risk. Pick the chain your "
"counterparties use."
msgstr ""
"<strong>链选错了。</strong> "
"一条链上的钱包无法在没有跨链桥的情况下向另一条链上的商户付款，而跨链桥又是另一个托管风险。请选择你的交易对手所使用的链。"

#: docs/stack/05-economy.md:58
msgid ""
"**No accounting hand-off.** Six months of x402 micropayments with no ledger "
"is a tax problem for the owner."
msgstr "<strong>没有会计交接。</strong> 六个月的 x402 微支付没有任何账本记录，对所有者来说是个税务问题。"

