msgstr "依赖 [5. 经济身份](05-economy.md)：模型调用和付费 API（x402 端点）会消耗预算。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:30
msgid ""
"Gated by [8. Authority](08-authority.md): having a tool is not permission to"
