msgstr "为 [9. 信任](09-trust.md)提供输入：来源声明（\"使用了哪个模型、哪些工具\"）是交易对方验证内容的一部分。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:35
msgid ""
"**Tool supply-chain compromise ([OWASP "
"ASI04](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-"
"applications/)).** A public MCP server or skill can be updated under you. A "
"tool description is prompt text the model reads; a malicious update can "
"redirect behaviour without touching your code. Pin versions, record `source`"
" per tool, and review descriptions as untrusted input."
msgstr ""
"<strong>工具供应链被攻陷（[OWASP ASI04](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-"
"top-10-for-agentic-applications/)）。</strong> 公共 MCP "
"服务器或技能可能在你不知情的情况下被更新。工具描述是模型会读取的提示文本；恶意更新可以在不触碰你代码的情况下改变行为。固定版本、为每个工具记录 "
"`source`，并将其描述作为不可信输入进行审查。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:36
msgid ""
"**Tool misuse (ASI02).** A legitimate `shell` or `send_email` tool with too-"
"wide arguments is the usual escalation path. Narrow the tool, not just the "
"prompt."
msgstr ""
"<strong>工具滥用（ASI02）。</strong> 参数范围过宽的合法 `shell` 或 `send_email` "
"工具是常见的提权路径。要收窄工具本身，而不只是提示词。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:37
msgid ""
"**Runaway model spend.** Direct keys with no budget cap plus a retry loop is"
" the classic first incident. Put a hard per-key limit at the gateway, not "
"only in the agent."
msgstr ""
"<strong>模型开销失控。</strong> "
"没有预算上限的直连密钥加上重试循环，是最经典的首起事故。应在网关层设置每密钥的硬性限额，而不仅仅在智能体内部。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:38
msgid ""
"**Fallback to a weaker model silently changes behaviour.** Log which model "
"served each step (see [Governance](10-governance.md)); a fallback that fires"
" at 3am should be visible in the trace."
msgstr ""
"<strong>静默回退到较弱模型会改变行为。</strong> 记录每一步由哪个模型提供服务（参见[治理](10-governance.md)）；凌晨"
" 3 点触发的回退应在追踪记录中可见。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:39
msgid ""
"**Skills as an unreviewed code path.** `SKILL.md` can bundle scripts. Treat "
"a skill install like a dependency bump with a diff review."
msgstr ""
"<strong>技能是一条未经审查的代码路径。</strong> `SKILL.md` 可以捆绑脚本。安装技能应像升级依赖一样进行差异审查。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:40
msgid ""
"**Least capability is not the default.** Frameworks ship with broad tool "
"sets enabled. The Birth Profile should list what is _on_, and that list "
"should be shorter than what is installed."
msgstr ""
"<strong>最小能力并非默认设置。</strong> "
"框架出厂时启用了大量工具。诞生档案应列出哪些是<em>开启</em>的，且该列表应短于已安装的内容。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:41
msgid ""
"**Provider ToS.** Some model providers forbid re-selling access or automated"
" account creation; a gateway account is the owner's, not the agent's."
msgstr "<strong>提供方服务条款。</strong> 一些模型提供方禁止转售访问权限或自动创建账户；网关账户属于所有者，而非智能体。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:45
msgid ""
"[Security & Governance](../standards/security-and-governance.md) - OWASP Top"
" 10 for Agentic Applications (ASI02 tool misuse, ASI04 supply chain)."
msgstr ""
"[安全与治理](../standards/security-and-governance.md) - OWASP 智能体应用十大风险（ASI02 "
"工具滥用，ASI04 供应链）。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:46
msgid ""
"[Authentication & Delegation](../standards/auth-and-delegation.md) - MCP "
"Authorization (OAuth 2.1, RFC 9728, RFC 8707) for tool servers."
msgstr ""
"[身份验证与委托授权](../standards/auth-and-delegation.md) - 适用于工具服务器的 MCP "
"Authorization（OAuth 2.1、RFC 9728、RFC 8707）。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:47
msgid ""
"[Discovery](../standards/discovery.md) - MCP Registry and how tools are "
"found and identified."
msgstr "[发现](../standards/discovery.md) - MCP Registry 以及工具如何被发现和识别。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:48
msgid ""
"[Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) - the tool-server"
