msgstr ""
"[Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/) - 工具服务器协议本身。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:49
msgid ""
"[Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io/specification) - the "
"`SKILL.md` format."
msgstr ""
"[Agent Skills 规范](https://agentskills.io/specification) - `SKILL.md` 格式。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:53
msgid ""
"[Models & Skills](../providers/models-and-skills.md) - model gateways and "
"routers, MCP registries, skill indexes."
msgstr "[模型与技能](../providers/models-and-skills.md) - 模型网关与路由器、MCP 注册表、技能索引。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:54
msgid ""
"[Credentials & Tool Auth](../providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md) - "
"brokers that hand tools scoped credentials."
msgstr ""
"[凭证与工具认证](../providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md) - 为工具分发范围受限凭证的代理商。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:55
msgid ""
"[Compute & Browsers](../providers/compute-and-browsers.md) - where CLIs and "
"MCP servers execute."
msgstr ""
"[计算资源与浏览器](../providers/compute-and-browsers.md) - CLI 和 MCP 服务器的执行环境。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:56
msgid ""
"[Observability & Human-in-the-loop](../providers/observability-and-hitl.md) "
"- tracing which tool was called with what."
msgstr "[可观测性与人在回路](../providers/observability-and-hitl.md) - 追踪哪个工具以什么参数被调用。"

#: docs/stack/06-capabilities.md:60
msgid ""
"`spec.capabilities.models[]` records `id`, `via` (the gateway, if any) and "
"`role`; `spec.capabilities.tools[]` records `name`, `kind` (`mcp | cli | "
"http | sdk | skill`) and `source`; `spec.capabilities.skills[]` lists skill "
"names. The `source` field is the supply-chain anchor: it should be a URL you"
" could pin a hash against."
msgstr ""
"`spec.capabilities.models[]` 记录 `id`、`via`（如有网关）和 "
"`role`；`spec.capabilities.tools[]` 记录 `name`、`kind`（`mcp | cli | http | sdk "
"| skill`）和 `source`；`spec.capabilities.skills[]` 列出技能名称。`source` "
"字段是供应链锚点：它应当是一个可用于固定哈希值的 URL。"

