#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:3
msgid ""
"Memory is what persists between runs. Without it, every invocation is a new "
"agent that happens to share a name; with it, the agent accumulates context, "
"learns the owner's preferences, and can pick up a task where it left off. "
"Memory is also the layer where the agent's history becomes an attack surface"
" and a data-protection liability."
msgstr ""
"记忆是在多次运行之间保持连续的内容。没有它，每次调用都会产生一个恰好同名的新智能体；有了它，智能体就能积累上下文、了解所有者的偏好，并从上次中断的地方继续任务。记忆也是智能体历史成为攻击面和数据保护隐患的一层。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:7
msgid ""
"**Five kinds of store.** _Working_ memory is the current context window and "
"scratch state; it is gone at the end of the run. _Episodic_ memory records "
"what happened: conversations, actions taken, outcomes. _Semantic_ memory "
"holds distilled facts and preferences (\"owner prefers PDFs\", \"vendor X "
"was unreliable\"). _Files_ are documents, code and artefacts the agent reads"
" and writes, typically object storage or a git repo. A _knowledge graph_ "
"links entities and relations for retrieval that vectors alone handle poorly."
" Most real agents have working memory plus one or two of the others; the "
"manifest lets you say which."
msgstr ""
"<strong>五种存储。</strong><em>工作</em>记忆是当前上下文窗口和临时状态；运行结束即消失。<em>情景</em>记忆记录发生过的事：对话、执行的操作、结果。<em>语义</em>记忆保存提炼出的事实和偏好（“所有者偏好"
" PDF”、“供应商 X 不可靠”）。<em>文件</em>是智能体读写的文档、代码和产物，通常存放于对象存储或 git "
"仓库。<em>知识图谱</em>链接实体和关系，用于向量检索难以胜任的检索场景。大多数实际的智能体拥有工作记忆加上其他一两种；清单让你能够声明具体使用哪些。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:9
msgid ""
"**Continuity is what makes it \"the same agent\".** A human has one body and"
" one continuous stream of experience. An agent is a process that gets "
"restarted, migrated, or run in several copies. What makes tomorrow's process"
" the same agent as today's is that it holds the same keys "
"([Identity](01-identity.md)) and reads the same memory. Identity is the "
"anchor; memory is the continuity. Losing the keys means nobody can prove the"
" agent is who it was; losing the memory means the agent can prove it, but no"
" longer knows what it did. Both are lifecycle events (see "
"[Migration](../lifecycle/migration.md) and [Death](../lifecycle/death.md))."
msgstr ""
"<strong>连续性使其成为“同一个智能体”。</strong>人类有一个身体和一条连续的经验流。智能体则是一个会被重启、迁移或以多个副本运行的进程。让明天的进程与今天的进程成为同一个智能体的，是它持有相同的密钥（[身份](01-identity.md)）并读取相同的记忆。身份是锚点；记忆是连续性。丢失密钥意味着无人能证明该智能体还是原来的它；丢失记忆意味着智能体能证明自己，却不再知道自己做过什么。两者都是生命周期事件（参见[迁移](../lifecycle/migration.md)和[死亡](../lifecycle/death.md)）。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:11
msgid ""
"**Portability.** Two patterns dominate. _Markdown-in-git_: memory as plain "
"files in a repository, human-readable, diffable, trivially backed up and "
"moved; the agent reads and writes it like any other file. _Vendor memory "
"APIs_: Mem0, Zep/Graphiti, Letta and similar offer extraction, "
"deduplication, temporal reasoning and retrieval that plain files do not. The"
" trade is convenience against lock-in. An agent whose memory lives in one "
"vendor's API cannot be migrated without that vendor's export path. The Birth"
" Profile records the provider so that the question is at least visible."
msgstr ""
"<strong>可移植性。</strong>两种模式占主导。<em>Markdown-in-git</em>：记忆以纯文件形式存放在仓库中，可读、可 "
"diff、易于备份和迁移；智能体像读写其他文件一样读写它。<em>供应商记忆 API</em>：Mem0、Zep/Graphiti、Letta "
"等提供纯文件所不具备的抽取、去重、时序推理和检索能力。这是便利与锁定之间的权衡。记忆存放在某供应商 API "
"中的智能体，若无该供应商的导出通道便无法迁移。诞生档案会记录服务提供方，使这个问题至少可见。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:17
msgid "Stores"
msgstr "存储"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:17
msgid "Working memory only; files on the runtime's disk"
msgstr "仅工作记忆；文件存放于运行时的磁盘上"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:17
msgid ""
"Working + episodic + semantic + files, knowledge graph where relations "
"matter"
msgstr "工作记忆 + 情景记忆 + 语义记忆 + 文件，以及关系至关重要的知识图谱"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:18
msgid "Persistence"
msgstr "持久性"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:18
msgid "Per-run, lost on restart"
msgstr "按运行周期存储，重启后丢失"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:18
msgid ""
"Durable store outside the runtime, survives [Compute](04-compute.md) "
"replacement"
msgstr "运行时之外的持久存储，可在[计算资源](04-compute.md)替换后继续存留"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:19
msgid "Retention"
msgstr "保留策略"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:19
msgid "Undefined"
msgstr "未定义"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:19
msgid ""
"Per-store retention (ISO 8601 duration or `forever`), enforced by deletion "
"jobs"
msgstr "按存储设定保留期限（ISO 8601 时长或 `forever`），由删除任务强制执行"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:20
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "加密"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:20
msgid "Provider default"
msgstr "服务提供方默认设置"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:20
msgid ""
"Encryption at rest with keys the owner controls; separate keys per agent"
msgstr "静态加密，密钥由所有者控制；每个智能体使用独立密钥"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:21
msgid "Integrity"
msgstr "完整性"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:21
msgid ""
"Writes attributed to a source (tool, user, owner) and traced; untrusted-"
"origin content quarantined before promotion to semantic memory"
msgstr "写入操作归属到来源（工具、用户、所有者）并可追溯；来自不可信来源的内容在提升为语义记忆前先隔离"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:22
msgid "Portability"
msgstr "可移植性"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:22
msgid "Vendor format"
msgstr "供应商专有格式"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:22
msgid "Exportable to plain files; markdown-in-git or a documented export"
msgstr "可导出为纯文件；git 中的 markdown 或有文档说明的导出格式"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:23
msgid "Deletion"
msgstr "删除"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:23
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:23
msgid ""
"Owner-triggered purge across all stores, verified in the [audit "
"log](10-governance.md)"
msgstr "由所有者触发对所有存储的清除，并在[审计日志](10-governance.md)中验证"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:27
msgid ""
"Depends on [4. Compute](04-compute.md) for the storage the stores live on, "
"and on [1. Identity](01-identity.md) for the key that scopes and encrypts "
"the agent's memory."
msgstr ""
"依赖 [4. 计算资源](04-compute.md) 提供存储所在的介质，以及 [1. 身份](01-identity.md) "
"提供用于限定范围并加密智能体记忆的密钥。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:28
msgid ""
"Depends on [3. Authentication](03-authentication.md) for the credential to a"
" hosted memory provider."
msgstr "依赖 [3. 身份验证](03-authentication.md) 提供访问托管记忆服务提供方的凭证。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:29
msgid ""
"Enables [6. Capabilities](06-capabilities.md) to be used well: tools without"
" memory of past results repeat mistakes."
msgstr "使 [6. 能力](06-capabilities.md) 得以有效使用：不记得过往结果的工具会重复犯错。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:30
msgid ""
"Governed by [10. Governance](10-governance.md): retention, deletion and "
"audit obligations are enforced here."
msgstr "受 [10. 治理](10-governance.md) 管辖：保留、删除和审计义务在此层强制执行。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:34
msgid ""
"**Memory poisoning ([OWASP ASI06](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-"
"top-10-for-agentic-applications/)).** A web page or email the agent reads "
"today becomes a \"fact\" it acts on for months. Anything written to semantic"
" memory from untrusted input needs a provenance tag and, ideally, a review "
"gate before it influences future decisions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>记忆投毒（[OWASP ASI06](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-"
"top-10-for-agentic-applications/)）。</strong> "
"智能体今天读到的一个网页或邮件，会变成它此后数月据以行动的“事实”。任何从不可信输入写入语义记忆的内容都需要来源标签，且理想情况下在影响未来决策前设置审核关卡。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:35
msgid ""
"**Secrets leaking into memory.** Episodic logs will happily store an API key"
" that appeared in a tool result. Scrub before write; keep secrets in the "
"[secret store](03-authentication.md), never in memory."
msgstr ""
"<strong>密钥泄漏到记忆中。</strong> 情景日志会毫不犹豫地存下出现在工具结果中的 API "
"密钥。写入前先清洗；密钥应保存在[密钥存储](03-authentication.md)中，绝不放入记忆。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:36
msgid ""
"**Personal data and deletion obligations.** If the agent talks to people, "
"its episodic memory contains personal data. GDPR-style erasure requests must"
" reach every store, including vector indexes and graph nodes, not just the "
"primary database."
msgstr ""
"<strong>个人数据与删除义务。</strong> 如果智能体与人交互，其情景记忆中就包含个人数据。GDPR "
"式的删除请求必须触达每一个存储，包括向量索引和图节点，而不仅仅是主数据库。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:37
msgid ""
"**Retention drift.** `forever` is the default nobody chose. Set a retention "
"per store and make the deletion job observable."
msgstr "<strong>保留期漂移。</strong> `forever` 是没有人主动选择的默认值。请为每个存储设置保留期，并使删除任务可观测。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:38
msgid ""
"**Encryption at rest by whom.** Provider-managed encryption protects against"
" a lost disk, not against the provider. Owner-held keys change the threat "
"model and the recovery story ([Governance](10-governance.md))."
msgstr ""
"<strong>由谁进行静态加密。</strong> "
"服务商托管的加密可防范磁盘丢失，却防不了服务商本身。所有者持有密钥会改变威胁模型和恢复方案（[治理](10-governance.md)）。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:39
msgid ""
"**Memory shared across agents.** A shared store makes one poisoned agent "
"poison the fleet, and makes per-agent deletion impossible. Scope stores per "
"agent unless sharing is the point."
msgstr ""
"<strong>跨智能体共享记忆。</strong> "
"共享存储会让一个被投毒的智能体污染整个集群，也使按智能体删除变得不可能。除非共享正是目的，否则请按智能体划分存储范围。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:40
msgid ""
"**Losing memory on migration.** Moving runtime without moving the store "
"leaves a functioning agent that has forgotten everything; test the export "
"path before you need it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>迁移时丢失记忆。</strong> 只迁移运行时而不迁移存储，会留下一个功能正常却忘掉一切的智能体；请在需要之前先测试导出路径。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:44
msgid ""
"[Security & Governance](../standards/security-and-governance.md) - OWASP "
"ASI06 memory and context poisoning; OWASP Agentic AI Threats & Mitigations."
msgstr ""
"[安全与治理](../standards/security-and-governance.md) - OWASP ASI06 "
"记忆与上下文投毒；OWASP Agentic AI Threats & Mitigations。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:45
msgid ""
"[Identity](../standards/identity.md) - why the key, not the memory, is the "
"continuity anchor."
msgstr "[身份](../standards/identity.md) - 为什么连续性的锚点是密钥而不是记忆。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:46
msgid ""
"There is no memory-format standard yet; the [Agent "
"Skills](https://agentskills.io/) folder convention and markdown-in-git are "
"the closest to a portable de facto format."
msgstr ""
"目前尚无记忆格式标准；[Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) 的文件夹约定与 markdown-in-git "
"是最接近可移植事实标准的方案。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:50
msgid ""
"[Memory & Storage](../providers/memory-and-storage.md) - Mem0, Zep/Graphiti,"
" Letta, LangGraph persistence, vector databases, object storage, the "
"markdown-vault pattern."
msgstr ""
"[记忆与存储](../providers/memory-and-storage.md) - "
"Mem0、Zep/Graphiti、Letta、LangGraph 持久化、向量数据库、对象存储、markdown-vault 模式。"

#: docs/stack/07-memory.md:51
msgid ""
"[Compute & Browsers](../providers/compute-and-browsers.md) - runtimes whose "
"disks are or are not durable."
