#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:3
msgid ""
"Authority is what the agent _may_ do, on whose behalf, how far it may pass "
"that permission on, and which actions must stop for a human. It is distinct "
"from every layer below it: a wallet is Economic Identity, a tool is a "
"Capability, a credential is Authentication. None of those is permission. "
"Authority is the permission."
msgstr ""
"权限是指智能体<em>可以</em>做什么、代表谁行事、可以将该许可传递多远，以及哪些操作必须停下来交由人来处理。它有别于其下的每一层：钱包属于经济身份，工具属于能力，凭证属于身份验证。这些都不是许可。权限才是许可本身。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:7
msgid ""
"**A principal.** Every agent acts for someone: a person, a company, or "
"another agent that itself acts for one of those. The principal is the party "
"whose intent the agent is executing and who is accountable for the result. "
"It is usually but not always the owner in `metadata.owner`; a contractor's "
"agent may be owned by the contractor and act for the client. The manifest "
"separates the two on purpose."
msgstr ""
"<strong>主体。</strong> "
"每个智能体都为某人行事：一个人、一家公司，或另一个本身为前两者行事的智能体。主体是智能体所执行意图的归属方，并对结果负责。主体通常但不总是 "
"`metadata.owner` 中的所有者；承包商的智能体可能由承包商所有，却为客户行事。清单有意将两者分开。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:9
msgid ""
"**Delegations that are scoped, expiring, and attenuating.** A delegation is "
"a grant from a principal to the agent: \"you may read the web\", \"you may "
"spend up to 2 USD per x402 call until next September\". Three properties "
"make a delegation safe. _Scoped_: it names an action and a bound, not a "
"role. _Expiring_: it has an end date, so a forgotten agent loses power by "
"default. _Attenuating_: anything the agent passes to a sub-agent must be a "
"strict subset of what it holds. The manifest expresses the last with "
"`canSubDelegate` and `maxDelegationDepth`; `depth: 0` means \"you may act "
"but never delegate\", `depth: 1` means \"one hop, and your sub-agents get "
"nothing further\"."
msgstr ""
"<strong>具备限定范围、会过期且逐级收窄的委托授权。</strong> "
"委托授权是主体授予智能体的许可：\"你可以读取网页\"、\"你可以在明年九月之前每次 x402 调用最多花费 2 "
"USD\"。三个属性使委托授权安全。<em>限定范围</em>：它指明一个动作和一个上限，而不是一个角色。<em>会过期</em>：它有结束日期，因此被遗忘的智能体默认会失去权力。<em>逐级收窄</em>：智能体传递给子智能体的任何权限都必须是其自身所持权限的严格子集。清单用"
" `canSubDelegate` 和 `maxDelegationDepth` 表达最后一点；`depth: 0` "
"表示\"你可以行动但绝不能委托\"，`depth: 1` 表示\"可以传递一跳，且你的子智能体不能再往下传递\"。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:11
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    H[\"Human principal<br/><small>full authority over own accounts</small>\"]\n"
"    A[\"Agent<br/><small>read:web · send:email:owner-only · pay:x402 ≤ 2 USD<br/>expires 2027-09 · depth 1</small>\"]\n"
"    S[\"Sub-agent<br/><small>read:web only<br/>expires end of task · depth 0</small>\"]\n"
"    H -- \"delegation (scoped, expiring)\" --> A\n"
"    A -- \"attenuated sub-delegation\" --> S\n"
"    S -. \"cannot delegate further\" .-> X[\"(none)\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    H[\"人类主体<br/><small>对自己账户拥有完全权限</small>\"]\n"
"    A[\"智能体<br/><small>read:web · send:email:owner-only · pay:x402 ≤ 2 USD<br/>2027-09 到期 · depth 1</small>\"]\n"
"    S[\"子智能体<br/><small>仅 read:web<br/>任务结束时到期 · depth 0</small>\"]\n"
"    H -- \"委托授权（限定范围、会过期）\" --> A\n"
"    A -- \"收窄后的再委托\" --> S\n"
"    S -. \"不能继续委托\" .-> X[\"（无）\"]\n"
"```"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:21
msgid ""
"**Approvals.** Some actions should never be pre-authorised: first payment to"
" a new counterparty, any external email, deleting data, deploying to "
"production. Human-in-the-loop for _named actions_ is what `approvals[]` "
"describes: the action pattern, who approves, and the channel where the "
"request appears. This is different from \"ask before everything\" (which "
"trains the human to click yes) and from \"never ask\" (which is how agents "
"make the news). Frameworks from [Capabilities](06-capabilities.md) implement"
" the pause; the Birth Profile records the policy."
msgstr ""
"<strong>审批。</strong> "
"有些操作绝不应被预先授权：向新交易对手的首次付款、任何外部邮件、删除数据、部署到生产环境。针对<em>指定操作</em>的人在回路正是 "
"`approvals[]` "
"所描述的内容：操作模式、审批人，以及请求出现的渠道。这既不同于\"事事先问\"（会让人习惯性点击同意），也不同于\"从不询问\"（那正是智能体上新闻的方式）。[能力](06-capabilities.md)中的框架实现暂停机制；诞生档案记录该策略。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:23
msgid ""
"**Capability-based versus role-based.** Role-based access (\"this agent is "
"an _editor_\") is what most SaaS and IAM systems offer, and it is how the "
"agent's [credentials](03-authentication.md) are usually issued. Capability-"
"based access (UCAN, ZCAP-LD) instead hands the agent a signed token that "
"_is_ the permission, attenuable and delegable offline. Capabilities map "
"naturally onto agent-to-sub-agent chains; roles map onto the systems the "
"agent talks to. In practice you translate: the owner's role in a system is "
"turned into a narrower capability the agent holds. Do not give the agent the"
" owner's role."
msgstr ""
"<strong>基于能力与基于角色的对比。</strong> 基于角色的访问控制（\"这个智能体是<em>编辑者</em>\"）是大多数 SaaS 和 "
"IAM 系统提供的方式，智能体的[凭证](03-authentication.md)通常也是这样签发的。基于能力的访问控制（UCAN、ZCAP-"
"LD）则是向智能体交付一个签名令牌，该令牌本身<em>就是</em>权限，可离线收窄和委托。能力天然映射到智能体到子智能体的链条；角色则映射到智能体所交互的系统。实践中你需要转换：将所有者在某系统中的角色转化为智能体持有的更窄能力。不要把所有者的角色直接给智能体。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:29
msgid "Principal"
msgstr "主体"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:29
