#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:32
msgid "Human reads the log afterwards"
msgstr "人类事后阅读日志"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:32
msgid ""
"Named actions block on an approver via a defined channel (Slack, email, HITL"
" tool)"
msgstr "指定操作会阻塞，等待审批人通过既定渠道（Slack、邮件、HITL 工具）批准"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:33
msgid "Enforcement"
msgstr "强制执行"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:33
msgid "Prompt instructions"
msgstr "提示词指令"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:33
msgid ""
"Enforced outside the model: gateway policy, wallet policy engine, tool "
"allowlist"
msgstr "在模型之外强制执行：网关策略、钱包策略引擎、工具白名单"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:34
msgid "Token model"
msgstr "令牌模型"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:34
msgid "Static API keys inheriting owner's role"
msgstr "继承所有者角色的静态 API 密钥"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:34
msgid ""
"Scoped, short-lived tokens (RFC 8693 exchange, txn tokens) or object "
"capabilities"
msgstr "限定范围的短期令牌（RFC 8693 交换、txn 令牌）或对象能力"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:38
msgid ""
"Depends on [1. Identity](01-identity.md): a delegation is a signed "
"statement, and the grantee is the agent's key."
msgstr "依赖[1. 身份](01-identity.md)：委托授权是一份签名声明，被授权方即智能体的密钥。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:39
msgid ""
"Gates [5. Economic Identity](05-economy.md): the budget is enforced here; "
"the wallet just holds the money."
msgstr "关联 [5. 经济身份](05-economy.md)：预算在此层强制执行；钱包只是存放资金。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:40
msgid ""
"Gates [6. Capabilities](06-capabilities.md): the tool list is the possible; "
"delegations are the permitted."
msgstr "关联 [6. 能力](06-capabilities.md)：工具列表是可能做的；委托授权是被允许做的。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:41
msgid ""
"Feeds [10. Governance](10-governance.md): revoking delegations is one arm of"
" the kill switch, and approvals produce audit entries."
msgstr "输入 [10. 治理](10-governance.md)：撤销委托授权是紧急停止开关的一环，审批会产生审计记录。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:45
msgid ""
"**\"Has a wallet\" mistaken for \"may spend\".** A funded wallet with no "
"policy engine is unlimited authority. Put the limit in the wallet provider's"
" policy or a co-signer, not only in the prompt."
msgstr ""
"<strong>把\"有钱包\"误认为\"可以花钱\"。</strong> "
"一个有资金却没有策略引擎的钱包等于无限权限。把限额放在钱包服务方的策略或联合签名者中，而不能只写在提示词里。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:46
msgid ""
"**Inheriting the owner's role.** An OAuth grant with the owner's full scopes"
" turns the agent into the owner. Ask for the minimum scopes and use token "
"exchange to narrow further per task."
msgstr ""
"<strong>继承所有者的角色。</strong> 一个拥有所有者全部权限范围的 OAuth "
"授权会让智能体变成所有者本人。应申请最小权限范围，并使用令牌交换按任务进一步收窄。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:47
msgid ""
"**Scope creep through convenience.** Each new task adds a permission; none "
"are removed. Expiry dates and a [review cadence](10-governance.md) are the "
"countermeasure."
msgstr ""
"<strong>因图省事导致的权限蔓延。</strong> "
"每个新任务都增加一项权限，却从不移除。对策是设置过期时间和[定期审查机制](10-governance.md)。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:48
msgid ""
"**Delegation without attenuation.** A sub-agent that receives the parent's "
"whole token can do everything the parent can. Enforce subset checks in the "
"orchestrator or use capability tokens that make attenuation structural."
msgstr ""
"<strong>委托授权而不做权限收窄。</strong> "
"收到父级完整令牌的子智能体可以做父级能做的一切。应在编排器中强制执行子集检查，或使用让权限收窄成为结构性约束的能力令牌。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:49
msgid ""
"**Approval fatigue.** Too many approval prompts and the human stops reading "
"them. Approve _classes_ of action rarely; tune the list."
msgstr ""
"<strong>审批疲劳。</strong> 审批提示太多，人就不再认真阅读。应少量审批某些<em>类别</em>的操作；持续调优审批清单。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:50
msgid ""
"**Prompt-only enforcement.** Instructions are advisory; goal hijack ([OWASP "
"ASI01](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-"
"applications/)) bypasses them. Authority must be enforced by something the "
"model cannot talk its way past."
msgstr ""
"<strong>仅靠提示词强制执行。</strong> 指令只是建议性的；目标劫持（[OWASP "
"ASI01](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-"
"applications/)）会绕过它们。权限必须由模型无法用言语绕过的机制来强制执行。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:51
msgid ""
"**Confused deputy between agents.** Agent B acting on a request from Agent A"
" must act with A's authority, not its own broader authority. Transaction "
"tokens and `act` claims exist to carry this."
msgstr ""
"<strong>智能体之间的混淆代理人问题。</strong> 智能体 B 在响应智能体 A 的请求时，必须以 A "
"的权限行事，而不是使用自己更宽的权限。事务令牌和 `act` 声明正是为承载这一点而存在的。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:55
msgid ""
"[Authentication & Delegation](../standards/auth-and-delegation.md) - [RFC "
"8693 Token Exchange](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8693) (`act` claim "
"for delegation chains); [Transaction Tokens for "
"agents](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-oauth-transaction-tokens-for-"
"agents/); [OAuth On-Behalf-Of for AI "
"agents](https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-oauth-ai-agents-on-behalf-of-"
"user-00.html); [RFC 9635 GNAP](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9635)."
msgstr ""
"[身份验证与委托授权](../standards/auth-and-delegation.md) - [RFC 8693 Token "
"Exchange](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8693)（用于委托授权链的 `act` "
"声明）；[面向智能体的事务令牌](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-oauth-transaction-"
"tokens-for-agents/)；[面向 AI 智能体的 OAuth On-Behalf-"
"Of](https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-oauth-ai-agents-on-behalf-of-"
"user-00.html)；[RFC 9635 GNAP](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9635)。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:56
msgid ""
"[UCAN](https://github.com/ucan-wg/spec) and [ZCAP-"
"LD](https://w3c-ccg.github.io/zcap-spec/) - object-capability tokens with "
"built-in attenuation and delegation chains."
msgstr ""
"[UCAN](https://github.com/ucan-wg/spec) 和 [ZCAP-"
"LD](https://w3c-ccg.github.io/zcap-spec/) - 内置权限收窄和委托授权链的对象能力令牌。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:57
msgid ""
"[Payments](../standards/payments.md) - AP2 mandates and Visa/Mastercard "
"agent tokens as payment-specific authority grants."
msgstr ""
"[支付](../standards/payments.md) - AP2 授权指令以及 Visa/Mastercard "
"智能体令牌，作为专用于支付的权限授予。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:58
msgid ""
"[Security & Governance](../standards/security-and-governance.md) - OWASP "
"ASI03 identity and privilege abuse; CSA Agentic AI IAM."
msgstr ""
"[安全与治理](../standards/security-and-governance.md) - OWASP ASI03 身份与特权滥用；CSA "
"Agentic AI IAM。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:62
msgid ""
"[Credentials & Tool Auth](../providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md) - "
"brokers that issue scoped tokens per tool."
msgstr ""
"[凭证与工具认证](../providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md) - 为每个工具签发限定范围令牌的代理服务。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:63
msgid ""
"[Wallets & Keys](../providers/wallets.md) - policy engines and co-signers "
"that enforce spend authority."
msgstr "[钱包与密钥](../providers/wallets.md) - 强制执行支出权限的策略引擎和联合签名者。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:64
msgid ""
"[Observability & Human-in-the-loop](../providers/observability-and-hitl.md) "
"- HumanLayer, gotoHuman and similar for the approvals channel."
msgstr ""
"[可观测性与人在回路](../providers/observability-and-hitl.md) - HumanLayer、gotoHuman "
"等审批渠道方案。"

#: docs/stack/08-authority.md:68
msgid ""
"`spec.authority.principal` names who the agent acts for. "
"`spec.authority.delegations[]` carries `scope`, `grantedBy`, `expires`, "
"`canSubDelegate` and `maxDelegationDepth`. `spec.authority.approvals[]` "
"carries `action`, `approver` and `channel`. Scopes are free-form strings "
"today; use a consistent `verb:object:bound` shape so they can be compared."
msgstr ""
"`spec.authority.principal` 指明智能体代表谁行事。`spec.authority.delegations[]` 包含 "
"`scope`、`grantedBy`、`expires`、`canSubDelegate` 和 "
"`maxDelegationDepth`。`spec.authority.approvals[]` 包含 `action`、`approver` 和 "
"`channel`。目前作用域是自由格式字符串；请使用一致的 `verb:object:bound` 形式以便进行比较。"

