#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:3
msgid ""
"Trust is why a stranger should believe the agent is what it says it is, is "
"run by whom it says, and is allowed to do what it is attempting. Identity "
"([layer 1](01-identity.md)) gives the agent a name and a key; Trust gives "
"third parties reasons to accept them: signed credentials, attestations from "
"the owner and the operator, reputation history, and Know-Your-Agent (KYA) "
"checks that a counterparty can run before dealing."
msgstr ""
"信任回答的是：陌生方为何应该相信这个智能体确实是它所声称的身份、由它所声称的主体运行、并被允许执行它正在尝试的操作。身份（[第 1 "
"层](01-identity.md)）赋予智能体名称和密钥；信任则给第三方接受它们的理由：签名的凭证、来自所有者和运营方的证明、声誉历史，以及交易对手在往来前可执行的"
" Know-Your-Agent（KYA）检查。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:7
msgid ""
"**Someone else's signature.** An agent can assert anything about itself; a "
"self-signed claim is worth exactly the cost of the signature. Trust is built"
" from statements made by parties the counterparty already trusts. The first "
"and cheapest is an _owner attestation_: the owner's DID signs \"this key "
"belongs to my agent, I am responsible for it\". Above that sit _issuer-"
"signed verifiable credentials_ (W3C VC 2.0) from a KYA provider, an "
"employer, a payments network, or a registry that has done some verification."
" Above that again, _on-chain reputation_ via ERC-8004's Identity, Reputation"
" and Validation registries lets anyone check feedback and validations about "
"an agent without a central party. Different counterparties want different "
"rungs; a website may accept a signed agent card, a payment processor will "
"want a KYA credential."
msgstr ""
"<strong>他人的签名。</strong> "
"智能体可以对自己做出任何断言；自签名声明的价值恰好等于签名的成本。信任建立在交易对手已经信任的各方所做的陈述之上。第一层也是成本最低的是 "
"<em>所有者证明</em>：由所有者的 DID 签署\"此密钥属于我的智能体，我对其负责\"。其上是来自 KYA "
"提供方、雇主、支付网络或已完成某些核验的注册机构签发的 <em>签名可验证凭证</em>（W3C VC 2.0）。再往上，通过 ERC-8004 的 "
"Identity、Reputation 和 Validation 注册表实现的 "
"<em>链上声誉</em>，让任何人无需中心化机构即可查验关于某个智能体的反馈与验证记录。不同的交易对手要求不同的层级；网站可能接受签名的智能体卡片，而支付处理方则会要求"
" KYA 凭证。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:9
msgid ""
"**Provenance.** \"Which model, which operator, which version\" is part of "
"trust because it is what the counterparty's risk model actually cares about."
" A signed A2A Agent Card at `/.well-known/agent-card.json` states "
"capabilities, endpoints and auth schemes and can carry a JWS signature from "
"the operator; an ERC-8004 registration points to the same card and anchors "
"it to an on-chain identity. AIMS and the Agent Passport Standard add "
"declared boundaries and provenance chains. None of these prove the agent "
"will behave; they prove who to hold accountable if it does not."
msgstr ""
"<strong>来源。</strong> \"哪个模型、哪个运营方、哪个版本\"之所以是信任的一部分，是因为这正是交易对手的风险模型真正关心的内容。位于"
" `/.well-known/agent-card.json` 的签名 A2A Agent Card 声明能力、端点和认证方案，并可携带运营方的 JWS"
" 签名；ERC-8004 注册项指向同一张卡片，并将其锚定到链上身份。AIMS 和 Agent Passport Standard "
"增加了声明的边界和来源链。这些都不能证明智能体会规矩行事；它们证明的是一旦出事该向谁追责。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:11
msgid ""
"**Revocation.** A credential that cannot be revoked is a liability, not an "
"asset. If the agent's key is compromised, the owner changes, or the operator"
" is de-listed, every relying party needs a way to find out. Status lists, "
"registry flags and short expiry are the mechanisms; the [kill "
"switch](10-governance.md) has to reach them. Trust that cannot be withdrawn "
"is the wrong shape."
msgstr ""
"<strong>吊销。</strong> "
"无法吊销的凭证是负债，而非资产。如果智能体的密钥被泄露、所有者变更或运营方被除名，每个依赖方都需要一种途径获知此事。状态列表、注册表标记和短有效期是相应机制；[紧急停止开关](10-governance.md)必须能够触达它们。无法收回的信任是错误的形态。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:13
msgid ""
"**Trust is not authority.** [Authority](08-authority.md) is inward-facing: "
"what the owner has permitted the agent to do. Trust is outward-facing: what "
"a counterparty is willing to believe. An agent can have full authority to "
"spend and no trust (a fresh key with money), or wide trust and no authority "
"(a well-known agent whose owner revoked its budget). Counterparties check "
"trust; the owner enforces authority; a KYA check often verifies both, which "
"is why they are easy to confuse."
msgstr ""
"<strong>信任不是权限。</strong> "
"[权限](08-authority.md)朝向内部：所有者允许智能体做什么。信任朝向外部：交易对手愿意相信什么。一个智能体可以拥有完整的支出权限却毫无信任（一把持有资金的新密钥），也可以拥有广泛信任却没有权限（一个知名智能体，但其所有者已撤销其预算）。交易对手检查信任；所有者执行权限；KYA"
" 检查通常两者都核验，这正是二者容易混淆的原因。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:15
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"    %% \"i18n\"\n"
"    participant C as Counterparty\n"
"    participant A as Agent\n"
"    participant V as Verifier (KYA)\n"
"    participant R as Issuer / Registry\n"
"    C->>A: Request: prove who you are and who runs you\n"
"    A->>C: Presents agent card + owner attestation + KYA credential\n"
"    C->>V: Verify presentation\n"
"    V->>R: Check issuer key, registry entry, revocation status\n"
"    R-->>V: Valid / revoked / unknown\n"
"    V-->>C: Verification result + provenance (operator, model, scopes)\n"
"    C->>A: Proceed within accepted scope, or decline\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"    %% \"i18n\"\n"
"    participant C as 交易对手\n"
"    participant A as 智能体\n"
"    participant V as 验证方（KYA）\n"
"    participant R as 签发方 / 注册表\n"
"    C->>A: 请求：证明你是谁以及谁在运营你\n"
"    A->>C: 出示智能体卡片 + 所有者证明 + KYA 凭证\n"
"    C->>V: 验证出示内容\n"
"    V->>R: 检查签发方密钥、注册表条目、吊销状态\n"
"    R-->>V: 有效 / 已吊销 / 未知\n"
"    V-->>C: 验证结果 + 来源（运营方、模型、作用域）\n"
"    C->>A: 在认可的范围内继续，或拒绝\n"
"```"

