msgstr "依赖 [1. 身份](01-identity.md)：每个凭证都关于一个主体密钥；每个证明都是对它的签名。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:45
msgid ""
"Depends on [2. Presence](02-presence.md): the agent card, the owner "
"attestation and the credential URLs live on the agent's domain."
msgstr "依赖 [2. 在线存在](02-presence.md)：智能体卡片、所有者证明和凭证 URL 位于智能体的域名上。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:46
msgid ""
"Reflects [6. Capabilities](06-capabilities.md) and [8. "
"Authority](08-authority.md): a KYA credential typically states which model, "
"tools and scopes the operator vouches for."
msgstr ""
"反映 [6. 能力](06-capabilities.md) 和 [8. 权限](08-authority.md)：KYA "
"凭证通常声明运营方为哪个模型、哪些工具和作用域背书。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:47
msgid ""
"Feeds [10. Governance](10-governance.md): revocation is part of the kill "
"switch, and reputation feedback belongs in the review cycle."
msgstr "输入到 [10. 治理](10-governance.md)：吊销是紧急停止开关的一部分，声誉反馈则属于审查周期。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:51
msgid ""
"**Self-attestation dressed as verification.** A card the agent publishes "
"about itself proves the agent controls a domain, nothing more. Ask who "
"signed it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>伪装成验证的自我证明。</strong> 智能体发布的关于自身的卡片只能证明该智能体控制某个域名，仅此而已。要问是谁签的名。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:52
msgid ""
"**Trust with no revocation path.** A long-lived VC with no status list keeps"
" working after the agent is retired. Short expiry plus a status mechanism, "
"always."
msgstr "<strong>没有吊销路径的信任。</strong> 没有状态列表的长效 VC 在智能体退役后仍然有效。务必使用短有效期加状态机制。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:53
msgid ""
"**Human-agent trust exploitation ([OWASP "
"ASI09](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-"
"applications/)).** A convincing agent card is also a phishing kit. Verifiers"
" should check the issuer, not the design."
msgstr ""
"<strong>人类对智能体的信任被利用（[OWASP ASI09](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-"
"top-10-for-agentic-applications/)）。</strong> "
"一张有说服力的智能体卡片也可以是钓鱼工具包。验证方应检查签发者，而不是外观设计。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:54
msgid ""
"**Reputation is gameable.** On-chain feedback can be bought; treat "
"reputation as one input weighted by who gave it, not as a score."
msgstr "<strong>声誉可被操纵。</strong> 链上反馈可以被购买；应将声誉视为按提供者权重加权的一项输入，而非绝对分数。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:55
msgid ""
"**Conflating KYA with KYC.** KYA verifies the agent and its operator; it "
"does not make the agent a legal person. Payment rails still require a KYC'd "
"human or entity behind it (see [Accounts & Legal "
"Entity](../providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md))."
msgstr ""
"<strong>混淆 KYA 与 KYC。</strong> KYA 验证智能体及其运营方；它不会使智能体成为法律主体。支付通道仍要求其背后有经过 "
"KYC 的人或实体（参见[账户与法律实体](../providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md)）。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:56
msgid ""
"**Provenance rot.** The card says one model; the "
"[gateway](06-capabilities.md) fell back to another. Keep the card generated "
"from the manifest, not hand-edited."
msgstr ""
"<strong>来源腐化。</strong> "
"卡片声明的是一个模型；而[网关](06-capabilities.md)已回退到另一个模型。卡片应由清单生成，而非手工编辑。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:57
msgid ""
"**Registry lock-in.** An identity registered only in one registry is only as"
" trusted as that registry's future. Register in more than one where it costs"
" little."
msgstr ""
"<strong>注册表锁定。</strong> 仅在一个注册表中注册的身份，其可信度取决于该注册表的未来。在成本较低的情况下，应在多个注册表中注册。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:61
msgid ""
"[Identity](../standards/identity.md) - [W3C VC Data Model "
"2.0](https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model-2.0/); [ERC-8004 Trustless "
"Agents](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-8004) (Identity, Reputation, "
"Validation registries); [A2A Agent Card](https://a2a-protocol.org/) with JWS"
" signatures; Agent Passport Standard; AIMS; DIF KYA-OS."
msgstr ""
"[身份](../standards/identity.md) - [W3C VC Data Model "
"2.0](https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model-2.0/)；[ERC-8004 Trustless "
"Agents](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-8004)（Identity、Reputation、Validation"
" 注册表）；带 JWS 签名的 [A2A Agent Card](https://a2a-protocol.org/)；Agent Passport "
"Standard；AIMS；DIF KYA-OS。"

