#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:64
msgid ""
"[Security & Governance](../standards/security-and-governance.md) - OWASP "
"ASI09; [Know Your Agent (AgentFacts)](https://agentfacts.org/kya/)."
msgstr ""
"[安全与治理](../standards/security-and-governance.md) - OWASP ASI09；[Know Your "
"Agent (AgentFacts)](https://agentfacts.org/kya/)。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:68
msgid ""
"[Payments & Cards](../providers/payments-and-cards.md) - Skyfire (KYAPay) "
"and other KYA-backed payment identities."
msgstr ""
"[支付与卡](../providers/payments-and-cards.md) - Skyfire（KYAPay）及其他基于 KYA 的支付身份。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:69
msgid ""
"[Wallets & Keys](../providers/wallets.md) - key custody that lets the agent "
