msgstr "[域名与 DNS](../providers/domains.md) - well-known 卡片和凭证 URL 的托管位置。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:71
msgid ""
"[Accounts & Legal Entity](../providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md) - the "
