msgstr "[账户与法律实体](../providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md) - 所有者证明背后的法律主体。"

#: docs/stack/09-trust.md:75
msgid ""
"`spec.trust.credentials[]` lists held credentials by `type`, `issuer` and "
"`url`; `spec.trust.reputation[]` points to registries by `registry` and "
"`id`; `spec.trust.kya` names the KYA provider or level. The corresponding "
