msgstr "在模型网关设置预算上限"

#: docs/stack/10-governance.md:32
msgid ""
"Spend + rate + runtime + blast-radius limits, each enforced at its own layer"
msgstr "支出、速率、运行时长和影响范围限额，各自在对应层级强制执行"

#: docs/stack/10-governance.md:33
msgid "Kill switch"
msgstr "紧急停止开关"

#: docs/stack/10-governance.md:33
msgid "Owner can revoke the API key"
msgstr "所有者可以吊销 API 密钥"

#: docs/stack/10-governance.md:33
msgid ""
"Single control reaching compute, credentials, wallet and registries; tested "
