msgstr "所有者持有清单的备份"

#: docs/stack/10-governance.md:34
msgid ""
"Documented key rotation, successor owner, second custody share, rehearsed "
"migration"
msgstr "书面记录的密钥轮换、继任所有者、第二份托管份额、经过演练的迁移"

#: docs/stack/10-governance.md:35
msgid "Review"
msgstr "审查"

#: docs/stack/10-governance.md:35
