#: docs/standards/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Standards are the second way a Birth Stack layer gets satisfied; "
"[providers](../providers/README.md) are the first. This section lists the "
"specs, drafts and frameworks that an agent's Birth Profile can point at, "
"grouped by the problem they solve rather than by who publishes them. "
"Birthbook does not compete with any of them; it records which ones an agent "
"was born with."
msgstr ""
"标准是满足诞生栈某一层的第二种方式；[诞生服务提供方](../providers/README.md)是第一种。本节列出智能体的诞生档案可以引用的规范、草案和框架，按其解决的问题而非发布者分组。Birthbook"
" 不与其中任何一个竞争；它只记录智能体诞生时携带了哪些。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:5
