#: docs/standards/index.md:130
msgid ""
"**Three \"agent card\" formats.** The A2A Agent Card, the ERC-8004 "
"registration file and the AIMS manifest all carry name, description and "
"endpoints, for three different readers (other agents, anyone on-chain, "
"websites being crawled). Compared side by side in [Identity](identity.md)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>三种\"智能体卡片\"格式。</strong> A2A Agent Card、ERC-8004 注册文件和 AIMS "
"清单都包含名称、描述和端点，面向三类不同的读者（其他智能体、链上任何人、被爬取的网站）。在[身份](identity.md)中有并列对比。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:131
msgid ""
"**Two Know-Your-Agent schemes.** AgentFacts KYA (verifiable metadata) and "
"Skyfire's `kya` token (a paying agent's verified identity) share a name and "
"a goal but not a format."
msgstr ""
"<strong>两套 Know-Your-Agent 方案。</strong> AgentFacts KYA（可验证元数据）与 Skyfire 的 "
"`kya` 令牌（付款智能体的已验证身份）共享名称与目标，但格式不同。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:132
msgid ""
"**Four ways to say \"on behalf of\".** RFC 8693 `act` claims, the OBO "
"draft's `requested_agent`, transaction tokens, and UCAN/ZCAP delegation "
"chains. Only RFC 8693 is adopted and only UCAN/ZCAP attenuate without an "
"authorization server."
msgstr ""
"<strong>四种表达\"代表某方\"的方式。</strong> RFC 8693 `act` 声明、OBO 草案的 "
"`requested_agent`、事务令牌，以及 UCAN/ZCAP 委托授权链。只有 RFC 8693 已被采纳，且只有 UCAN/ZCAP "
"能在无需授权服务器的情况下实现权限收窄。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:133
msgid ""
"**Card-network agent tokens.** Visa, Mastercard and Stripe each issue an "
"agent-scoped payment token; AP2 mandates sit above all three. A merchant "
"integrating one does not get the others."
msgstr ""
"<strong>卡组织智能体令牌。</strong> Visa、Mastercard 和 Stripe 各自签发智能体范围的支付令牌；AP2 "
"授权指令位于三者之上。商户集成其中一种并不能获得其他两种。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:135
msgid "Gaps, where no standard exists and the manifest carries the burden:"
msgstr "空白之处，即尚无标准存在、由清单承担责任的领域："

#: docs/standards/index.md:137
msgid ""
"**Delegation depth.** No adopted spec expresses or enforces how many hops a "
"delegation may travel; `spec.authority.delegations[].maxDelegationDepth` is "
"policy, not protocol."
msgstr ""
"<strong>委托授权深度。</strong> "
"没有任何已采纳的规范能表达或强制执行委托授权可传递的跳数；`spec.authority.delegations[].maxDelegationDepth`"
" 属于策略，而非协议。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:138
msgid ""
"**Revocation at scale.** Killing an agent means revoking OAuth grants, API "
"keys, wallet policies, registry entries and card tokens at many providers "
"with no common revocation signal. See [Death](../lifecycle/death.md)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>规模化撤销。</strong> 终止一个智能体意味着在众多提供方处撤销 OAuth 授权、API "
"密钥、钱包策略、注册表条目和卡令牌，却没有统一的撤销信号。参见[死亡](../lifecycle/death.md)。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:139
msgid ""
"**Ephemeral agent identity.** Sub-agents spawned for one task have no "
"registry, no reputation and usually no key of their own beyond `did:key`; "
"every card format assumes a long-lived agent."
msgstr ""
"<strong>临时智能体身份。</strong> 为单个任务派生的子智能体没有注册表、没有声誉，通常除 `did:key` "
"外也没有自己的密钥；每种卡片格式都假定智能体是长期存在的。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:140
msgid ""
"**Memory integrity.** There is no standard for signing or attesting agent "
"memory, which is why OWASP ASI06 has no protocol answer in [7 "
"Memory](../stack/07-memory.md)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>记忆完整性。</strong> 尚无对智能体记忆进行签名或证明的标准，这就是为什么 OWASP ASI06 在[7 "
"记忆](../stack/07-memory.md)中没有协议层面的解答。"

#: docs/standards/index.md:141
msgid ""
"**Evidence of governance.** Regulators and KYA schemes ask whether a kill "
"switch and audit log exist; nothing lets a counterparty verify that claim."
msgstr ""
"<strong>治理证据。</strong> 监管机构和 KYA 方案会询问是否存在紧急停止开关和审计日志；但没有任何机制能让交易对手验证这一声明。"

