#: docs/standards/identity.md:1
msgid "Identity standards"
msgstr "身份标准"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:3
msgid ""
"These standards answer the question layer 1 asks: _who is this agent and who"
" is responsible for it?_ They split into three families that are often "
"confused. **Identifier standards** (W3C DID Core, HCS-14 UAID) define a "
"stable name and how to resolve it to keys. **Card / manifest formats** (A2A "
"Agent Card, ERC-8004 registration file, AIMS) define a JSON document that "
"describes the agent to strangers. **Enterprise directories** (Microsoft "
"Entra Agent ID) put agents into an existing IAM system. Verifiable "
"Credentials sit across all three as the way to attach signed claims to an "
"identifier, which is why they also appear in [Trust](../stack/09-trust.md). "
"Birthbook does not pick one; a Birth Profile records whichever the agent was"
" given under `spec.identity.did`, `spec.identity.keys[]` and "
"`spec.identity.registrations[]`."
msgstr ""
"这些标准回答第 1 层提出的问题：<em>这个智能体是谁，谁对它负责？</em> "
"它们分为三个常被混淆的族群。<strong>标识符标准</strong>（W3C DID Core、HCS-14 "
"UAID）定义稳定的名称以及如何将其解析为密钥。<strong>卡片 / 清单格式</strong>（A2A Agent Card、ERC-8004 "
"注册文件、AIMS）定义一个向陌生方描述该智能体的 JSON 文档。<strong>企业目录</strong>（Microsoft Entra "
"Agent ID）将智能体纳入现有 IAM "
"系统。可验证凭证（VC）横跨这三者，作为将签名声明附加到标识符的方式，因此它们也出现在[信任](../stack/09-trust.md)中。Agent"
" Birthbook 不做单一选择；诞生档案会在 `spec.identity.did`、`spec.identity.keys[]` 和 "
"`spec.identity.registrations[]` 中记录智能体获得的任何一种。"

