#: docs/standards/identity.md:24
msgid ""
"Defines the `did:method:id` identifier syntax and the DID Document "
"(verification methods, service endpoints) it resolves to. It says nothing "
"about _what_ the agent is or who owns it; that is left to methods "
"(`did:web`, `did:key`, `did:pkh`, `did:ethr`) and to credentials. Pick it "
"whenever you want an identifier that outlives any single provider: `did:web`"
" if the agent has a domain ([Presence](../stack/02-presence.md)), `did:key` "
"for ephemeral sub-agents, `did:pkh` when the wallet address _is_ the "
"identity."
msgstr ""
"定义了 `did:method:id` 标识符语法及其解析出的 DID "
"文档（验证方法、服务端点）。它并不说明智能体<em>是什么</em>或归谁所有；这留给各方法（`did:web`、`did:key`、`did:pkh`、`did:ethr`）和凭证来处理。当你需要一个不依附于任何单一提供方的标识符时就选它：智能体拥有域名时用"
" `did:web`（[在线存在](../stack/02-presence.md)），临时子智能体用 "
"`did:key`，钱包地址<em>即</em>身份时用 `did:pkh`。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:27
msgid ""
"Defines a signed JSON-LD claim envelope (issuer, subject, claims, proof) "
"with JOSE/COSE or Data Integrity proofs. It does not define agent-specific "
"claim vocabularies; KYA-OS, the W3C Agent Identity CG and AIMS all propose "
"those. Use it to express \"owner X controls agent Y\" or \"agent Y passed "
"audit Z\" in a form that survives leaving the issuer's platform. Mostly "
"lives in [Trust](../stack/09-trust.md)."
msgstr ""
"定义了一种带签名的 JSON-LD 声明信封（签发方、主体、声明、证明），采用 JOSE/COSE 或 Data Integrity "
"证明。它不定义智能体专用的声明词汇表；KYA-OS、W3C Agent Identity CG 和 AIMS "
"都提出了相应方案。用它以一种脱离签发方平台仍然有效的形式表达“所有者 X 控制智能体 Y”或“智能体 Y 通过了审计 "
"Z”。主要属于[信任](../stack/09-trust.md)层。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:30
msgid ""
"A JSON document at `/.well-known/agent-card.json` listing name, description,"
" skills, endpoint URL, supported transports and the OAuth/API-key/mTLS "
"schemes required to call the agent, with an optional `AgentCardSignature` "
"(JWS). It is a capability advertisement first and an identity second: "
"nothing binds the card to an owner unless you add a signature and a trust "
"root. Pick it if the agent speaks A2A at all; it is the de-facto card for "
"agent-to-agent calls. See also [Discovery](discovery.md)."
msgstr ""
"位于 `/.well-known/agent-card.json` 的 JSON 文档，列出名称、描述、技能、端点 "
"URL、支持的传输方式，以及调用该智能体所需的 OAuth/API-key/mTLS 方案，并可选附带 "
"`AgentCardSignature`（JWS）。它首先是能力广告，其次才是身份：除非你添加签名和信任根，否则没有任何东西将该卡片与所有者绑定。只要智能体使用"
" A2A 协议就选它；它是智能体间调用事实上的标准卡片。另见[发现](discovery.md)。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:33
msgid ""
"Three per-chain registries. The **Identity Registry** mints an ERC-721 per "
"agent whose `agentURI` resolves to a _registration file_ (JSON: name, "
"services/endpoints, other registrations, supported trust models). The "
"**Reputation Registry** stores feedback; the **Validation Registry** stores "
"third-party attestations. It does not define authorization or payment; it "
"plugs into x402 and A2A. Pick it when the agent needs a public, owner-"
"transferable identity that other agents can look up without a central "
"registry. Deployed on mainnet since January 2026; the EIP text itself is "
"still marked Draft."
msgstr ""
"三个按链部署的注册表。<strong>Identity Registry</strong> 为每个智能体铸造一个 ERC-721，其 "
"`agentURI` "
"解析为一个<em>注册文件</em>（JSON：名称、服务/端点、其他注册信息、支持的信任模型）。<strong>Reputation "
"Registry</strong> 存储反馈；<strong>Validation Registry</strong> "
"存储第三方证明。它不定义授权或支付；可与 x402 和 A2A "
"对接。当智能体需要一个公开的、可由所有者转移的身份，供其他智能体在无中心注册表的情况下查询时选它。自 2026 年 1 月起已部署于主网；EIP "
"文本本身仍标记为 Draft。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:36
msgid ""
"A DID-based JSON-LD manifest that a _crawling_ or _content-consuming_ agent "
"publishes so that websites can verify who it is, what content licences it "
"holds and where it reports telemetry. Companion effort: [github.com/agent-"
"manifest](https://github.com/agent-manifest). It does not cover agent-to-"
"agent calls or payments. Pick it when your agent reads other people's "
"content and you want a publisher-facing identity rather than a service-"
"facing one."
msgstr ""
"一种基于 DID 的 JSON-LD "
"清单，由<em>爬取</em>或<em>内容消费</em>型智能体发布，以便网站验证其身份、所持有的内容许可以及遥测数据的上报位置。配套项目：[github.com/agent-"
"manifest](https://github.com/agent-"
"manifest)。它不涵盖智能体间调用或支付。当你的智能体读取他人内容、且你需要面向发布方而非面向服务方的身份时，选择它。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:39
msgid ""
"An RFC-style community spec for a signed \"passport\" (Ed25519) carrying "
"agent identity, provenance and optional blockchain anchoring, with "
"Go/Python/TypeScript SDKs. Single-maintainer; no known production "
"deployments. Useful as a reference design for `spec.identity.keys[].custody`"
" and provenance fields, less so as a dependency."
msgstr ""
"一份 RFC 风格的社区规范，定义了一种签名\"护照\"（Ed25519），承载智能体身份、来源及可选的区块链锚定，并提供 "
"Go/Python/TypeScript SDK。单一维护者；无已知生产部署。可作为 `spec.identity.keys[].custody` "
"与来源字段的参考设计，但不宜作为依赖。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:42
msgid ""
"Hedera Consensus Service standard defining `uaid:aid:` (deterministic hash "
"of agent attributes) and `uaid:did:` (wrapping an existing DID) so one "
"identifier can point at the same agent across registries. Pairs with HCS-10 "
"OpenConvAI messaging. Narrow ecosystem; relevant if you already run on "
"Hedera."
msgstr ""
"Hedera Consensus Service 标准，定义了 `uaid:aid:`（智能体属性的确定性哈希）与 `uaid:did:`（封装已有 "
"DID），使单一标识符可在多个注册表中指向同一智能体。与 HCS-10 OpenConvAI 消息传递配套。生态范围较窄；若你已运行在 Hedera "
"上则值得关注。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:45
msgid ""
"Agents become first-class identities in Entra (formerly Azure AD) with "
"blueprints, owners and sponsors, Conditional Access, ID Protection risk "
"scoring and lifecycle governance. It is the enterprise answer to layers 1, 3"
" and 10 at once, but the identity does not leave the tenant. Pick it when "
"the agent lives inside a Microsoft-centric organisation and the other party "
"is also an Entra tenant; see [Credentials & Tool "
"Auth](../providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md)."
msgstr ""
"智能体在 Entra（前身为 Azure AD）中成为一等身份，具备蓝图、所有者与担保人、Conditional Access、ID "
"Protection 风险评分及生命周期治理。它是企业界对第 1、3、10 层的一站式解答，但身份无法离开租户。当智能体运行在以 Microsoft "
"为中心的组织内、且对方也是 Entra 租户时，选择它；参见[凭证与工具认证](../providers/credentials-and-tool-"
"auth.md)。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:48
msgid ""
"Know-Your-Agent Operating System (formerly MCP-I), an open identity-and-"
"delegation framework built on DIDs and VCs, being incubated at the "
"Decentralized Identity Foundation. It aims to standardise the credential "
"vocabulary for \"who deployed this agent, on whose behalf, with what "
"bounds\". Draft; watch rather than depend on."
msgstr ""
"Know-Your-Agent Operating System（前身为 MCP-I），一个基于 DID 与 VC 构建的开放身份与委托授权框架，目前在"
" Decentralized Identity Foundation "
"孵化。其目标是为\"谁部署了此智能体、代表谁、有何边界\"标准化凭证词汇。草案阶段；宜观察而非依赖。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:51
msgid ""
"Community Group (April 2026) drafting a DID method, credential formats and "
"trust negotiation that bind agents to their controlling organisations, with "
"MCP/A2A/OAuth integration. Draft; no published spec yet."
msgstr ""
"社区小组（2026 年 4 月）正在起草 DID 方法、凭证格式与信任协商，将智能体绑定到其控制组织，并集成 "
"MCP/A2A/OAuth。草案阶段；尚未发布规范。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:54
msgid ""
"Open-source \"passport plus wallet\" that gives an agent an on-chain "
"identity, a USDC wallet and a human-set spend limit in one package. It is an"
" opinionated implementation spanning layers 1, 5 and 8 rather than a "
"standard. See [Wallets & Keys](../providers/wallets.md)."
msgstr ""
"开源的\"护照加钱包\"方案，在一个包中为智能体提供链上身份、USDC 钱包及由人类设定的支出限额。它是一个横跨第 1、5、8 "
"层的定制化实现，而非标准。参见[钱包与密钥](../providers/wallets.md)。"

