#: docs/standards/identity.md:68
msgid ""
"A practical Birth Profile often uses all three: a DID as the stable "
"`spec.identity.did`, an A2A card at the agent's domain for callers, and an "
"ERC-8004 registration under `spec.identity.registrations[]` when the agent "
"trades with strangers. DID Core and VC 2.0 are the substrate under KYA-OS, "
"AIMS, the W3C CG and CSA's agentic IAM work; the fights are over "
"vocabularies, not envelopes."
msgstr ""
"一个实用的诞生档案通常会同时使用这三者：以 DID 作为稳定的 `spec.identity.did`，在智能体域名下放置 A2A "
"卡片供调用方使用，并在智能体与陌生方交易时于 `spec.identity.registrations[]` 下进行 ERC-8004 注册。DID "
"Core 与 VC 2.0 是 KYA-OS、AIMS、W3C CG 以及 CSA 智能体 IAM 工作的基础底座；争议在于词汇表，而非封装格式。"

#: docs/standards/identity.md:70
msgid ""
"Open gaps: ephemeral sub-agent identity (spawned for one task, no registry) "
"is underspecified everywhere except `did:key`; and none of these formats "
"express delegation depth, which is why [Authority](../stack/08-authority.md)"
" has its own standards chapter."
msgstr ""
"尚未解决的空白：临时子智能体身份（为单一任务生成、不入注册表）在除 `did:key` "
"之外的所有方案中均缺乏规范；而且这些格式都无法表达委托授权深度，这正是 [权限](../stack/08-authority.md) "
"拥有独立标准章节的原因。"

