#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:25
msgid "MCP Authorization"
msgstr "MCP Authorization"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:26
msgid ""
"Profiles OAuth 2.1 for HTTP-transport MCP servers: the server is a resource "
"server, publishes RFC 9728 Protected Resource Metadata, and the client must "
"send an RFC 8707 `resource` indicator so tokens are audience-bound. Dynamic "
"client registration (RFC 7591) is recommended because an agent cannot pre-"
"register with every server. It explicitly forbids token passthrough and says"
" nothing about delegation chains; each MCP server is its own OAuth client to"
" upstream APIs. This is the default for "
"[Capabilities](../stack/06-capabilities.md) tool auth."
msgstr ""
"为基于 HTTP 传输的 MCP 服务器定义 OAuth 2.1 配置文件：服务器是资源服务器，发布 RFC 9728 受保护资源元数据，客户端必须发送"
" RFC 8707 `resource` 指示符，使令牌绑定到特定受众。推荐使用动态客户端注册（RFC "
"7591），因为智能体无法预先在每个服务器上注册。它明确禁止令牌透传，且未涉及委托授权链；每个 MCP 服务器面向上游 API 时都是独立的 OAuth"
" 客户端。这是 [能力](../stack/06-capabilities.md) 层工具身份验证的默认方案。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:28
msgid "RFC 8693 Token Exchange"
msgstr "RFC 8693 Token Exchange"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:29
msgid ""
"Lets a party trade one token for another at the authorization server, "
"producing a token whose `act` claim records the chain of actors (delegation)"
" or which simply impersonates the subject. It is the only _adopted_ RFC that"
" can express \"agent A, acting for user U, calling resource R\". It does not"
" define how the agent got the first token or how deep the chain may go."
msgstr ""
"允许一方在授权服务器上用一个令牌换取另一个令牌，生成的令牌通过 `act` 声明记录参与者链（委托授权），或直接模拟主体。它是唯一能表达“智能体 A "
"代表用户 U 调用资源 R”的已<em>正式采纳</em>的 RFC。它未定义智能体如何获得首个令牌，也未定义链条可以有多深。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:31
msgid "GNAP (RFC 9635 / 9767)"
msgstr "GNAP (RFC 9635 / 9767)"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:32
msgid ""
"Grant Negotiation and Authorization Protocol: a from-scratch successor to "
"OAuth with key-bound requests, multi-resource grants, and interaction modes "
"that do not assume a browser. RFC 9767 covers the resource-server side. "
"Better fit for headless agents than OAuth 2.1, but almost no deployments. "
"Watch for agent-specific profiles."
msgstr ""
"Grant Negotiation and Authorization Protocol：从零设计的 OAuth "
"继任者，支持密钥绑定请求、多资源授权，以及不依赖浏览器的交互模式。RFC 9767 涵盖资源服务器一侧。相比 OAuth 2.1 "
"更适合无界面的智能体，但几乎没有部署。请关注面向智能体的专用配置文件。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:34
msgid "On-Behalf-Of for AI agents (draft)"
msgstr "面向 AI 智能体的 On-Behalf-Of（草案）"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:35
msgid ""
"Adds a `requested_agent` parameter and an agent authorization-code flow so "
"the user consents to a _named agent_ acting for them, and the resulting "
"token names both. Individual draft, expired 2025; the ideas continue in the "
"WIMSE and OpenID CG work. Useful as vocabulary for "
"`spec.authority.delegations[]`."
msgstr ""
"增加了 `requested_agent` "
"参数和智能体授权码流程，使用户可以同意由一个<em>具名智能体</em>代表其行事，最终令牌同时标识双方。个人草案，已于 2025 年过期；相关思路在 "
"WIMSE 和 OpenID CG 的工作中延续。可作为 `spec.authority.delegations[]` 的词汇参考。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:38
msgid ""
"Short-lived, signed JWTs minted at the edge that carry request context "
"through a call chain of internal services. The for-agents draft adds agent "
"identity and human-purpose claims so each hop can check who started the "
"transaction. Draft; the base document is an OAuth WG item, the agent "
"extension is individual."
msgstr ""
"在边缘签发的短生命周期签名 "
"JWT，在内部服务的调用链中传递请求上下文。面向智能体的草案增加了智能体身份和人类意图声明，使每一跳都能核查是谁发起了该事务。草案；基础文档为 "
"OAuth 工作组项目，智能体扩展为个人草案。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:41
msgid ""
"Best-current-practice text, now adopted by the WIMSE WG, on combining "
"workload identity (agent as workload) with OAuth (agent as delegate) and on "
"where to bind human intent. The most likely home for an eventual IETF "
"consensus on agent auth."
msgstr ""
"现为 WIMSE 工作组采纳的最佳当前实践文本，阐述如何将工作负载身份（智能体作为工作负载）与 "
"OAuth（智能体作为受托方）相结合，以及应在何处绑定人类意图。这是 IETF 就智能体身份验证达成最终共识的最可能归属。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:44
msgid ""
"Individual informational draft describing how agent frameworks should "
"integrate with external authorization services (policy decision points) "
"rather than reimplement checks in prompts. Read it alongside "
"[Governance](../stack/10-governance.md)."
msgstr ""
"个人信息性草案，描述智能体框架应如何与外部授权服务（策略决策点）集成，而不是在提示词中重新实现检查。请结合[治理](../stack/10-governance.md)一同阅读。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:46
msgid "WIMSE WG"
msgstr "WIMSE 工作组"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:47
msgid ""
"Workload Identity in Multi System Environments: IETF working group "
"standardising how workloads (containers, functions, and now agents) prove "
"identity across trust domains, including token formats and proof of "
"possession. Agent-specific work is converging here."
msgstr ""
"Workload Identity in Multi System Environments：IETF "
"工作组，负责标准化工作负载（容器、函数，以及现在的智能体）如何跨信任域证明身份，包括令牌格式和持有证明。智能体相关的工作正在此汇聚。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:50
msgid ""
"CNCF standard for issuing short-lived X.509 or JWT SVIDs to workloads based "
"on attested runtime properties. Solves \"which process is this\" for "
"[Compute](../stack/04-compute.md); does not solve \"on whose behalf\". Map "
"to `spec.authentication.credentials[].type: spiffe`."
msgstr ""
"CNCF 标准，基于经证明的运行时属性向工作负载签发短期有效的 X.509 或 JWT "
"SVID。解决了[计算资源](../stack/04-compute.md)层面\"这是哪个进程\"的问题；但不解决\"代表谁\"的问题。映射到 "
"`spec.authentication.credentials[].type: spiffe`。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:53
msgid ""
"RFC 9421 defines signing HTTP messages. Web Bot Auth (now an IETF working "
"group, originated at Cloudflare) profiles it so a bot signs requests with a "
"key published in a directory, letting sites verify the operator rather than "
"trusting a user-agent string. Also the verification layer under Visa Trusted"
" Agent Protocol and Mastercard Agent Pay acceptance "
"([Payments](payments.md)). Map to `type: http-signature`."
msgstr ""
"RFC 9421 定义了 HTTP 消息签名。Web Bot Auth（现为 IETF 工作组，起源于 "
"Cloudflare）对其进行了配置，使机器人使用发布在目录中的密钥对请求进行签名，让站点能够验证运营方，而非信任 user-agent 字符串。它也是"
" Visa Trusted Agent Protocol 和 Mastercard Agent Pay "
"受理体系下的验证层（[支付](payments.md)）。映射到 `type: http-signature`。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:55
msgid "UCAN and ZCAP"
msgstr "UCAN 与 ZCAP"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:56
msgid ""
"Object-capability tokens: the bearer holds a signed chain proving that the "
"root owner delegated a capability, attenuated at each hop, with no "
"authorization server in the loop. UCAN 1.0 (DID-keyed, IPLD/JWT encodings) "
"and ZCAP (W3C CCG, Data Integrity proofs) are the two live designs. They are"
" the cleanest fit for `canSubDelegate` and `maxDelegationDepth` in "
"`spec.authority.delegations[]`, but resource servers must understand them, "
"which most SaaS APIs do not."
msgstr ""
"对象能力令牌：持有者持有一条签名链，证明根所有者委托授权了某项能力，并在每一跳进行权限收窄，全程无需授权服务器参与。UCAN 1.0（DID "
"密钥、IPLD/JWT 编码）和 ZCAP（W3C CCG，Data Integrity 证明）是目前两种活跃的设计。它们最契合 "
"`spec.authority.delegations[]` 中的 `canSubDelegate` 和 "
"`maxDelegationDepth`，但资源服务器必须能够理解这些令牌，而大多数 SaaS API 目前并不支持。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:59
msgid ""
"OpenID Foundation community group collecting agent identity requirements and"
" drafting OpenID Connect / OAuth profiles for agents. Draft; no published "
"spec yet."
msgstr ""
"OpenID 基金会社区组，正在收集智能体身份需求并为智能体起草 OpenID Connect / OAuth "
"配置文件。尚处草案阶段；暂无已发布的规范。"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:63
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"    %% \"i18n\"\n"
"    participant U as User (principal)\n"
"    participant A as Agent\n"
"    participant AS as Authorization Server\n"
"    participant R as Resource / MCP server\n"
"    U->>AS: Consent: agent A may act for me (scope S)\n"
"    AS-->>A: User-bound token T1 (aud: AS)\n"
"    A->>AS: RFC 8693 token exchange: T1 + agent credential (SPIFFE / client auth)\n"
"    AS-->>A: T2 (sub: U, act: A, aud: R, scope ≤ S)\n"
"    A->>R: Request + T2 (+ RFC 9421 signature)\n"
"    R->>R: Verify aud, act chain, scope\n"
"    R-->>A: Response\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"    %% \"i18n\"\n"
"    participant U as 用户（主体）\n"
"    participant A as 智能体\n"
"    participant AS as 授权服务器\n"
"    participant R as 资源 / MCP 服务器\n"
"    U->>AS: 同意：智能体 A 可代表我行动（范围 S）\n"
"    AS-->>A: 用户绑定令牌 T1（aud: AS）\n"
"    A->>AS: RFC 8693 令牌交换：T1 + 智能体凭证（SPIFFE / 客户端认证）\n"
"    AS-->>A: T2（sub: U, act: A, aud: R, scope ≤ S）\n"
"    A->>R: 请求 + T2（+ RFC 9421 签名）\n"
"    R->>R: 验证 aud、act 链、scope\n"
"    R-->>A: 响应\n"
"```"

#: docs/standards/auth-and-delegation.md:79
msgid ""
"Layer 3 lives at the bottom of the diagram (agent credential, signatures); "
"layer 8 lives at the top (consent, `act` chain, scope narrowing). OAuth 2.1 "
"via MCP handles the common case of one agent and one tool. Token Exchange or"
" transaction tokens add the chain. UCAN/ZCAP remove the authorization server"
" entirely, which is attractive for agent-to-agent calls where no shared IdP "
"exists. Nothing adopted today enforces delegation depth; you enforce "
"`maxDelegationDepth` in the issuing policy and record it in the manifest."
msgstr ""
"第 3 层位于图的底部（智能体凭证、签名）；第 8 层位于顶部（同意、`act` 链、范围收窄）。通过 MCP 的 OAuth 2.1 "
"处理单个智能体与单个工具的常见场景。Token Exchange 或事务令牌则加入链条。UCAN/ZCAP 完全移除授权服务器，这对不存在共享 IdP "
"的智能体间调用很有吸引力。当前已采用的方案均不强制执行委托授权深度；你需要在签发策略中强制执行 "
"`maxDelegationDepth`，并将其记录在清单中。"

