#: docs/standards/payments.md:22
msgid ""
"Revives HTTP 402: a server replies `402 Payment Required` with price and "
"chain details, the client signs a stablecoin transfer (USDC on Base and "
"other EVM chains, Solana), retries with the payment header, and a "
"facilitator settles. No accounts, no API keys, sub-cent amounts. It does not"
" say who funded the wallet or whether the agent was allowed to spend; that "
"is the manifest's `spec.economy.budget` and a wallet policy. Pick it for "
"agent-to-API and agent-to-agent micropayments. Stripe's machine payments and"
" ERC-8004 both interoperate with it."
msgstr ""
"复活了 HTTP 402：服务器返回 `402 Payment Required` 并附带价格和链上信息，客户端签署一笔稳定币转账（Base 及其他 "
"EVM 链上的 USDC、Solana），携带支付头重试请求，由结算方（facilitator）完成清算。无需账户、无需 API "
"密钥、支持低于一美分的金额。它并不说明钱包由谁注资，也不说明智能体是否被允许消费；这属于清单中的 `spec.economy.budget` "
"和钱包策略的范畴。适用于智能体对 API 以及智能体对智能体的微支付。Stripe 的机器支付和 ERC-8004 均可与其互操作。"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:25
msgid ""
"Defines **mandates**: signed verifiable credentials capturing the user's "
"intent (Intent Mandate), the agreed cart (Cart Mandate) and payment "
"authorisation, so a merchant can prove afterwards what the human asked for. "
"Rail-agnostic (cards, real-time bank, stablecoins via an x402 extension). "
"Built on A2A and MCP. It does not move money itself; it is the audit and "
"consent layer. Pick it when a _human's_ purchase is being delegated and "
"disputes need a paper trail."
msgstr ""
"定义了<strong>授权令（mandates）：</strong>以签名可验证凭证记录用户意图（Intent Mandate）、确认的购物车（Cart"
" Mandate）和支付授权，使商户事后能够证明人类当初的请求内容。与支付通道无关（银行卡、实时银行支付、通过 x402 扩展支持的稳定币）。构建于 "
"A2A 和 MCP 之上。它本身不移动资金；它是审计与同意层。当<em>人类</em>的购买行为被委托授权且争议需要书面凭据时，请选择它。"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:27
msgid "Visa Trusted Agent Protocol / Visa Intelligent Commerce"
msgstr "Visa Trusted Agent Protocol / Visa Intelligent Commerce"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:28
msgid ""
"Intelligent Commerce issues agent-specific payment tokens tied to a "
"cardholder's passkey and checks each transaction against the user's "
"instructions. Trusted Agent Protocol is the merchant-facing half: the agent "
"signs requests (Web Bot Auth / RFC 9421 style, time-bound and merchant-"
"specific) so a site can distinguish an authorised commerce agent from a "
"scraper. Card rail only; issuer decides."
msgstr ""
"Intelligent Commerce 签发与持卡人通行密钥绑定的智能体专用支付令牌，并根据用户指令核验每笔交易。Trusted Agent "
"Protocol 是面向商户的另一半：智能体对请求进行签名（Web Bot Auth / RFC 9421 "
"风格，具有时限且针对特定商户），使网站能够区分获授权的商务智能体与爬虫。仅限卡组织通道；由发卡方决定。"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:30 docs/standards/payments.md:52
msgid "Mastercard Agent Pay"
msgstr "Mastercard Agent Pay"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:31
msgid ""
"Agentic Tokens are network tokens issued to a registered agent, plus a "
"Verifiable Intent record. The acceptance framework lets merchants verify "
"agents at the CDN with Web Bot Auth and accept a Dynamic Token Verification "
"Code in a standard card form. Card rail only; liability follows tokenised-"
"transaction rules. Works with ACP for ChatGPT checkout."
msgstr ""
"Agentic Tokens 是签发给已注册智能体的网络令牌，并附带 Verifiable Intent 记录。该受理框架允许商户在 CDN 层通过 "
"Web Bot Auth 验证智能体，并在标准卡表单中接受 Dynamic Token Verification "
"Code。仅限卡组织通道；责任遵循令牌化交易规则。可与 ACP 配合用于 ChatGPT 结账。"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:33
msgid "Agentic Commerce Protocol and Shared Payment Tokens"
msgstr "Agentic Commerce Protocol 与 Shared Payment Tokens"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:34
msgid ""
"ACP (OpenAI + Stripe) is the checkout protocol: product feed, cart, "
"delegated payment. Stripe Shared Payment Tokens are the scoped credential an"
" agent receives from a user's Stripe-hosted wallet (Link) and hands to a "
"seller, limited by amount, merchant and time. Together they cover the "
"ChatGPT Instant Checkout case. Card/wallet rail via Stripe."
msgstr ""
"ACP（OpenAI + Stripe）是结账协议：商品目录、购物车、委托支付。Stripe Shared Payment Tokens "
"是智能体从用户的 Stripe 托管钱包（Link）获得并交给卖家的受限凭证，受金额、商户和时间限制。二者共同覆盖 ChatGPT Instant "
"Checkout 场景。通过 Stripe 走卡/钱包通道。"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:37
msgid ""
"MCP server and SDK exposing PayPal invoicing, orders, payouts and "
"subscriptions to agents. It is an integration, not a protocol; authorisation"
" is the merchant's PayPal credentials. Pick it when the agent operates a "
"_business's_ PayPal account."
msgstr ""
"向智能体开放 PayPal 开票、订单、付款和订阅功能的 MCP 服务器与 SDK。它是一个集成，而非协议；授权方式为商户的 PayPal "
"凭证。当智能体操作的是<em>企业</em>的 PayPal 账户时选择它。"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:40
msgid ""
"Skyfire issues three JWT types: `kya` (identity of a verified agent), `pay` "
"(a spend authorisation) and `kya-pay` (both). A seller verifies one token to"
" learn who the agent is and that it can pay. Bridges "
"[Trust](../stack/09-trust.md) and Economic Identity; see [Security & "
"Governance](security-and-governance.md) for the KYA side."
msgstr ""
"Skyfire 签发三种 JWT 类型：`kya`（经验证智能体的身份）、`pay`（支出授权）和 `kya-"
"pay`（两者兼具）。卖家验证一个令牌即可得知智能体是谁以及其是否能够付款。桥接[信任](../stack/09-trust.md)与经济身份；KYA "
"方面参见[安全与治理](security-and-governance.md)。"

#: docs/standards/payments.md:43
msgid ""
"An implementation, not a standard: server-side custodied wallets with policy"
" controls plus an agent framework integration that speaks x402. Listed "
"because it is the reference stack most x402 agents actually run. See "
"[Wallets & Keys](../providers/wallets.md)."
msgstr ""
"这是一个实现，而非标准：带策略控制的服务端托管钱包，外加支持 x402 的智能体框架集成。列入此处是因为它是大多数 x402 "
"智能体实际运行的参考栈。参见[钱包与密钥](../providers/wallets.md)。"

