#: docs/standards/payments.md:58
msgid ""
"Read the table as two questions. _Who holds the key?_ If the agent does "
"(x402, KYAPay, AgentKit), the spending limit must be enforced by the wallet "
"policy and `spec.economy.budget`, because the protocol will happily sign "
"anything. If the issuer does (Visa, Mastercard, Stripe), the limit is in the"
" token and the human's card controls still apply, but the agent cannot pay a"
" machine that has no card acceptance. AP2 is orthogonal: it records the "
"consent whichever rail moves the money. Most real deployments in 2026 "
"combine one of each: a card token for buying from merchants, x402 for buying"
" from APIs, and AP2-style mandates in the audit log."
msgstr ""
"可以从两个问题来理解该表。<em>密钥由谁持有？</em> 如果由智能体持有（x402、KYAPay、AgentKit），则消费限额必须由钱包策略和 "
"`spec.economy.budget` "
"强制执行，因为协议会毫不犹豫地签署任何内容。如果由发行方持有（Visa、Mastercard、Stripe），则限额包含在令牌中，人类的卡片管控依然有效，但智能体无法向没有受理卡片能力的机器付款。AP2"
" 与两者正交：无论资金通过哪种通道流转，它都会记录同意信息。2026 年的大多数实际部署会各选其一组合使用：用卡片令牌向商家购买，用 x402 向 "
"API 购买，并在审计日志中使用 AP2 式授权指令。"

