#: docs/standards/discovery.md:1
msgid "Discovery standards"
msgstr "发现标准"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:3
msgid ""
"Discovery is how a stranger finds an agent and learns how to call it. It "
"straddles [Presence](../stack/02-presence.md) (the agent has an address) and"
" [Capabilities](../stack/06-capabilities.md) (what it can do). Today there "
"are two mature patterns, both borrowed from the web: a **well-known file on "
"the agent's own domain** (A2A agent card, agents.txt, llms.txt) and a "
"**registry** someone else runs (MCP Registry, ERC-8004 Identity Registry). "
"Everything else, including DNS-based naming and NANDA's index, is research "
"or early deployment. Whatever is used goes into `spec.presence.endpoints[]` "
"and `spec.identity.registrations[]`."
msgstr ""
"发现是指陌生方找到某个智能体并了解如何调用它的方式。它横跨[在线存在](../stack/02-presence.md)（智能体拥有地址）和[能力](../stack/06-capabilities.md)（它能做什么）。目前存在两种成熟模式，均借鉴自"
" Web：<strong>智能体自有域名上的 well-known 文件</strong>（A2A agent "
"card、agents.txt、llms.txt）以及由他人运营的<strong>注册表</strong>（MCP Registry、ERC-8004 "
"Identity Registry）。其他方案，包括基于 DNS 的命名和 NANDA 的索引，仍处于研究或早期部署阶段。所采用的方案会写入 "
"`spec.presence.endpoints[]` 和 `spec.identity.registrations[]`。"

