#: docs/standards/discovery.md:21
msgid ""
"`https://{domain}/.well-known/agent-card.json` returns the card described in"
" [Identity](identity.md): skills, endpoint, transports, auth schemes. "
"Discovery is by knowing the domain; A2A does not define a search index. An "
"authenticated \"extended card\" can reveal more once the caller has "
"credentials. This is the only agent-to-agent discovery mechanism with broad "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"`https://{domain}/.well-known/agent-card.json` "
"返回[身份](identity.md)中描述的卡片：技能、端点、传输方式、认证方案。发现依赖于已知域名；A2A "
"未定义搜索索引。调用方持有凭证后，经过身份验证的\"扩展卡片\"可以披露更多信息。这是唯一得到广泛实现的智能体到智能体发现机制。"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:24
msgid ""
"A Markdown-with-YAML file at the site root (with a JSON mirror at "
"`/api/agents`) telling visiting agents what the site offers, its endpoints "
"and its rules, in the spirit of robots.txt. Site-to-agent direction; it does"
" not advertise the agent itself. Single-maintainer proposal."
msgstr ""
"位于站点根目录的 Markdown-with-YAML 文件（在 `/api/agents` 提供 JSON 镜像），本着 robots.txt "
"的精神，告知来访智能体该站点提供的内容、端点及规则。方向为站点到智能体；它不用于宣传智能体自身。为单一维护者提案。"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:27
msgid ""
"A Markdown file at `/llms.txt` giving language models a curated map of a "
"site's content. Widely adopted by documentation sites (including the MCP "
"spec itself). It is about content, not agents, but it is how an agent's "
"[Capabilities](../stack/06-capabilities.md) discover tool documentation."
msgstr ""
"位于 `/llms.txt` 的 Markdown 文件，为语言模型提供站点内容的精选地图。已被文档站点广泛采用（包括 MCP "
"规范本身）。它关注的是内容而非智能体，但这是智能体的[能力](../stack/06-capabilities.md)发现工具文档的方式。"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:30
msgid ""
"Open-source service and hosted instance "
"([registry.modelcontextprotocol.io](https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io))"
" listing published MCP servers with metadata and install details. Discovers "
"_tools_ for an agent, not agents for a caller. Third-party mirrors "
"(Smithery, Glama, PulseMCP) index the same data; see [Models & "
"Skills](../providers/models-and-skills.md)."
msgstr ""
"开源服务及托管实例（[registry.modelcontextprotocol.io](https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io)），列出已发布的"
" MCP "
"服务器及其元数据和安装详情。它为智能体发现<em>工具</em>，而不是为调用方发现智能体。第三方镜像（Smithery、Glama、PulseMCP）索引相同数据；参见[模型与技能](../providers/models-"
"and-skills.md)。"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:33
msgid ""
"MIT project for an \"Internet of AI Agents\": a decentralised index plus "
"adaptive resolvers that map an agent name to current endpoints and bridge "
"A2A, MCP and plain HTTPS. Includes AgentFacts, a signed metadata format that"
" also underpins Know-Your-Agent ([Security & Governance](security-and-"
"governance.md)). Research-stage with reference code."
msgstr ""
"MIT 的\"AI 智能体互联网\"项目：一个去中心化索引加自适应解析器，将智能体名称映射到当前端点，并桥接 A2A、MCP 和普通 HTTPS。包含 "
"AgentFacts，一种签名元数据格式，同时也是 Know-Your-Agent 的基础（[安全与治理](security-and-"
"governance.md)）。处于研究阶段，附参考代码。"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:35
msgid "Agent Name Service"
msgstr "Agent Name Service"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:36
msgid ""
"Paper proposing a DNS-inspired, PKI-backed directory where agents register "
"signed records and clients resolve names to capabilities with protocol "
"adapters for A2A/MCP. No running network; useful as a design reference."
msgstr ""
"该论文提出一种受 DNS 启发、由 PKI 支持的目录：智能体注册签名记录，客户端将名称解析为能力，并提供 A2A/MCP "
"的协议适配器。没有运行中的网络；可作为设计参考。"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:38
msgid "ERC-8004 as discovery"
msgstr "作为发现机制的 ERC-8004"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:39
msgid ""
"Because the Identity Registry is enumerable on-chain and each entry points "
"to a registration file with service endpoints, it doubles as a "
"permissionless directory: query the registry, filter by reputation, follow "
"the URI. Slow and public by design; suited to marketplaces of unknown agents"
" rather than internal fleets."
msgstr ""
"由于 Identity Registry 可在链上枚举，且每个条目指向包含服务端点的注册文件，它同时可充当无需许可的目录：查询注册表，按声誉过滤，跟随 "
"URI。其设计特点是缓慢且公开；适合面向未知智能体的市场，而非内部智能体集群。"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:41
msgid "DNS-based options"
msgstr "基于 DNS 的方案"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:42
msgid ""
"`did:web` already resolves an identifier to a DID Document via HTTPS on a "
"domain, which can list A2A or MCP service endpoints. SRV or TXT records can "
"advertise agent endpoints for a domain, and DNSSEC gives them integrity. "
"Nothing agent-specific is standardised; the advantage is that [Domains & "
"DNS](../providers/domains.md) is infrastructure every agent already needs."
msgstr ""
"`did:web` 已经能通过域名上的 HTTPS 将标识符解析为 DID 文档，其中可列出 A2A 或 MCP 服务端点。SRV 或 TXT "
"记录可为域名公布智能体端点，DNSSEC 则为其提供完整性保障。目前没有任何针对智能体的标准化方案；其优势在于[域名与 "
"DNS](../providers/domains.md) 是每个智能体本就需要的基础设施。"

#: docs/standards/discovery.md:46
msgid ""
"Well-known files answer \"given a domain, how do I call it\"; registries "
"answer \"given a need, which domain\". A complete Birth Profile usually has "
"one of each: the agent publishes an A2A card on its own domain (so "
"`spec.presence.domain` becomes the discovery root) and is listed in a "
"registry appropriate to its audience: the MCP Registry if it is a tool, "
"ERC-8004 if it trades with strangers, an enterprise catalogue if it is "
"internal. The overlap to watch is between the A2A card, the ERC-8004 "
"registration file and the AIMS manifest, which all carry name and endpoints "
"in different shapes; see [Identity](identity.md). The gap is search and "
"trust: no adopted standard tells you whether the card you found is honest, "
"which is what NANDA's AgentFacts and ERC-8004's reputation registry attempt."
msgstr ""
"well-known "
"文件回答\"给定一个域名，如何调用它\"；注册表回答\"给定一个需求，选哪个域名\"。一份完整的诞生档案通常各有其一：智能体在自己的域名上发布 A2A "
"卡片（这样 `spec.presence.domain` 就成为发现的根），并被列入适合其受众的注册表：如果它是工具则列入 MCP "
"Registry，如果它与陌生方交易则列入 ERC-8004，如果它是内部智能体则列入企业目录。需要注意的重叠在于 A2A 卡片、ERC-8004 "
"注册文件与 AIMS "
"清单之间，它们以不同的形式承载名称和端点；参见[身份](identity.md)。缺口在于搜索与信任：没有被广泛采用的标准能告诉你所找到的卡片是否诚实，而这正是"
" NANDA 的 AgentFacts 和 ERC-8004 的声誉注册表试图解决的问题。"

