#: docs/providers/email.md:9
msgid ""
"**SMTP + IMAP** - The lowest common denominator; every client library speaks"
" it. IMAP IDLE gives near-real-time receive. Fine for self-hosted servers; "
"most API-first providers do not expose IMAP."
msgstr ""
"<strong>SMTP + IMAP</strong> - 最低公分母；每个客户端库都支持。IMAP IDLE "
"提供近实时接收。适用于自托管服务器；大多数 API 优先的服务提供方不开放 IMAP。"

#: docs/providers/email.md:10
msgid ""
"**JMAP** ([RFC 8620](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8620), [RFC "
"8621](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8621)) - JSON over HTTP with push, "
"batching and a coherent object model; far easier for an agent than IMAP. "
"Fastmail and Stalwart implement it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>JMAP</strong>（[RFC 8620](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8620)、[RFC 8621](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8621)）-"
" 基于 HTTP 的 JSON，支持推送、批处理和一致的对象模型；对智能体而言远比 IMAP 易用。Fastmail 和 Stalwart 已实现。"

#: docs/providers/email.md:11
msgid ""
"**REST + webhooks** - Send by POST, receive by webhook with the parsed "
"message. The dominant pattern for transactional providers; the agent must "
"persist mail itself if it wants history."
msgstr ""
"<strong>REST + webhooks</strong> - 通过 POST 发送，通过携带已解析邮件的 webhook "
"接收。事务性服务提供方的主流模式；智能体若需历史记录，必须自行持久化邮件。"

#: docs/providers/email.md:12
msgid ""
"**MCP server** - A vendor-maintained server exposing `send`, "
"`list_messages`, `reply` as tools. AgentMail, Resend and Mailgun ship one; "
"it removes the SDK from the agent's code and moves credentials to the MCP "
"host."
msgstr ""
"<strong>MCP server</strong> - 由供应商维护的服务器，将 `send`、`list_messages`、`reply` "
"作为工具暴露。AgentMail、Resend 和 Mailgun 均已提供；它将 SDK 从智能体代码中移除，并把凭证移至 MCP 宿主。"

#: docs/providers/email.md:13
msgid ""
"**Inbound routing rules** - Provider-side filters that fan a wildcard "
"address (`*@agent.example.com`) into per-task inboxes or webhooks, which is "
"how one domain serves many agents."
msgstr ""
"<strong>入站路由规则</strong> - "
"服务提供方侧的过滤器，将通配符地址（`*@agent.example.com`）分发到按任务划分的收件箱或 "
"webhook，这正是一个域名服务多个智能体的方式。"

