#: docs/providers/phone.md:3
msgid ""
"A phone number is the second verification channel most services demand, and "
"for an agent it is the hardest resource in the whole "
"[Presence](../stack/02-presence.md) layer to obtain honestly. The "
"requirement splits three ways: _receive_ one-time codes so the agent can "
"finish signups and log back in; _send_ messages to humans (notifications, "
"confirmations); and _speak_ on the phone when the counterparty is a call "
"centre or a customer. An agent-native provider lets code buy a number, "
"receive inbound SMS by webhook, place and answer calls with a programmable "
"voice pipeline, and release the number, all without a human in the loop and "
"without the provider treating that as fraud."
msgstr ""
"电话号码是大多数服务要求的第二验证渠道，而对智能体来说，它是整个[在线存在](../stack/02-presence.md)层中最难以正当方式获得的资源。这一需求分为三个方面：<em>接收</em>一次性验证码，以便智能体完成注册和再次登录；向人类<em>发送</em>消息（通知、确认）；以及当对方是呼叫中心或客户时，能在电话中<em>通话</em>。面向智能体的服务商允许通过代码购买号码、经由"
" webhook 接收入站 SMS、使用可编程语音管道拨打和接听电话，并释放号码——全程无需人工介入，且服务商不会将其视为欺诈行为。"

#: docs/providers/phone.md:5
msgid ""
"The traps are structural, not technical. Carriers and OTP-issuing services "
"actively reject numbers they classify as VoIP or \"non-fixed\", which is "
"exactly what every CPaaS provider hands out. US application-to-person (A2P) "
"traffic on 10-digit long codes requires 10DLC registration of a brand and a "
"campaign, tied to a legal entity with a tax ID, before messages are "
"delivered reliably. Many services' terms forbid automated OTP handling "
"outright. The pragmatic answer for OTP receipt is therefore usually not a "
"fresh CPaaS number at all: it is the owner's own mobile number with messages"
" forwarded to the agent, or a dedicated carrier number (a real SIM or eSIM "
"on a mobile network) registered to the owner's business and bridged into the"
" agent's inbox. Treat any received OTP as a credential and route it through "
"the [Authentication](../stack/03-authentication.md) layer's secret store "
"rather than into a log."
msgstr ""
"这些陷阱是结构性的，而非技术性的。运营商和签发 OTP 的服务会主动拒绝被归类为 VoIP 或\"非固定\"的号码，而这正是每家 CPaaS "
"服务商所提供的号码类型。美国 10 位长码上的应用到个人（A2P）流量要求先完成 10DLC "
"品牌和活动注册，并绑定到拥有税号的法律实体，消息才能可靠送达。许多服务的条款直接禁止自动化处理 OTP。因此，接收 OTP "
"的务实答案通常根本不是新申请的 CPaaS "
"号码：而是所有者本人的手机号码并将消息转发给智能体，或者以所有者的企业名义注册的专用运营商号码（移动网络上的真实 SIM 或 "
"eSIM），并桥接到智能体的收件箱中。应将任何收到的 OTP "
"视为凭证，通过[身份验证](../stack/03-authentication.md)层的密钥存储进行流转，而不是写入日志。"

#: docs/providers/phone.md:9
msgid ""
"**Number provisioning API** - Search, buy, configure and release numbers by "
"REST call; the minimum for an agent to own a number at all."
msgstr "<strong>号码开通 API</strong> - 通过 REST 调用搜索、购买、配置和释放号码；这是智能体拥有号码的最低要求。"

#: docs/providers/phone.md:10
msgid ""
"**Inbound SMS webhook** - The provider POSTs each received message to the "
"agent's endpoint. This is how OTP receipt works when it works."
msgstr ""
"<strong>入站 SMS webhook</strong> - 服务商将每条收到的消息 POST 到智能体的端点。当 OTP "
"接收能够正常运作时，正是通过这种方式实现的。"

#: docs/providers/phone.md:11
msgid ""
"**Outbound messaging API** - Send SMS/MMS; in the US requires a registered "
"10DLC campaign, toll-free verification, or a short code."
msgstr ""
"<strong>出站消息 API</strong> - 发送 SMS/MMS；在美国需要已注册的 10DLC 活动、免费电话号码验证或短代码。"

#: docs/providers/phone.md:12
msgid ""
"**Programmable voice** - TwiML-style call control or a WebSocket media "
"stream, so the agent can drive a call turn by turn; the voice-agent "
"platforms wrap this with speech-to-text, an LLM, and text-to-speech."
msgstr ""
"<strong>可编程语音</strong> - TwiML 风格的呼叫控制或 WebSocket "
"媒体流，使智能体能够逐轮驱动通话；语音智能体平台在此之上封装了语音转文字、LLM 和文字转语音。"

#: docs/providers/phone.md:13
msgid ""
"**SIP trunking** - Bring the number into the agent's own PBX or media "
"server; the lowest-level and cheapest path at volume."
msgstr "<strong>SIP 中继</strong> - 将号码接入智能体自己的 PBX 或媒体服务器；这是规模化时最底层、最经济的路径。"

#: docs/providers/phone.md:14
msgid ""
"**Forwarding bridge** - Not an API: the owner's carrier forwards SMS or "
"calls to a CPaaS number or an app the agent reads. Ugly, but it passes VoIP "
"checks because the number of record is a real mobile."
msgstr ""
"<strong>转发桥接</strong> - 并非 API：所有者的运营商将短信或电话转发到某个 CPaaS "
"号码或智能体可读取的应用。方式笨拙，但能通过 VoIP 检测，因为登记号码是真实的手机号。"

