msgstr ""
"<strong>电子邮件身份验证记录</strong> - SPF、DKIM 和 DMARC（[RFC 7489](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc7489)）TXT 记录，缺少这些记录，智能体发送的任何邮件都无法送达。"

#: docs/providers/domains.md:13
msgid ""
