#: docs/providers/compute-and-browsers.md:3
msgid ""
"An agent needs a place where its code runs and its tools execute: a shell, a"
" filesystem, a network path, and often a browser, because a large share of "
"the web has no API. This is the [Compute](../stack/04-compute.md) layer. "
"Agent-native compute is created and destroyed by code in well under a "
"second, isolates each agent (or each task) from every other and from the "
"host, snapshots and resumes so a long task survives a restart, and exposes "
"egress controls so the owner can say which hosts the agent may reach. Agent-"
"native browsers are the same idea one level up: headless sessions started by"
" API, with persistent profiles, CAPTCHA and proxy handling, and an action "
"interface designed for an LLM rather than a test script."
msgstr ""
"智能体需要一个运行其代码和执行其工具的地方：一个 shell、一个文件系统、一条网络路径，并且通常还需要一个浏览器，因为网络上很大一部分内容没有 "
"API。这就是[计算资源](../stack/04-compute.md)层。智能体原生的计算资源可由代码在远低于一秒的时间内创建和销毁，将每个智能体（或每个任务）与其他智能体及宿主机相互隔离，支持快照与恢复以便长任务在重启后得以延续，并提供出站控制，让所有者可以指定智能体可访问哪些主机。智能体原生浏览器是同一理念的上层版本：通过"
" API 启动的无头会话，配备持久化配置文件、CAPTCHA 与代理处理，以及为 LLM 而非测试脚本设计的操作接口。"

#: docs/providers/compute-and-browsers.md:5
msgid ""
"The traps: running agent-generated code on the same host as the agent's "
"credentials turns every prompt injection into a key-exfiltration path; "
"containers alone share a kernel and are not a security boundary against "
"hostile code; browsers with the owner's logged-in cookies are a credential "
"store and must be treated as one; residential-proxy and anti-detection "
"features shade into terms-of-service violations for the sites being visited;"
" and every sandbox bills by the second of wall-clock time, so an agent that "
"forgets to tear down is a budget leak that belongs under "
"[Governance](../stack/10-governance.md) limits."
msgstr ""
"陷阱在于：在与智能体凭证相同的主机上运行智能体生成的代码，会使每一次提示注入都变成密钥外泄途径；容器本身共享内核，无法作为抵御恶意代码的安全边界；带有所有者已登录"
" Cookie "
"的浏览器本质上是凭证存储，必须按凭证存储对待；住宅代理与反检测功能会逐渐触及被访问网站的服务条款红线；而且每个沙箱都按实际运行时间按秒计费，因此忘记销毁的智能体就是一个预算漏洞，应纳入[治理](../stack/10-governance.md)限制之下。"

#: docs/providers/compute-and-browsers.md:9
msgid ""
"**Sandbox SDK** - `create()`, `exec()`, `write_file()`, `snapshot()`, "
"`kill()` over HTTP or gRPC; the interface E2B, Daytona, Modal, Vercel and "
"Cloudflare all converge on."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Sandbox SDK</strong> - 通过 HTTP 或 gRPC 提供 "
"`create()`、`exec()`、`write_file()`、`snapshot()`、`kill()`；这是 "
"E2B、Daytona、Modal、Vercel 和 Cloudflare 都趋同采用的接口。"

#: docs/providers/compute-and-browsers.md:10
msgid ""
"**Machines / VM API** - Start a Firecracker microVM or full VM from an image"
" with a REST call; slower to create than a sandbox, but a normal Linux box "
"with a stable IP."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Machines / VM API</strong> - 通过 REST 调用从镜像启动 Firecracker microVM "
"或完整虚拟机；创建速度比沙箱慢，但它是一台拥有稳定 IP 的普通 Linux 主机。"

#: docs/providers/compute-and-browsers.md:11
msgid ""
"**Container platform API** - Deploy long-running services and jobs; adequate"
" for the agent's own process, not for executing untrusted code without an "
"extra isolation layer."
msgstr ""
"<strong>容器平台 API</strong> - 部署长期运行的服务和任务；适合运行智能体自身的进程，但若无额外隔离层，不适合执行不可信代码。"

#: docs/providers/compute-and-browsers.md:12
msgid ""
"**Managed agent runtime** - A hosted loop that runs the agent framework "
