msgstr ""
"<strong>CDP / WebDriver</strong> - 基于 WebSocket 的 Chrome DevTools Protocol 或"
" WebDriver；Playwright 和 Puppeteer 使用的协议，也是所有远程浏览器提供方底层暴露的接口。"

#: docs/providers/compute-and-browsers.md:14
msgid ""
"**Action-level browser API** - `act(\"click the login button\")`, "
"`extract(schema)`, `observe()`; an LLM-facing layer over CDP that Stagehand,"
