#: docs/providers/wallets.md:3
msgid ""
"An agent that transacts on-chain, pays for APIs with stablecoins, or signs "
"anything that has to be verifiable later needs a key it can use and a wallet"
" built around it. This is the on-chain half of [Economic "
"Identity](../stack/05-economy.md) and it overlaps with "
"[Identity](../stack/01-identity.md), because the same key often anchors the "
"agent's DID or ERC-8004 registration. Agent-native here means the provider "
"expects the signer to be software: wallets are created by API, every "
"signature passes through a policy engine the owner controls (allow-lists, "
"per-transaction and daily caps, contract and method restrictions), and the "
"key material never sits in the agent's process memory."
msgstr ""
"如果一个智能体需要在链上交易、用稳定币支付 API "
"费用，或签署任何日后必须可验证的内容，它就需要一把可用的密钥以及围绕该密钥构建的钱包。这是[经济身份](../stack/05-economy.md)的链上部分，并与[身份](../stack/01-identity.md)有所重叠，因为同一把密钥往往也锚定着智能体的"
" DID 或 ERC-8004 注册。此处的“智能体原生”意味着提供方预期签名者是软件：钱包通过 API "
"创建，每次签名都经过所有者控制的策略引擎（白名单、单笔与每日限额、合约与方法限制），且密钥材料从不驻留在智能体的进程内存中。"

#: docs/providers/wallets.md:5
msgid ""
"The trap is custody. A private key in an environment variable on the agent's"
" host is one prompt injection away from an empty wallet, and there is no "
"chargeback. Provider-held custody moves the risk to the provider's security "
"and terms; MPC and TEE designs split or seal the key so neither the provider"
" nor the agent holds all of it; smart accounts move the policy on-chain "
"where it is enforceable without trusting anyone's API. All three are "
"acceptable. Self-custody on the agent's host is not, and this book does not "
"list providers for it."
msgstr ""
"陷阱在于托管。智能体主机上环境变量里的私钥，距离钱包被掏空只差一次提示注入，而且没有任何退款机制。由提供方托管则把风险转移到提供方的安全与条款上；MPC"
" 和 TEE 设计将密钥拆分或封存，使提供方和智能体都不完整持有；智能账户将策略放到链上，无需信任任何人的 API "
"即可强制执行。这三种方式都是可接受的。在智能体主机上自行托管则不可接受，本书不为此列出任何提供方。"

#: docs/providers/wallets.md:7
msgid "Custody archetypes"
msgstr "托管模式类型"

#: docs/providers/wallets.md:9
msgid ""
"**Provider-held with policy engine** - The provider generates and stores the"
" key (often inside a TEE) and exposes signing through an API that consults "
"an owner-defined policy on every request. Coinbase CDP Server Wallets, "
"Privy, Turnkey and Crossmint all work this way. Simplest to provision; the "
"policy language and audit log are the product."
msgstr ""
"<strong>服务提供方持有 + 策略引擎</strong> - 由服务提供方生成并存储密钥（通常在 TEE 内），并通过 API "
"提供签名，每次请求都会查询所有者定义的策略。Coinbase CDP Server Wallets、Privy、Turnkey 和 Crossmint "
"都采用这种方式。最易于配置；策略语言和审计日志即产品本身。"

#: docs/providers/wallets.md:10
msgid ""
"**MPC / TEE threshold signing** - The key exists only as shares across nodes"
" or inside sealed enclaves, and signing requires a quorum plus a "
"programmable condition. Lit Protocol's network, Turnkey's enclaves and "
"Fireblocks' MPC-CMP fall here. Stronger against a single compromised party; "
"more moving parts."
msgstr ""
"<strong>MPC / TEE 门限签名</strong> - "
"密钥仅以分片形式存在于多个节点之间或封闭的安全飞地内，签名需要法定数量的参与方外加可编程条件。Lit Protocol 网络、Turnkey "
"的安全飞地和 Fireblocks 的 MPC-CMP 属于此类。对单一参与方被攻破的抵抗力更强；但组件更多。"

#: docs/providers/wallets.md:11
msgid ""
"**Smart account + session keys** - The agent's wallet is a contract account "
"([ERC-4337](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4337), or an EOA upgraded via"
" [EIP-7702](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7702)). The owner's key "
"installs a module that grants the agent a _session key_ limited by target "
"contract, function selector, spend cap and expiry "
"([ERC-7715](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7715) describes the "
"permission request flow). Safe, ZeroDev and Alchemy Smart Wallets implement "
"this. The limits are on-chain and survive a provider outage; revocation is "
"one owner transaction."
msgstr ""
"<strong>智能账户 + 会话密钥</strong> - "
"智能体的钱包是一个合约账户（[ERC-4337](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4337)，或通过 "
"[EIP-7702](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7702) 升级的 "
"EOA）。所有者的密钥安装一个模块，向智能体授予受目标合约、函数选择器、支出上限和有效期限制的<em>会话密钥</em>（[ERC-7715](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7715)"
" 描述了权限请求流程）。Safe、ZeroDev 和 Alchemy Smart Wallets "
"实现了这种方式。限制在链上生效，即使服务提供方中断也依然有效；撤销只需所有者的一笔交易。"

#: docs/providers/wallets.md:12
msgid ""
"**Self-custody on the agent host** - Key file or env var on the sandbox. Not"
" recommended for anything holding real value; acceptable only for testnets "
"and for signing non-financial attestations where the key can be rotated "
"freely."
msgstr ""
"<strong>智能体宿主机自托管</strong> - "
"密钥文件或环境变量存放在沙箱中。不建议用于持有任何真实价值的场景；仅可用于测试网以及签署可自由轮换密钥的非金融类证明。"

#: docs/providers/wallets.md:14
msgid ""
"Record the choice in `spec.identity.keys[].custody` (`provider`, `tee`, "
"`mpc`) and `spec.economy.wallets[].custody`, and set the matching caps in "
"`spec.economy.budget`."
msgstr ""
"在 `spec.identity.keys[].custody`（`provider`、`tee`、`mpc`）和 "
"`spec.economy.wallets[].custody` 中记录所选方案，并在 `spec.economy.budget` 中设置相应的上限。"

