#: docs/providers/payments-and-cards.md:3
msgid ""
"Most of what an agent will ever buy is priced in fiat and sold by merchants "
"who take cards: API credits, SaaS seats, domain renewals, a flight. The fiat"
" half of [Economic Identity](../stack/05-economy.md) is therefore a card the"
" agent can present, with controls that make the card itself enforce the "
"budget, plus a way to pay other agents and services that never touch a card "
"network. Agent-native means cards are issued by API per agent or per task, "
"spend controls (merchant category, per-authorization and per-period caps, "
"single-use lifecycle) are attached at issuance, every authorization can be "
"approved or declined in real time by a webhook, and the transaction feed is "
"machine-readable so [Governance](../stack/10-governance.md) can reconcile "
"it."
msgstr ""
"智能体将购买的绝大多数东西都以法币计价，且由接受银行卡的商户出售：API 额度、SaaS "
"席位、域名续费、机票。因此，[经济身份](../stack/05-economy.md)的法币部分是一张智能体可以出示的卡，附带让卡本身强制执行预算的控制机制，外加一种向其他智能体和服务付款且完全不经过卡组织网络的方式。智能体原生意味着：卡通过"
" API 按智能体或按任务签发，消费控制（商户类别、单笔授权与周期性上限、一次性生命周期）在签发时附加，每笔授权都可由 webhook "
"实时批准或拒绝，交易流水为机器可读，以便[治理](../stack/10-governance.md)进行对账。"

#: docs/providers/payments-and-cards.md:5
msgid ""
"The trap is that no card issuer or payment processor will onboard an agent. "
"KYC (for a person) or KYB (for a business) is passed by the **owner's legal "
"entity**; the agent is a cardholder or an API key under that entity's "
"programme, and the entity is liable for every charge. Consumer virtual-card "
"products usually forbid automated use in their terms. Stablecoin cards shift"
" settlement on-chain but still run KYB at issuance. Agent-to-agent payment "
"rails avoid the card network but add a counterparty whose reputation you "
"must judge; see [Trust](../stack/09-trust.md)."
msgstr ""
"陷阱在于：没有任何发卡机构或支付处理商会为智能体开户。KYC（针对个人）或 "
"KYB（针对企业）由<strong>所有者的法律实体</strong>通过；智能体只是该实体计划下的持卡人或 API "
"密钥，且该实体对每笔扣款承担责任。消费级虚拟卡产品的条款通常禁止自动化使用。稳定币卡将结算转移到链上，但签发时仍需 "
"KYB。智能体间支付轨道绕开了卡组织网络，但引入了一个必须评判其信誉的交易对手；参见[信任](../stack/09-trust.md)。"

#: docs/providers/payments-and-cards.md:9
msgid ""
"**Card issuing API** - Create cardholder, issue virtual card, set spending "
"controls, retrieve PAN/CVC once for the agent to use, freeze or cancel."
msgstr ""
"<strong>发卡 API</strong> - 创建持卡人、签发虚拟卡、设置消费控制、一次性获取 PAN/CVC 供智能体使用、冻结或注销。"

#: docs/providers/payments-and-cards.md:10
msgid ""
"**Real-time authorization webhook** - The issuer asks the owner's endpoint "
"to approve each authorization within a timeout; the natural place to enforce"
" [Authority](../stack/08-authority.md) rules and to require a human for "
"large amounts."
msgstr ""
"<strong>实时授权 webhook</strong> - "
"发卡机构在超时时间内请求所有者的端点批准每笔授权；这是执行[权限](../stack/08-authority.md)规则以及要求大额交易由人工审批的天然位置。"

#: docs/providers/payments-and-cards.md:11
msgid ""
"**Spend-management API** - Corporate cards with budgets, approvals and "
"receipts; the agent is a \"user\" with a card and a limit."
msgstr "<strong>支出管理 API</strong> - 具备预算、审批和票据功能的企业卡；智能体是一名拥有卡片和额度的\"用户\"。"

#: docs/providers/payments-and-cards.md:12
msgid ""
"**Business banking API** - Accounts, ACH/wire, and cards from a bank or "
"bank-programme fintech; the owner's account, the agent's scoped token."
msgstr ""
"<strong>企业银行 API</strong> - "
"由银行或银行合作金融科技公司提供的账户、ACH/电汇和卡片；账户归所有者所有，智能体使用受限范围的令牌。"

#: docs/providers/payments-and-cards.md:13
msgid ""
"**Stablecoin card** - A card funded from an on-chain balance; bridges the "
