msgstr "<strong>稳定币卡</strong> - 由链上余额充值的卡片；将[钱包](wallets.md)与支持刷卡的商户连接起来。"

#: docs/providers/payments-and-cards.md:14
msgid ""
"**Agent payment rail** - Prepaid or wallet-backed accounts where an agent "
"pays another agent or a service by API, often with a KYA credential "
"attached; x402 for per-request HTTP payments is covered under [Payments "
"standards](../standards/payments.md)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>智能体支付通道</strong> - 预付或钱包支持的账户，智能体通过 API 向另一个智能体或服务付款，通常附带 KYA "
"凭证；用于按请求计费的 HTTP 支付的 x402 见[支付标准](../standards/payments.md)。"

