#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:3
msgid ""
"Every tool an agent calls on someone else's system wants a credential: an "
"OAuth grant to the owner's Google Workspace, an API key for a data vendor, a"
" GitHub App installation token, a database password. The "
"[Authentication](../stack/03-authentication.md) layer is about where those "
"credentials live and how the agent gets to use one without ever being able "
"to read it. Agent-native providers here do three things: hold tokens in a "
"vault the agent's process cannot dump, hand the agent a short-lived, "
"narrowly scoped credential (or perform the call on its behalf) per action, "
"and give the owner a single place to see and revoke every grant the agent "
"holds."
msgstr ""
"智能体在他人系统上调用的每个工具都需要凭证：所有者 Google Workspace 的 OAuth 授权、数据供应商的 API 密钥、GitHub "
"App "
"安装令牌、数据库密码。[身份验证](../stack/03-authentication.md)层关注的是这些凭证存放在哪里，以及智能体如何在永远无法读取凭证的情况下使用它。此处的智能体原生服务提供方会做三件事：将令牌保存在智能体进程无法转储的保险库中，在每次操作时向智能体发放短期、范围狭窄的凭证（或代其执行调用），并为所有者提供一个可查看和撤销智能体所持全部授权的统一入口。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:5
msgid ""
"The traps are the ones every leaked-key incident is made of: long-lived "
"secrets in environment variables inside a sandbox that also runs untrusted "
"code; OAuth grants requested with the owner's full scope because the "
"connector asked for it; tokens that outlive the agent because nobody wired "
"[Death](../lifecycle/death.md) to the vault; and \"just use my session\" "
"browser cookies that give the agent everything the owner can do. Whatever "
"provider you pick, the test is whether "
"`spec.authentication.credentials[].secretRef` points at something outside "
"the agent's runtime and whether `rotation` is a schedule, not a hope."
msgstr ""
"这些陷阱正是每次密钥泄露事件的根源：长期有效的密钥以环境变量形式存放在同时运行不受信任代码的沙箱中；因为连接器要求就以所有者的完整权限范围申请的 "
"OAuth "
"授权；由于没人将[死亡](../lifecycle/death.md)与保险库联动而比智能体存活更久的令牌；以及\"直接用我的会话\"式的浏览器 "
"Cookie，让智能体拥有所有者能做的一切。无论选择哪个服务提供方，检验标准都是 "
"`spec.authentication.credentials[].secretRef` 是否指向智能体运行时之外的存储，以及 `rotation` "
"是一份计划表，而不是一种期望。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:7
msgid "Three groups"
msgstr "三类"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:9
msgid ""
"**Tool-auth brokers and token vaults.** These sit between the agent and "
"hundreds of third-party APIs. The owner (or the end user the agent serves) "
"completes the OAuth dance once; the broker stores the refresh token, "
"refreshes it, and exposes each API as a tool call the agent can make through"
" the broker's own credential. The agent never sees the third-party token. "
"Composio, Arcade, Nango, Pipedream Connect and Paragon are the main options;"
" the differences are catalogue size, whether tools are pre-wrapped for LLMs,"
" self-hosting, and how granular the per-tool scoping is."
msgstr ""
"<strong>工具授权代理与令牌保管库。</strong> 它们位于智能体与数百个第三方 API 之间。所有者（或智能体所服务的终端用户）只需完成一次"
" OAuth 流程；代理服务存储刷新令牌并负责刷新，同时将每个 API "
"以工具调用的形式暴露出来，智能体通过代理服务自身的凭证进行调用。智能体永远不会看到第三方令牌。Composio、Arcade、Nango、Pipedream"
" Connect 和 Paragon 是主要选择；区别在于目录规模、工具是否已针对 LLM 预封装、是否支持自托管，以及按工具划分的权限范围粒度。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:11
msgid ""
"**Identity providers with agent features.** Enterprise IdPs have started to "
"register agents as first-class principals alongside users and service "
"accounts. Auth0 for AI Agents adds a Token Vault for third-party tokens and "
"async user-confirmation flows; Okta registers agents in Universal Directory "
"and governs them through its identity fabric; WorkOS AuthKit and Descope's "
"Agentic Identity Hub give an application's own MCP server OAuth 2.1 with "
"tool-level scopes; Microsoft Entra Agent ID gives agents Entra identities "
"with conditional access; Keycard issues short-lived composite credentials "
"(user + device + agent + task) after policy evaluation. Choose one of these "
"when the agent must be an identity in the same directory the humans are in, "
"so that access reviews and offboarding cover it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>具备智能体功能的身份提供方。</strong> 企业 IdP 已开始将智能体注册为与用户和服务账户同级的一等主体。Auth0 for "
"AI Agents 增加了用于第三方令牌的 Token Vault 和异步用户确认流程；Okta 在 Universal Directory "
"中注册智能体并通过其身份编织层进行治理；WorkOS AuthKit 和 Descope 的 Agentic Identity Hub 为应用自身的 "
"MCP 服务器提供带工具级权限范围的 OAuth 2.1；Microsoft Entra Agent ID 为智能体提供带条件访问的 Entra "
"身份；Keycard 在策略评估后签发短期复合凭证（用户 + 设备 + 智能体 + "
"任务）。当智能体必须成为与人类同一目录中的身份，从而使访问审查和离职处理覆盖到它时，请选择其中之一。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:13
msgid ""
"**Secret stores.** For credentials that are not OAuth grants (API keys, "
"database passwords, signing keys) the answer is a secrets manager with "
"dynamic or short-TTL secrets and an audit log: 1Password SDKs and Agentic "
"Autofill (which fills a login in the agent's remote browser over an "
"encrypted channel with human approval, without exposing the password to the "
"model), HashiCorp Vault, Infisical, Doppler and Bitwarden Secrets Manager. "
"Add an **MCP gateway** such as agentgateway in front of the agent's tool "
"servers so that authentication, rate limits and logging are enforced once, "
"at the boundary, rather than inside each server."
msgstr ""
"<strong>密钥存储。</strong> 对于并非 OAuth 授权的凭证（API 密钥、数据库密码、签名密钥），答案是使用具备动态或短 TTL "
"密钥和审计日志的密钥管理器：1Password SDK 和 Agentic "
"Autofill（通过加密通道并经人工批准，在智能体的远程浏览器中填充登录信息，而不向模型暴露密码）、HashiCorp "
"Vault、Infisical、Doppler 和 Bitwarden Secrets Manager。在智能体的工具服务器前添加一个 "
"<strong>MCP 网关</strong>（如 "
"agentgateway），使身份验证、速率限制和日志记录在边界处统一执行一次，而不是在每个服务器内部执行。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:17
msgid ""
"**Managed OAuth + tool proxy** - Broker holds the token; agent calls "
"`execute(tool, args)`; broker injects the credential."
msgstr ""
"<strong>托管式 OAuth + 工具代理</strong> - 代理服务持有令牌；智能体调用 `execute(tool, "
"args)`；代理服务注入凭证。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:18
msgid ""
"**Token Vault / token exchange** - Agent presents its own identity token and"
" receives a downstream access token via [RFC 8693](https://www.rfc-"
"editor.org/rfc/rfc8693) style exchange, scoped to the requested resource."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Token Vault / 令牌交换</strong> - 智能体出示自身的身份令牌，并通过 [RFC "
"8693](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8693) 风格的交换获得下游访问令牌，权限范围限定于所请求的资源。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:19
msgid ""
"**MCP Authorization** - OAuth 2.1 with protected-resource metadata, as "
"specified in the [MCP authorization "
"spec](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/draft/basic/authorization);"
" the interface an agent uses to log in to an MCP server."
msgstr ""
"<strong>MCP 授权</strong> - 采用受保护资源元数据的 OAuth 2.1，遵循 [MCP "
"授权规范](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/draft/basic/authorization)；这是智能体登录"
" MCP 服务器所使用的接口。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:20
msgid ""
"**Workload identity** - [SPIFFE](https://spiffe.io/) SVIDs or cloud IAM "
"roles bound to the agent's runtime instead of static keys."
msgstr ""
"<strong>工作负载身份</strong> - [SPIFFE](https://spiffe.io/) SVID 或绑定到智能体运行时的云 IAM"
" 角色，而非静态密钥。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:21
msgid ""
"**Secrets API / SDK** - Read a secret by reference at call time; dynamic "
"secrets generated per lease and revoked on expiry."
msgstr "<strong>密钥 API / SDK</strong> - 在调用时按引用读取密钥；动态密钥按租约生成，到期即撤销。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:22
msgid ""
"**Approval-gated autofill** - The vault fills a form in a headless browser "
"after the owner approves; the model never sees the secret."
msgstr "<strong>审批门控自动填充</strong> - 所有者批准后，保险库在无头浏览器中填写表单；模型永远不会看到密钥。"

#: docs/providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md:23
msgid ""
"**MCP / A2A gateway** - A data plane that terminates auth, applies policy "
"and emits telemetry for every tool call."
msgstr "<strong>MCP / A2A 网关</strong> - 一个数据平面，为每次工具调用终结身份验证、应用策略并输出遥测数据。"

