#: docs/providers/memory-and-storage.md:3
msgid ""
"An agent without memory restarts from zero every run: it re-learns the "
"owner's preferences, repeats mistakes, and cannot say what it did yesterday."
" The [Memory](../stack/07-memory.md) layer covers everything that persists "
"between runs: working state for the current task, episodic records of past "
"interactions, semantic knowledge distilled from them, plain files, and "
"knowledge graphs of entities and relations. Agent-native memory providers "
"expose _add / search / update / forget_ over natural-language content, scope"
" memories to an agent, a user and a session, and handle the extraction and "
"consolidation that turns a transcript into facts. Vector stores and object "
"storage are the substrate underneath; they are not agent-native, and do not "
"need to be."
msgstr ""
"没有记忆的智能体每次运行都从零开始：它需要重新学习所有者的偏好、重复犯错，也无法说出自己昨天做了什么。[记忆](../stack/07-memory.md)层涵盖运行之间持久保存的一切：当前任务的工作状态、过往交互的情景记录、由其提炼出的语义知识、普通文件，以及实体与关系的知识图谱。面向智能体的原生记忆服务提供方在自然语言内容之上暴露"
" <em>add / search / update / forget</em> "
"接口，将记忆按智能体、用户和会话划定范围，并处理将对话记录转化为事实的提取与整合。向量存储和对象存储是其下层基础设施；它们并非智能体原生，也无需如此。"

#: docs/providers/memory-and-storage.md:5
msgid ""
"The traps: memory is an attack surface (OWASP ASI06, memory poisoning), so "
"what an agent writes to its own long-term store from untrusted input needs "
"the same scrutiny as what it executes; memory is also personal data, so "
"retention (`spec.memory.stores[].retention`) and encryption at rest "
"(`spec.memory.encryptionAtRest`) are compliance decisions, not tuning knobs;"
" provider lock-in is real, because exported embeddings are useless without "
"the same model; and an agent whose memory lives only in a hosted service "
"cannot be [migrated](../lifecycle/migration.md) or "
"[retired](../lifecycle/death.md) cleanly unless the export path was tested "
"at birth."
msgstr ""
"陷阱在于：记忆是一个攻击面（OWASP "
"ASI06，记忆投毒），因此智能体从不可信输入写入自身长期存储的内容需要与其执行的内容受到同等审查；记忆也是个人数据，因此保留策略（`spec.memory.stores[].retention`）和静态加密（`spec.memory.encryptionAtRest`）是合规决策，而非调优旋钮；服务提供方锁定是真实存在的，因为导出的嵌入向量若没有相同的模型便毫无用处；此外，如果智能体的记忆仅存在于托管服务中，除非导出路径在诞生时经过测试，否则它就无法被干净地[迁移](../lifecycle/migration.md)或[退役](../lifecycle/death.md)。"

