#: docs/providers/observability-and-hitl.md:3
msgid ""
"The [Governance](../stack/10-governance.md) layer is the owner's window into"
" the agent and their hand on the brake. Four capabilities make that "
"concrete: tracing every model call, tool call and decision so a run can be "
"reconstructed after the fact; guardrails that inspect inputs and outputs for"
" injection, leakage and policy violations before they take effect; metering "
"that turns tokens, tool calls and dollars into budgets with hard stops; and "
"a human-approval channel through which the agent can pause and ask before an"
" action that [Authority](../stack/08-authority.md) marks as requiring a "
"person. Agent-native tooling here understands agent structure (runs, steps, "
"tool spans, sub-agents) rather than only HTTP requests, and lets an approval"
" be a first-class event rather than a Slack message someone hopes to notice."
msgstr ""
"[治理](../stack/10-governance.md)层是所有者观察智能体的窗口，也是他们踩下刹车的手。四项能力使之具体化：追踪每次模型调用、工具调用和决策，以便事后重建一次运行；护栏在输入和输出生效之前检查注入、泄漏和策略违规；计量将"
" "
"token、工具调用和资金转化为带硬性上限的预算；以及人工审批通道，当[权限](../stack/08-authority.md)将某项操作标记为需要人工时，智能体可暂停并先行询问。此处的智能体原生工具理解智能体结构（运行、步骤、工具跨度、子智能体），而不仅仅是"
" HTTP 请求，并让审批成为一等公民事件，而非某人希望能注意到的一条 Slack 消息。"

#: docs/providers/observability-and-hitl.md:5
msgid ""
"The traps: tracing captures prompts and tool arguments, which means it "
"captures secrets and personal data unless redaction is configured; an "
"approval channel with a default of \"approve on timeout\" is not an approval"
" channel; guardrails add latency and false positives that agents learn to "
"route around by rephrasing; and budgets enforced only inside the agent's own"
" code are not budgets, because the code is what you are trying to bound. Put"
" the meter at the gateway (see [Models & Skills](models-and-skills.md)) and "
"the card (see [Payments & Cards](payments-and-cards.md)), and make "
"`spec.governance.auditLog` point at a store the agent cannot write to "
"selectively."
msgstr ""
"陷阱：追踪会捕获提示词和工具参数，这意味着除非配置了脱敏，否则会捕获机密和个人数据；默认「超时即批准」的审批渠道不是审批渠道；护栏会增加延迟和误报，智能体会学会通过改写措辞来绕过它们；仅在智能体自身代码内执行的预算不是预算，因为该代码正是你要约束的对象。请把计量器放在网关（见[模型与技能](models-"
"and-skills.md)）和卡片（见[支付与卡片](payments-and-cards.md)）处，并让 "
"`spec.governance.auditLog` 指向一个智能体无法选择性写入的存储。"

