#: docs/providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md:3
msgid ""
"Beyond email and phone, an agent needs accounts on the platforms where its "
"work happens (GitHub, Slack, Discord), a way to be present on social "
"networks if it speaks in public, and, behind all of it, a legal entity whose"
" name goes on every contract, card programme and bank account. These sit "
"across [Presence](../stack/02-presence.md), "
"[Identity](../stack/01-identity.md) and [Economic "
"Identity](../stack/05-economy.md), and they are where the gap between "
"\"agent-native\" and \"usable\" is widest. Agent-native platforms have a "
"first-class non-human account type (an App, a bot user) with its own "
"credentials, scopes and audit trail. Open protocols let a keypair hold an "
"account outright. Legal wrappers let a human or a DAO stand behind the agent"
" so that a bank or registrar has someone to hold accountable."
msgstr ""
"除了电子邮件和电话之外，智能体还需要在其工作发生的平台（GitHub、Slack、Discord）上拥有账户；如果它在公开场合发言，还需要一种在社交网络上存在的方式；而在这一切背后，还需要一个法律实体，其名称将出现在每一份合同、卡计划和银行账户上。这些内容横跨[在线存在](../stack/02-presence.md)、[身份](../stack/01-identity.md)和[经济身份](../stack/05-economy.md)，也是\"智能体原生\"与\"可用\"之间差距最大的地方。智能体原生平台拥有一等公民级别的非人类账户类型（App、机器人用户），具备自己的凭证、权限范围和审计追踪。开放协议允许密钥对直接持有账户。法律包装结构让人类或"
" DAO 为智能体背书，使银行或注册机构有可以追责的对象。"

#: docs/providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md:5
msgid ""
"The trap that dominates this chapter is stated plainly: **as of 2026, no "
"bank opens an account for an agent.** Every banking, card and payment "
"relationship is opened by the owner's legal entity after KYB, and the agent "
"receives a scoped API token, a card with controls, or a sub-account. The "
"same holds for most developer platforms: GitHub's terms allow one free "
"machine account per person and make the human who created it responsible for"
" its actions; Slack and Discord bots are installed into a workspace or "
"server by an admin. Accounts an agent creates for itself by pretending to be"
" a human violate terms and get closed. Provision the entity first, then the "
"accounts under it, and record the entity as `spec.authority.principal`."
msgstr ""
"本章的核心陷阱可以直白地说明：<strong>截至 2026 "
"年，没有任何银行会为智能体开设账户。</strong>每一个银行、卡和支付关系都是由所有者的法律实体在完成 KYB 后开立的，智能体获得的是受限范围的 "
"API 令牌、带管控的卡片或子账户。大多数开发者平台也是如此：GitHub "
"的条款允许每人拥有一个免费的机器账户，并让创建它的人类对其行为负责；Slack 和 Discord "
"机器人由管理员安装到工作区或服务器中。智能体通过冒充人类为自己创建的账户违反条款并会被关闭。请先配置实体，再在其下配置账户，并将该实体记录为 "
"`spec.authority.principal`。"

#: docs/providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md:9
msgid ""
"**Platform App** - A registered application with its own identity, granular "
"permissions and installation tokens that expire; the agent acts as the App, "
"not as a user. GitHub Apps, Slack apps with bot users, Discord bots."
msgstr ""
"<strong>平台 App</strong> - 一个已注册的应用程序，拥有自己的身份、细粒度权限和会过期的安装令牌；智能体以 App "
"身份而非用户身份行事。GitHub Apps、带机器人用户的 Slack 应用、Discord 机器人。"

#: docs/providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md:10
msgid ""
"**Fine-grained personal access token** - A token minted from a human's or "
"machine user's account, scoped to repositories and permissions with an "
"expiry; simpler than an App, but the actions are attributed to that account."
msgstr ""
"<strong>细粒度个人访问令牌</strong> - 从人类或机器用户账户签发的令牌，限定于特定仓库和权限并带有有效期；比 App "
"更简单，但其操作会被归属到该账户。"

#: docs/providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md:11
msgid ""
"**Machine user** - A separate user account operated by automation; permitted"
" by GitHub within limits and owned by a human who accepts the terms on its "
"behalf."
msgstr ""
"<strong>机器用户</strong> - 由自动化程序操作的独立用户账户；GitHub 在一定限制内允许其存在，并由代其接受条款的人类所有。"

#: docs/providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md:12
msgid ""
"**Open social protocol account** - An identity controlled by a keypair or a "
"DID: AT Protocol accounts (Bluesky) with a `did:plc` and a PDS; Farcaster "
"IDs bound to an Ethereum address; Nostr identities that are simply a public "
"key. No terms of service stand between an agent and an account, though "
"individual apps and relays may moderate."
msgstr ""
"<strong>开放社交协议账户</strong> - 由密钥对或 DID 控制的身份：拥有 `did:plc` 和 PDS 的 AT Protocol"
" 账户（Bluesky）；绑定到以太坊地址的 Farcaster ID；本质上就是一个公钥的 Nostr "
"身份。智能体与账户之间不存在服务条款的阻隔，不过各个应用和中继可能会进行内容审核。"

#: docs/providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md:13
msgid ""
"**Legal wrapper** - An LLC, a Wyoming DUNA, or a Marshall Islands DAO LLC, "
"formed through a filing service and holding the bank account, cards and "
"contracts. The agent is an asset or an operator of the entity, never the "
"entity."
msgstr ""
"<strong>法律实体外壳</strong> - 通过注册服务成立的 LLC、Wyoming DUNA 或 Marshall Islands DAO "
"LLC，持有银行账户、银行卡和合同。智能体是该实体的资产或运营者，绝不是实体本身。"

#: docs/providers/accounts-and-legal-entity.md:14
msgid ""
"**Banking / card API under the entity** - Covered in [Payments & "
"Cards](payments-and-cards.md); listed here because the entity is the "
"prerequisite."
msgstr ""
"<strong>实体名下的银行 / 银行卡 API</strong> - 在[支付与银行卡](payments-and-"
"cards.md)中介绍；列于此处是因为实体是其前提条件。"

