#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:3
msgid ""
"The Birth Procedure is the ordered provisioning of the ten layers of the "
"[Agent Birth Stack](../birth-stack.md), ending with a written Birth Profile "
"and a running agent. The order matters more than the tooling: most "
"provisioning mistakes are not wrong providers but right providers in the "
"wrong sequence. This chapter gives the sequence, a checklist per layer, and "
"the manifest that comes out the other end."
msgstr ""
"诞生流程（Birth Procedure）是按顺序配置[智能体诞生栈](../birth-"
"stack.md)十个层的过程，最终产出一份书面的诞生档案（Birth Profile）和一个运行中的智能体。顺序比工具更重要：大多数配置错误不是选错了提供方，而是正确的提供方在错误的顺序中。本章给出该顺序、每层的检查清单，以及最终产出的清单。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:5 docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:14
#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:5 docs/lifecycle/death.md:5
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "流程"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:7
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"    %% \"i18n\"\n"
"    participant O as Owner\n"
"    participant P as Provisioner (human or script)\n"
"    participant V as Providers (email / compute / wallet / secret store)\n"
"    participant R as Registries\n"
"    participant A as Agent\n"
"\n"
"    O->>P: purpose, budget, limits, owner DID\n"
"    P->>P: 1 generate identity keys, mint DID\n"
"    P->>V: 2 domain, inbox, endpoints\n"
"    P->>V: 3 create secret store, issue credentials\n"
"    P->>V: 4 provision compute (egress allowlist, storage)\n"
"    P->>V: 5 wallet with budget and policy\n"
"    P->>V: 6 model access, tools, skills\n"
"    P->>V: 7 memory stores with retention\n"
"    O->>P: 8 sign delegations and approval rules\n"
"    P->>R: 9 owner attestation, registry entries\n"
"    P->>V: 10 audit sink, kill switch wired, recovery recorded\n"
"    P->>P: write Birth Profile (birth.yaml)\n"
"    P->>A: start with secret refs, not secrets\n"
"    A->>R: publish agent card\n"
"    A->>O: first heartbeat in audit log\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"    %% \"i18n\"\n"
"    participant O as 所有者\n"
"    participant P as 配置执行方（人工或脚本）\n"
"    participant V as 服务提供方（邮箱 / 计算资源 / 钱包 / 密钥存储）\n"
"    participant R as 注册中心\n"
"    participant A as 智能体\n"
"\n"
"    O->>P: 目的、预算、限制、所有者 DID\n"
"    P->>P: 1 生成身份密钥，铸造 DID\n"
"    P->>V: 2 域名、收件箱、端点\n"
"    P->>V: 3 创建密钥存储，签发凭证\n"
"    P->>V: 4 配置计算资源（出站访问白名单、存储）\n"
"    P->>V: 5 带预算与策略的钱包\n"
"    P->>V: 6 模型访问、工具、技能\n"
"    P->>V: 7 带保留策略的记忆存储\n"
"    O->>P: 8 签署委托授权与审批规则\n"
"    P->>R: 9 所有者证明、注册条目\n"
"    P->>V: 10 审计接收端、接通紧急停止开关、记录恢复方案\n"
"    P->>P: 写入诞生档案（birth.yaml）\n"
"    P->>A: 以密钥引用而非密钥本身启动\n"
"    A->>R: 发布智能体名片\n"
"    A->>O: 审计日志中的首次心跳\n"
"```"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:33
msgid "Checklist"
msgstr "检查清单"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:35
msgid "**1. Identity** ([layer](../stack/01-identity.md))"
msgstr "<strong>1. 身份</strong>（[层](../stack/01-identity.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:36
msgid "Owner DID or org handle recorded in `metadata.owner`."
msgstr "所有者 DID 或组织账号记录在 `metadata.owner` 中。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:37
msgid ""
"Signing key generated with a custody model chosen (`self`, `owner`, "
"`provider`, `tee`, `mpc`); private key never on the agent host unless "
"custody is `self`."
msgstr ""
"签名密钥已生成，并选定托管模型（`self`、`owner`、`provider`、`tee`、`mpc`）；除非托管为 "
"`self`，私钥绝不放在智能体主机上。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:38
msgid ""
"DID minted (`did:web` on an owner-controlled domain is the default) and "
"resolvable."
msgstr "DID 已铸造（默认使用所有者控制域名上的 `did:web`）并可解析。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:39
msgid "Key ID carries a date suffix so rotation is visible."
msgstr "密钥 ID 带有日期后缀，使轮换可见。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:41
msgid "**2. Presence** ([layer](../stack/02-presence.md))"
msgstr "<strong>2. 在线存在</strong>（[层](../stack/02-presence.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:42
msgid ""
"Domain or subdomain under owner control, DNS API access for the provisioner."
msgstr "域名或子域名处于所有者控制之下，配置方拥有 DNS API 访问权限。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:43
msgid "Inbox created on an agent-native provider; inbound webhooks confirmed."
msgstr "已在智能体原生服务提供方处创建收件箱；入站 webhook 已确认。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:44
msgid "Endpoints reserved (A2A, MCP, HTTPS) even if not yet serving."
msgstr "已预留端点（A2A、MCP、HTTPS），即使尚未提供服务。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:45
msgid "Phone only if a real use exists; note 10DLC and OTP restrictions."
msgstr "仅在有真实用途时才配置电话；注意 10DLC 与 OTP 限制。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:47
msgid "**3. Authentication** ([layer](../stack/03-authentication.md))"
msgstr "<strong>3. 身份验证</strong>（[层](../stack/03-authentication.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:48
msgid "Secret store path created; the provisioner writes, the agent reads."
msgstr "已创建密钥存储路径；由供应方写入，智能体读取。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:49
msgid ""
"Every third-party credential issued with minimum scopes and a `rotation` "
"duration."
msgstr "每个第三方凭证均以最小权限范围签发，并附带 `rotation` 时长。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:50
msgid "OAuth grants completed through the agent's own inbox, not the owner's."
msgstr "OAuth 授权通过智能体自己的收件箱完成，而非所有者的收件箱。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:51
msgid "No secret literal in any file that will be committed or logged."
msgstr "任何将被提交或记录到日志的文件中不得包含密钥字面值。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:53
msgid "**4. Compute** ([layer](../stack/04-compute.md))"
msgstr "<strong>4. 计算资源</strong>（[层](../stack/04-compute.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:54
msgid ""
"Runtime chosen with isolation level recorded (`microvm` preferred for "
"untrusted input)."
msgstr "已选定运行时并记录隔离级别（处理不可信输入时首选 `microvm`）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:55
msgid "Egress allowlist written; default deny."
msgstr "已编写出站访问白名单；默认拒绝。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:56
msgid "Storage bucket created with the agent's own credential."
msgstr "已使用智能体自己的凭证创建存储桶。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:57
msgid "Browser sandbox, if needed, isolated from the runtime."
msgstr "如需浏览器沙箱，须与运行时隔离。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:59
msgid "**5. Economic Identity** ([layer](../stack/05-economy.md))"
msgstr "<strong>5. 经济身份</strong>（[层](../stack/05-economy.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:60
msgid ""
"Budget (`perTransaction`, `perDay`, `perMonth`) written before any wallet "
"address exists."
msgstr "在任何钱包地址存在之前，已写入预算（`perTransaction`、`perDay`、`perMonth`）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:61
msgid ""
"Wallet created under a policy engine that enforces that budget at the "
"signer, not in prompt text."
msgstr "钱包在策略引擎下创建，该引擎在签名器层面强制执行预算，而非依赖提示词文本。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:62
msgid "Card issued only with spend controls attached."
msgstr "仅在附加消费管控的前提下签发银行卡。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:63
msgid "Payment protocols listed; funding kept to one cycle of budget."
msgstr "已列出支付协议；资金保持在一个预算周期以内。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:65
msgid "**6. Capabilities** ([layer](../stack/06-capabilities.md))"
msgstr "<strong>6. 能力</strong>（[层](../stack/06-capabilities.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:66
msgid "Model access via gateway with per-key budget."
msgstr "通过网关访问模型，并按密钥设置预算。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:67
msgid "Tools pinned by source; MCP servers reviewed for scope."
msgstr "工具按来源锁定；MCP 服务器经过范围审查。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:68
msgid "Skills listed by name and version."
msgstr "技能按名称和版本列出。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:70
msgid "**7. Memory** ([layer](../stack/07-memory.md))"
msgstr "<strong>7. 记忆</strong>（[层](../stack/07-memory.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:71
msgid "One store per kind, each with a `retention`."
msgstr "每种类型一个存储，各自配有 `retention`。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:72
msgid "Encryption at rest on."
msgstr "已开启静态加密。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:73
msgid ""
"Export path tested once before go-live (needed for [migration](migration.md)"
" and [death](death.md))."
msgstr "在上线前测试过一次导出路径（[迁移](migration.md)和[死亡](death.md)所需）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:75
msgid "**8. Authority** ([layer](../stack/08-authority.md))"
msgstr "<strong>8. 权限</strong>（[层](../stack/08-authority.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:76
msgid "Principal named."
msgstr "已指明主体。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:77
msgid ""
"Delegations signed by the owner, scoped narrowly, with `expires` on anything"
" financial."
msgstr "委托授权由所有者签署，范围严格收窄，所有涉及财务的均设有 `expires`。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:78
msgid "`canSubDelegate` false unless a sub-agent design exists."
msgstr "除非存在子智能体设计，否则 `canSubDelegate` 为 false。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:79
msgid "Approval rules bound to a channel a human actually watches."
msgstr "审批规则绑定到有人实际关注的渠道。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:81
msgid "**9. Trust** ([layer](../stack/09-trust.md))"
msgstr "<strong>9. 信任</strong>（[层](../stack/09-trust.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:82
msgid ""
"Owner attestation issued as a verifiable credential and hosted at a stable "
"URL."
msgstr "所有者证明以可验证凭证形式签发，并托管在稳定的 URL 上。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:83
msgid ""
"Registry entries (ERC-8004, agent card) created and linked back to the DID."
msgstr "已创建注册表条目（ERC-8004、agent card）并回链至 DID。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:84
msgid "KYA level recorded if the agent will transact with strangers."
msgstr "如果智能体将与陌生方交易，则记录 KYA 等级。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:86
msgid "**10. Governance** ([layer](../stack/10-governance.md))"
msgstr "<strong>10. 治理</strong>（[层](../stack/10-governance.md)）"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:87
msgid "Audit sink receiving traces before the first task runs."
msgstr "审计接收端在首个任务运行之前即开始接收追踪数据。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:88
msgid ""
"Kill switch tested: it must revoke credentials, suspend runtime, and freeze "
"wallets from one action."
msgstr "紧急停止开关已测试：它必须能通过一次操作撤销凭证、暂停运行时并冻结钱包。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:89
msgid "Recovery path written in words a second person can follow."
msgstr "恢复路径以第二个人能够照做的文字写明。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:90
msgid "Review cadence set and the first review scheduled."
msgstr "已设定审查节奏，并安排了首次审查。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:92 docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:47
#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:50 docs/lifecycle/death.md:59
msgid "Per-layer notes"
msgstr "各层备注"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:94 docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:49
#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:61
msgid "What happens at this stage"
msgstr "此阶段发生的事情"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:96
msgid "Keys and DID created first; everything downstream binds to them."
msgstr "首先创建密钥和 DID；下游的一切都绑定到它们。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:97
msgid "Domain and inbox exist so OAuth and account signups can complete."
msgstr "域名和收件箱已存在，以便完成 OAuth 和账户注册。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:98
msgid "Secret store created; credentials issued as references."
msgstr "创建密钥存储；凭证以引用形式签发。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:99 docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:54
#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:57 docs/lifecycle/death.md:66
msgid "4 Compute"
msgstr "4 计算资源"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:99
msgid "Runtime built to read from the store; egress narrowed."
msgstr "运行时构建为从存储中读取；出站访问已收紧。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:100
msgid "Budget defined, then wallet created under policy."
msgstr "先定义预算，然后在策略约束下创建钱包。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:101
msgid "Models and tools attached, each behind a credential from layer 3."
msgstr "接入模型和工具，每项都由第 3 层的凭证保护。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:102 docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:57
#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:60 docs/lifecycle/death.md:69
msgid "7 Memory"
msgstr "7 记忆"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:102
msgid "Stores provisioned with retention; nothing written yet."
msgstr "存储已按保留策略配置；尚未写入任何内容。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:103
msgid "Owner signs delegations and approval rules."
msgstr "所有者签署委托授权和审批规则。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:104
msgid "Attestations issued; public registrations made."
msgstr "签发证明；完成公开注册。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:105
msgid "Audit and kill switch verified; Birth Profile written; agent starts."
msgstr "审计和紧急停止开关已验证；诞生档案已写就；智能体启动。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:107 docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:62
#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:65 docs/lifecycle/death.md:80
msgid "Gotchas"
msgstr "常见陷阱"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:109
msgid ""
"**Compute before secret store.** The runtime gets built with credentials "
"baked into environment files or images. They end up in snapshots and logs, "
"and the first rotation becomes a redeploy. Create the store, then build the "
"runtime to read from it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>先建计算资源，后建密钥存储。</strong> "
"运行时在构建时把凭证直接写进环境文件或镜像。它们最终会出现在快照和日志中，而第一次轮换就变成一次重新部署。应先创建密钥存储，再让运行时从中读取。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:110
msgid ""
"**Wallet before limits.** A funded address with no policy is a full "
"delegation. Write `spec.economy.budget` and the signer policy first; the "
"address is the last thing you create in layer 5."
msgstr ""
"<strong>先建钱包，后设限额。</strong> 一个已注资但没有策略的地址就是一次完全委托授权。先编写 "
"`spec.economy.budget` 和签名器策略；地址应是第 5 层中最后创建的东西。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:111
msgid ""
"**Public registry before kill switch.** Once an ERC-8004 entry or agent card"
" is live, strangers will start talking to the agent. If the kill switch does"
" not exist yet, there is no way to stop that conversation cleanly. "
"Registrations come after governance is wired, not before."
msgstr ""
"<strong>先上公共注册表，后建紧急停止开关。</strong> 一旦 ERC-8004 条目或 agent card "
"上线，陌生方就会开始与智能体交互。如果紧急停止开关尚不存在，就没有办法干净地终止这些交互。注册应在治理接线完成之后进行，而不是之前。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:112
msgid ""
"**Owner's inbox for the agent's OAuth.** Grants end up bound to the human; "
"they break when the human leaves and cannot be rotated independently."
msgstr ""
"<strong>用所有者的收件箱处理智能体的 OAuth。</strong> 授权最终会绑定到该人身上；此人离开时授权会失效，且无法独立轮换。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:113
msgid ""
"**Skipping the export test.** Memory that cannot be exported cannot be "
"migrated or purged on schedule."
msgstr "<strong>跳过导出测试。</strong> 无法导出的记忆就无法迁移，也无法按计划清除。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:114
msgid ""
"**Layers 8 to 10 treated as documentation.** Delegations and limits that "
"live only in a prompt are not enforced. They must sit in the signer, the "
"gateway, and the secret store."
msgstr ""
"<strong>把第 8 到 10 层当成文档。</strong> "
"只存在于提示词中的委托授权和限额不会被强制执行。它们必须落在签名器、网关和密钥存储中。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:116
msgid "Output: a Birth Profile"
msgstr "输出：一份诞生档案"

