msgid ""
"[The Agent Birth Stack](../birth-stack.md) for the layer definitions and "
"minimum viable birth table."
msgstr "[智能体诞生栈](../birth-stack.md)：各层定义与最小可行诞生表。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:137
msgid ""
"[Credential Rotation](credential-rotation.md), [Migration](migration.md), "
"[Death](death.md) for what happens after birth."
msgstr ""
"[凭证轮换](credential-rotation.md)、[迁移](migration.md)、[死亡](death.md)：诞生之后会发生什么。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:138
msgid ""
"[Identity standards](../standards/identity.md), [Authentication & "
"Delegation](../standards/auth-and-delegation.md), [Security & "
"Governance](../standards/security-and-governance.md)."
msgstr ""
"[身份标准](../standards/identity.md)、[身份验证与委托授权](../standards/auth-and-"
"delegation.md)、[安全与治理](../standards/security-and-governance.md)。"

#: docs/lifecycle/birth.md:139
msgid ""
"Providers: [Email](../providers/email.md), [Domains & "
"DNS](../providers/domains.md), [Compute & Browsers](../providers/compute-"
"and-browsers.md), [Wallets & Keys](../providers/wallets.md), [Credentials & "
"Tool Auth](../providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md), [Observability & "
"Human-in-the-loop](../providers/observability-and-hitl.md)."
msgstr ""
"服务提供方：[电子邮件](../providers/email.md)、[域名与 "
"DNS](../providers/domains.md)、[计算资源与浏览器](../providers/compute-and-"
"browsers.md)、[钱包与密钥](../providers/wallets.md)、[凭证与工具认证](../providers/credentials-"
"and-tool-auth.md)、[可观测性与人在回路](../providers/observability-and-hitl.md)。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:3
msgid ""
"Rotation is the routine replacement of a credential with a new one before "
"the old one is compromised. For agents it is not optional hygiene: an "
"agent's credentials sit in more places than a human's (secret store, runtime"
" environment, gateway config, tool servers, occasionally a memory store that"
" captured a request), and an agent has no MFA prompt, no push notification, "
"and no instinct that something is off. The only defence that scales is a "
"short lifetime and an automated replacement, driven from the secret store "
"provisioned in [layer 3](../stack/03-authentication.md)."
msgstr ""
"轮换是指在旧凭证被泄露之前，用新凭证例行替换旧凭证。对智能体而言，这不是可选的安全习惯：智能体的凭证存放在比人类更多的位置（密钥存储、运行时环境、网关配置、工具服务器，偶尔还有捕获了请求的记忆存储），而且智能体没有"
" MFA 提示、没有推送通知，也没有察觉异常的直觉。唯一可规模化的防御是短生命周期加自动化替换，由[第 3 "
"层](../stack/03-authentication.md)中配置的密钥存储驱动。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:5
msgid "Why agents rotate faster than humans"
msgstr "为什么智能体的轮换频率高于人类"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:7
msgid ""
"A human login is protected by a second factor at use time. An agent's API "
"key is a bearer token: whoever holds it, is the agent."
msgstr "人类登录在使用时受第二因素保护。智能体的 API 密钥是持有者令牌：谁持有它，谁就是该智能体。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:8
msgid ""
"Agents copy credentials into runtime state. A microVM snapshot, a crash "
"dump, or a verbose trace in the [audit log](../stack/10-governance.md) can "
"hold a live token."
msgstr ""
"智能体会将凭证复制到运行时状态中。一个 microVM "
"快照、一次崩溃转储，或[审计日志](../stack/10-governance.md)中的一条详细追踪记录，都可能包含有效令牌。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:9
msgid ""
"Agents talk to many services in a loop. A leaked key is exercised within "
"seconds, not days."
msgstr "智能体在循环中与许多服务通信。泄露的密钥会在数秒内被利用，而不是数天。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:10
msgid ""
"Rotating a human's password interrupts the human. Rotating an agent's key "
"interrupts nothing if the overlap window is respected, so there is no cost "
"argument for long lifetimes."
msgstr "轮换人类的密码会打断人类。只要遵守重叠窗口，轮换智能体的密钥不会打断任何事情，因此长生命周期没有任何成本上的理由。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:12
msgid ""
"Default lifetimes that work in practice: API keys 30 days, OAuth access "
"tokens minutes to an hour with daily refresh-token rotation, signing keys 6 "
"to 12 months, TLS certificates 90 days or shorter, SPIFFE SVIDs an hour."
msgstr ""
"实践中行之有效的默认生命周期：API 密钥 30 天，OAuth 访问令牌数分钟到一小时并每日轮换刷新令牌，签名密钥 6 到 12 个月，TLS 证书 "
"90 天或更短，SPIFFE SVID 一小时。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:16
msgid ""
"Generic zero-downtime rotation, run by the secret store or a scheduler, "
"never by the agent itself:"
msgstr "通用的零停机轮换流程，由密钥存储或调度器执行，绝不由智能体自身执行："

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:18
msgid ""
"Issue the new credential at the provider while the old one is still valid."
msgstr "在旧凭证仍然有效时，向服务提供方签发新凭证。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:19
msgid "Write the new value to the `secretRef` path; bump a version marker."
msgstr "将新值写入 `secretRef` 路径；递增版本标记。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:20
msgid ""
"Signal the runtime to reload (restart the sandbox or re-read the store)."
msgstr "通知运行时重新加载（重启沙箱或重新读取密钥存储）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:21
msgid ""
"Wait an overlap window long enough for in-flight requests and cached tokens "
"to drain."
msgstr "等待一个足够长的重叠窗口，让进行中的请求和缓存的令牌自然耗尽。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:22
msgid "Revoke the old credential at the provider."
msgstr "在服务提供方处吊销旧凭证。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:23
msgid "Record the rotation event in the audit log with key IDs, not values."
msgstr "在审计日志中记录轮换事件，使用密钥 ID 而非密钥值。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:25
msgid "Per credential type:"
msgstr "按凭证类型："

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:27
msgid ""
"**API keys.** Most providers allow two active keys. Create the second, cut "
"over, delete the first. If a provider allows only one, the overlap window is"
" zero and rotation causes a brief outage; schedule it in a quiet period and "
"note the constraint in the manifest."
msgstr ""
"<strong>API 密钥。</strong> "
"大多数提供方允许同时存在两个有效密钥。创建第二个密钥，完成切换，删除第一个。如果提供方只允许一个密钥，则重叠窗口为零，轮换会造成短暂中断；请安排在低峰期执行，并在清单中记录该限制。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:28
msgid ""
"**OAuth refresh tokens.** Access tokens are short-lived by design; the "
"refresh token is the long-lived secret. Prefer authorization servers that "
"rotate the refresh token on every use, as MCP Authorization and OAuth 2.1 "
"recommend ([Authentication & Delegation](../standards/auth-and-"
"delegation.md)). Store only the latest one; a reused old refresh token "
"should invalidate the grant."
msgstr ""
"<strong>OAuth 刷新令牌。</strong> "
"访问令牌在设计上是短期有效的；刷新令牌才是长期有效的密钥。优先选择在每次使用时轮换刷新令牌的授权服务器，正如 MCP Authorization 和 "
"OAuth 2.1 所建议的（[身份验证与委托授权](../standards/auth-and-"
"delegation.md)）。只存储最新的一个；被重复使用的旧刷新令牌应使该授权失效。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:29
msgid ""
"**Signing keys (identity).** Rotating a `spec.identity.keys[]` entry is a "
"DID document update: add the new verification method, publish, wait for "
"resolvers and counterparties to pick it up, then remove the old one. Keep "
"the old public key retrievable so past signatures still verify. See "
"[Identity standards](../standards/identity.md)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>签名密钥（身份）。</strong> 轮换 `spec.identity.keys[]` 条目是一次 DID "
"文档更新：添加新的验证方法，发布，等待解析器和交易对手方获取更新，然后移除旧的。保持旧公钥可检索，以便过去的签名仍能验证。参见[身份标准](../standards/identity.md)。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:30
msgid ""
"**Wallet keys.** Usually not rotated. A wallet address is the economic "
"identity; changing it means moving funds and updating every counterparty and"
" registry. Instead the key is policy-gated at a provider or TEE ([Wallets & "
"Keys](../providers/wallets.md)) and the policy is what changes. Rotate only "
"on suspected compromise, by sweeping to a new address under the same owner."
msgstr ""
"<strong>钱包密钥。</strong> "
"通常不轮换。钱包地址就是经济身份；更换地址意味着转移资金并更新每个交易对手方和注册表。取而代之的是，密钥在服务提供方或 TEE "
"处受策略控制（[钱包与密钥](../providers/wallets.md)），变更的是策略。仅在疑似泄露时轮换，方式是将资金转移到同一所有者名下的新地址。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:31
msgid ""
"**TLS and mTLS certificates.** Use ACME or the provider's automatic renewal;"
" 90 days is the common maximum and shorter is fine. For mTLS to internal "
"services, pin to the CA, not the leaf, so rotation does not break peers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>TLS 和 mTLS 证书。</strong> 使用 ACME 或服务提供方的自动续期；90 "
"天是常见的最长期限，更短也可以。对内部服务的 mTLS，应固定到 CA 而非叶证书，这样轮换不会影响对端。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:32
msgid ""
"**SPIFFE SVIDs.** Rotate automatically through the SPIRE agent, typically "
"hourly. Nothing to schedule; confirm the workload attestation selectors "
"still match after any [compute migration](migration.md)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>SPIFFE SVID。</strong> 通过 SPIRE agent "
"自动轮换，通常每小时一次。无需安排任何事项；在任何[计算资源迁移](migration.md)之后确认工作负载证明选择器仍然匹配即可。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:36
msgid ""
"Each entry in `spec.authentication.credentials[]` carries a `rotation` "
"field, an ISO 8601 duration:"
msgstr ""
"`spec.authentication.credentials[]` 中的每个条目都带有一个 `rotation` 字段，即一个 ISO 8601 "
"时长："

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:45
msgid ""
"The value is a promise, not a mechanism. The secret store or scheduler must "
"actually enforce it. A useful review-cadence check is to diff each "
"credential's provider-side creation date against its declared `rotation`."
msgstr ""
"该值是一个承诺，而非机制。密钥存储或调度器必须实际执行它。一个有用的例行审查检查方法是，将每个凭证在服务提供方侧的创建日期与其声明的 "
"`rotation` 进行比对。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:51
msgid ""
"Signing key rotation is a DID document update; old public keys stay "
"resolvable."
msgstr "签名密钥轮换是一次 DID 文档更新；旧公钥保持可解析。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:52
msgid ""
"Inbox and DNS API keys rotate like any API key; domain registrar credentials"
" are owner-held and rotate on owner review."
msgstr "收件箱和 DNS 的 API 密钥像任何 API 密钥一样轮换；域名注册商凭证由所有者持有，在所有者审查时轮换。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:53
msgid "Owns the process: secret store issues, versions, and revokes."
msgstr "负责整个流程：密钥存储负责签发、版本管理和吊销。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:54
msgid "Runtime must reload on signal; no credentials baked into images."
msgstr "运行时必须在收到信号后重新加载；不得将凭证固化到镜像中。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:55
msgid ""
"Wallet keys policy-gated, not rotated; card numbers reissued on compromise."
msgstr "钱包密钥受策略控制而非轮换；卡号在泄露时重新签发。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:56
msgid ""
"Gateway and tool credentials are ordinary API keys; rotate on the same "
"schedule."
msgstr "网关和工具凭证是普通的 API 密钥；按相同的计划轮换。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:57
msgid ""
"Storage credentials rotate; scan stores for accidentally captured secrets."
msgstr "存储凭证需要轮换；扫描存储以查找意外捕获的密钥。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:58
msgid ""
"Delegations have `expires`; renewal is a re-signing by the owner, not a "
"rotation."
msgstr "委托授权带有 `expires`；续期是由所有者重新签名，而非轮换。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:59
msgid "Attestations re-issued when the signing key changes."
msgstr "签名密钥更换时重新签发证明。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:60
msgid "Every rotation and revocation lands in the audit log."
msgstr "每次轮换和撤销都会记录到审计日志中。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:64
msgid ""
"**Revoke first on a suspected leak.** Rotation is the calm path. If a key "
"may have leaked, revoke immediately and accept the outage; then issue a new "
"key. Rotating in the leak case gives the attacker the overlap window."
msgstr ""
"<strong>疑似泄露时先撤销。</strong> "
"轮换是稳妥的路径。如果密钥可能已泄露，应立即撤销并接受停机，然后签发新密钥。在泄露场景中进行轮换会给攻击者留下重叠窗口。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:65
msgid ""
"**The agent should not hold rotation rights.** An agent that can create its "
"own keys can create a key you do not know about. Rotation is a provisioner "
"action."
msgstr "<strong>智能体不应持有轮换权限。</strong> 能够创建自己密钥的智能体可以创建一个你不知道的密钥。轮换应是配置方的操作。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:66
msgid ""
"**Cached tokens outlive the store.** A gateway or MCP server may cache a "
"token for its full lifetime. Size the overlap window to the longest cache."
msgstr ""
"<strong>缓存的令牌比密钥存储存活得更久。</strong> 网关或 MCP "
"服务器可能会在令牌的整个生命周期内缓存它。重叠窗口应按最长缓存时间来设定。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:67
msgid ""
"**Rotation that only rotates the store.** If the runtime reads once at boot "
"and never again, the new key sits unused and the old one keeps working until"
" revocation breaks the agent."
msgstr ""
"<strong>只轮换密钥存储的轮换。</strong> "
"如果运行时只在启动时读取一次且此后不再读取，新密钥将闲置不用，而旧密钥会一直有效，直到撤销导致智能体故障。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:68
msgid ""
"**Signing key rotation without a DID update.** Counterparties verifying "
"against the old document reject the agent, and registries that pin the key "
"mark it as changed."
msgstr ""
"<strong>未更新 DID 的签名密钥轮换。</strong> 依据旧文档进行验证的交易对手会拒绝该智能体，而固定该密钥的注册表会将其标记为已变更。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:69
msgid ""
"**Forgetting delegations.** A delegation bound to a rotated signing key by "
"key ID must be re-issued, or the agent loses authority quietly."
msgstr "<strong>遗忘委托授权。</strong> 通过密钥 ID 绑定到已轮换签名密钥的委托授权必须重新签发，否则智能体会悄然失去权限。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:73
msgid ""
"[3. Authentication](../stack/03-authentication.md), [1. "
"Identity](../stack/01-identity.md), [10. "
"Governance](../stack/10-governance.md)."
msgstr ""
"[3. 身份验证](../stack/03-authentication.md)、[1. "
"身份](../stack/01-identity.md)、[10. 治理](../stack/10-governance.md)。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:74
msgid ""
"[Credentials & Tool Auth](../providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md) for "
"secret stores and token vaults."
msgstr "[凭证与工具认证](../providers/credentials-and-tool-auth.md)，涵盖密钥存储与令牌保管库。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:75
msgid ""
"[Authentication & Delegation](../standards/auth-and-delegation.md) for OAuth"
" 2.1, token exchange, SPIFFE."
msgstr ""
"[身份验证与委托授权](../standards/auth-and-delegation.md)，涵盖 OAuth 2.1、令牌交换、SPIFFE。"

#: docs/lifecycle/credential-rotation.md:76
msgid "[Death](death.md) for revocation as a wind-down step."
msgstr "[死亡](death.md)，将撤销作为停用步骤。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:3
msgid ""
"An agent migrates when something underneath it changes without the agent "
"itself being retired: a new compute provider, a new owner, a new model "
"provider, a new domain. The Birth Stack makes these cases easy to reason "
"about because each one touches a known set of layers. The rule of thumb: "
"state is portable, credentials are re-provisioned, and anything that binds "
"identity to a party is re-attested. The [Birth Profile](../manifest.md) is "
"the migration checklist; diff the old and new manifests and every changed "
"key tells you what to do."
msgstr ""
"当智能体底层的某些内容发生变化而智能体本身未被退役时，就会发生迁移：新的计算资源提供方、新的所有者、新的模型提供方、新的域名。智能体诞生栈使这些情况易于推理，因为每种情况都涉及一组已知的层。经验法则是：状态可迁移，凭证需重新配置，任何将身份绑定到某一方的内容都需重新证明。[诞生档案](../manifest.md)就是迁移检查清单；对比新旧清单，每个发生变化的键都会告诉你该做什么。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:7
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    A[\"Active\"] --> F[\"Freeze: pause tasks, drain in-flight\"]\n"
"    F --> S[\"Snapshot memory, files, secret refs, manifest\"]\n"
"    S --> P[\"Provision target layers\"]\n"
"    P --> R[\"Re-attest: delegations, owner VC, registrations\"]\n"
"    R --> V[\"Verify: resolve DID, test kill switch, replay one task\"]\n"
"    V --> C[\"Cut over endpoints, revoke old credentials\"]\n"
"    C --> A2[\"Active on new footing\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    A[\"活跃\"] --> F[\"冻结：暂停任务，完成在途任务\"]\n"
"    F --> S[\"快照记忆、文件、密钥引用、清单\"]\n"
"    S --> P[\"配置目标层\"]\n"
"    P --> R[\"重新证明：委托授权、所有者 VC、注册信息\"]\n"
"    R --> V[\"验证：解析 DID、测试紧急停止开关、重放一个任务\"]\n"
"    V --> C[\"切换端点，吊销旧凭证\"]\n"
"    C --> A2[\"在新基础上恢复活跃\"]\n"
"```"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:18
msgid "The four common migrations, from cheapest to most expensive:"
msgstr "四种常见迁移，按成本从低到高排列："

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:20
msgid "Between compute providers"
msgstr "在计算资源提供方之间"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:22
msgid ""
"State is memory plus files plus secret references. Identity does not change."
msgstr "状态包括记忆、文件和密钥引用。身份不变。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:24
msgid "Suspend the agent (see [Death](death.md) for the Suspended state)."
msgstr "暂停智能体（Suspended 状态参见[死亡](death.md)）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:25
msgid ""
"Export memory stores and the storage bucket; verify the export can be read "
"back."
msgstr "导出记忆存储和存储桶；验证导出内容可以被读回。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:26
msgid ""
"Provision the new runtime with the same isolation level and egress allowlist"
" from `spec.compute`."
msgstr "使用与 `spec.compute` 中相同的隔离级别和出站访问白名单来配置新运行时。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:27
msgid ""
"Point the new runtime at the same `spec.authentication.secretStore`. If "
"credentials were baked into the old image, this is where you discover it; "
"issue new ones from the store rather than copying."
msgstr ""
"将新运行时指向同一个 "
"`spec.authentication.secretStore`。如果凭证曾被固化在旧镜像中，此时便会暴露该问题；应从密钥存储签发新凭证，而不是直接复制。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:28
msgid ""
"If workload identity is in use, re-register the workload (new SPIFFE "
"selectors, new TEE attestation)."
msgstr "如果使用了工作负载身份，请重新注册工作负载（新的 SPIFFE 选择器、新的 TEE 证明）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:29
msgid ""
"Update `spec.compute.runtime`, resume, and revoke anything the old provider "
"still holds."
msgstr "更新 `spec.compute.runtime`，恢复运行，并吊销旧提供方仍持有的一切内容。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:31
msgid "Between owners"
msgstr "所有者之间"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:33
msgid ""
"This is an identity event even though the DID may not change. The owner is "
"part of layer 1, and layers 8, 9 and 10 are bound to the owner."
msgstr "即使 DID 可能不变，这也是一次身份事件。所有者属于第 1 层，而第 8、9、10 层均与所有者绑定。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:35
msgid ""
"Re-issue every delegation in `spec.authority.delegations[]`: the old owner's"
" signatures are no longer valid authority."
msgstr "重新签发 `spec.authority.delegations[]` 中的每一项委托授权：旧所有者的签名不再构成有效权限。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:36
msgid ""
"Replace the owner attestation in `spec.trust.credentials[]` with one issued "
"by the new owner."
msgstr "用新所有者签发的所有者证明替换 `spec.trust.credentials[]` 中的原有证明。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:37
msgid ""
"Transfer registry ownership. Under ERC-8004 the agent is an ERC-721 token; "
"ownership moves by transferring the NFT ([Identity "
"standards](../standards/identity.md))."
msgstr ""
"转移注册表所有权。在 ERC-8004 下，智能体是一个 ERC-721 代币；所有权通过转移该 NFT "
"完成（[身份标准](../standards/identity.md)）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:38
msgid ""
"Re-KYC on financial rails. Cards, custodial wallets, and payment providers "
"are underwritten to the owner; the new owner opens new accounts and funds "
"are swept across. See [Payments & Cards](../providers/payments-and-"
"cards.md)."
msgstr ""
"在金融通道上重新进行 KYC。卡片、托管钱包和支付服务商的授信对象是所有者；新所有者需开立新账户并将资金划转过去。参见 "
"[支付与卡片](../providers/payments-and-cards.md)。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:39
msgid ""
"Move kill-switch control and recovery shares "
"(`spec.governance.killSwitch.controller`, `spec.governance.recovery`). Until"
" this is done, the old owner can still stop the agent."
msgstr ""
"转移紧急停止开关的控制权和恢复份额（`spec.governance.killSwitch.controller`、`spec.governance.recovery`）。在完成之前，旧所有者仍可停止该智能体。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:40
msgid ""
"If custody of the signing key is `owner`, rotate the key ([Credential "
"Rotation](credential-rotation.md)); the old owner held it."
msgstr ""
"如果签名密钥的托管方式为 `owner`，请轮换密钥（[凭证轮换](credential-rotation.md)）；旧所有者曾持有该密钥。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:42
msgid "Between model providers"
msgstr "模型提供方之间"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:44
msgid ""
"A capability change, not an identity change. Update "
"`spec.capabilities.models[]` and the gateway credential. Then re-evaluate: "
"the agent's behaviour under its approval rules and budget was tested against"
" the old model. Run the same evaluation set before resuming, and review the "
"tool list for anything the new model uses differently."
msgstr ""
"这是能力变更，而非身份变更。更新 `spec.capabilities.models[]` "
"和网关凭证。然后重新评估：智能体在其审批规则和预算下的行为是针对旧模型测试的。在恢复运行前运行同一套评估集，并检查工具列表中新模型使用方式不同的部分。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:46
msgid "Between email or domain"
msgstr "邮箱或域名之间"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:48
msgid ""
"The most painful case, because presence is what other systems bootstrapped "
"on. A `did:web` DID lives on the domain; OAuth grants were verified against "
"the inbox; registries and agent cards point at the endpoints. Changing the "
"domain means re-minting the DID or publishing a redirect, re-doing every "
"OAuth grant, re-publishing the agent card, and updating every registry "
"entry. This is why an owner-controlled domain is the first Presence "
"requirement ([2. Presence](../stack/02-presence.md), [Domains & "
"DNS](../providers/domains.md)): renting presence from a provider's domain "
"makes migration away from that provider a re-birth."
msgstr ""
"最痛苦的情况，因为在线存在是其他系统赖以引导的基础。`did:web` DID 依附于该域名；OAuth "
"授权是针对收件箱验证的；注册表和智能体卡片都指向这些端点。更换域名意味着重新签发 DID 或发布重定向、重新完成所有 OAuth "
"授权、重新发布智能体卡片，并更新每一条注册表条目。这就是为什么所有者控制的域名是在线存在的首要要求（[2. "
"在线存在](../stack/02-presence.md)、[域名与 "
"DNS](../providers/domains.md)）：从服务提供方的域名租用在线存在，会使得迁离该提供方等同于一次重新诞生。"

