#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:67
msgid ""
"**Migrating while Active.** Two runtimes with the same credentials and "
"memory produce duplicate actions and split memory. Suspend first."
msgstr "<strong>在活跃状态下迁移。</strong> 两个拥有相同凭证和记忆的运行时会产生重复动作和记忆分裂。请先暂停。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:68
msgid ""
"**Copying secrets instead of re-issuing.** The old provider keeps a copy. "
"Issue new ones from the secret store and revoke the old."
msgstr "<strong>复制密钥而非重新签发。</strong> 旧的提供方会保留副本。应从密钥存储签发新凭证并吊销旧凭证。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:69
msgid ""
"**Owner change without a kill-switch handover.** The agent has two "
"controllers, one of whom no longer has responsibility."
msgstr "<strong>所有者变更时未移交紧急停止开关。</strong> 智能体将有两个控制者，其中一个已不再承担责任。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:70
msgid ""
"**Forgetting registry ownership.** A transferred agent whose ERC-8004 token "
"still belongs to the old owner is, to the world, still the old owner's "
"agent."
msgstr ""
"<strong>忘记注册表所有权。</strong> 已转移的智能体如果其 ERC-8004 代币仍属于旧所有者，在外界看来仍是旧所有者的智能体。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:71
msgid ""
"**Treating a model swap as a config change.** Approval thresholds and "
"budgets were tuned to one model's behaviour."
msgstr "<strong>将模型更换视为配置变更。</strong> 审批阈值和预算是针对某一模型的行为调优的。"

#: docs/lifecycle/migration.md:72
msgid ""
"**Memory retention across owners.** Episodic memory may hold the old owner's"
" data; check `spec.memory.stores[].retention` and purge what the new owner "
"is not entitled to."
msgstr ""
"<strong>跨所有者的记忆保留。</strong> 情景记忆可能包含旧所有者的数据；请检查 "
"`spec.memory.stores[].retention` 并清除新所有者无权获得的内容。"

