#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:3
msgid ""
"An agent that can be born must be able to die cleanly. Death is the reverse "
"of the [Birth Procedure](birth.md): the Safety band is used to stop the "
"agent, the Action band is drained and closed, and the Existence band is "
"revoked last so that the record of who the agent was survives the agent. Two"
" states matter most: Suspended, which is reversible and cheap, and "
"Destroyed, which is irreversible and must be earned."
msgstr ""
"能够诞生的智能体必须能够干净地死亡。死亡是[诞生流程](birth.md)的逆过程：先用安全带停止智能体，然后排空并关闭行动带，最后才吊销存在带，以便关于智能体身份的记录在智能体消亡后得以留存。最重要的两个状态是：Suspended（可逆且成本低）和"
" Destroyed（不可逆且必须谨慎达成）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:7
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"stateDiagram-v2\n"
"    state \"Provisioning\" as Provisioning\n"
"    state \"Active\" as Active\n"
"    state \"Suspended\" as Suspended\n"
"    state \"Migrating\" as Migrating\n"
"    state \"Retired\" as Retired\n"
"    state \"Destroyed\" as Destroyed\n"
"    [*] --> Provisioning : birth begins\n"
"    Provisioning --> Active : Birth Profile complete, first heartbeat logged\n"
"    Provisioning --> Destroyed : birth abandoned, partial resources torn down\n"
"    Active --> Suspended : kill switch, anomaly, budget breach, owner request\n"
"    Suspended --> Active : owner review clears cause, credentials still valid\n"
"    Active --> Migrating : provider or owner change\n"
"    Suspended --> Migrating : moved while stopped (preferred)\n"
"    Migrating --> Active : verification passed, old resources revoked\n"
"    Migrating --> Suspended : verification failed\n"
"    Active --> Retired : purpose ended\n"
"    Suspended --> Retired : owner decides not to resume\n"
"    Retired --> Destroyed : keys revoked, accounts closed, memory purged, final attestation published\n"
"    Destroyed --> [*]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"stateDiagram-v2\n"
"    state \"配置中\" as Provisioning\n"
"    state \"活跃\" as Active\n"
"    state \"已暂停\" as Suspended\n"
"    state \"迁移中\" as Migrating\n"
"    state \"已退役\" as Retired\n"
"    state \"已销毁\" as Destroyed\n"
"    [*] --> Provisioning : 诞生开始\n"
"    Provisioning --> Active : 诞生档案完成，记录首次心跳\n"
"    Provisioning --> Destroyed : 诞生中止，部分资源已拆除\n"
"    Active --> Suspended : 紧急停止开关、异常、预算超限、所有者请求\n"
"    Suspended --> Active : 所有者审查排除原因，凭证仍有效\n"
"    Active --> Migrating : 服务提供方或所有者变更\n"
"    Suspended --> Migrating : 停止状态下迁移（推荐）\n"
"    Migrating --> Active : 验证通过，旧资源已吊销\n"
"    Migrating --> Suspended : 验证失败\n"
"    Active --> Retired : 目的已完成\n"
"    Suspended --> Retired : 所有者决定不再恢复\n"
"    Retired --> Destroyed : 吊销密钥、关闭账户、清除记忆、发布最终证明\n"
"    Destroyed --> [*]\n"
"```"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:30
msgid "Transition notes:"
msgstr "状态转换说明："

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:32
msgid ""
"**Provisioning to Active** requires all ten layers in the manifest and a "
"kill-switch test. Nothing runs before governance exists."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Provisioning 到 Active</strong> "
"需要清单中全部十个层级以及一次紧急停止开关测试。在治理存在之前，任何东西都不得运行。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:33
msgid ""
"**Active to Suspended** is the kill switch firing "
"(`spec.governance.killSwitch.mechanism`). It suspends the runtime, blocks "
"the signer, and disables credentials at the gateway. It does not delete "
"anything. Fast, reversible, and the correct first response to any anomaly."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Active 到 Suspended</strong> "
"即紧急停止开关触发（`spec.governance.killSwitch.mechanism`）。它会暂停运行时、封锁签名者，并在网关处禁用凭证。它不会删除任何内容。快速、可逆，是应对任何异常的正确首选措施。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:34
msgid ""
"**Suspended to Active** is an owner decision recorded in the audit log, "
"after the cause is understood. Credentials that were disabled are re-"
"enabled; credentials that were revoked are re-issued."
msgstr ""
"<strong>从已暂停到活跃</strong>是所有者在弄清原因后做出的决定，并记录在审计日志中。被禁用的凭证将重新启用；被吊销的凭证将重新签发。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:35
msgid ""
"**Active or Suspended to Migrating** is covered in "
"[Migration](migration.md). Migrating from Suspended avoids duplicate actors."
msgstr ""
"<strong>从活跃或已暂停到迁移中</strong>在[迁移](migration.md)中说明。从已暂停状态迁移可避免出现重复的行动主体。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:36
msgid ""
"**Retired** means the agent will not run again but its accounts, wallets and"
" registrations still exist. This is a holding state for wind-down and for "
"the retention clock."
msgstr "<strong>已退役</strong>表示该智能体不会再运行，但其账户、钱包和注册信息仍然存在。这是用于收尾清算和保留期计时的过渡状态。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:37
msgid ""
"**Destroyed** is the end. Keys are revoked, accounts closed, data purged. "
"Nothing here can be undone, which is why it is a separate step from Retired."
msgstr ""
"<strong>已销毁</strong>是终点。密钥被吊销、账户被关闭、数据被清除。此处的一切都无法撤销，这正是它与已退役分开作为单独步骤的原因。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:39
msgid "Wind-down order (Retired to Destroyed)"
msgstr "收尾顺序（从已退役到已销毁）"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:41
msgid ""
"**Kill switch.** Confirm the agent is stopped and cannot restart. Snapshot "
"the runtime for forensics if the retirement was not planned."
msgstr "<strong>紧急停止开关。</strong>确认智能体已停止且无法重启。如果退役并非计划内，请对运行时做快照以供取证。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:42
msgid ""
"**Revoke credentials.** Every entry in `spec.authentication.credentials[]`, "
"at the provider, not just in the store. Delete the secret store path last so"
" the revocation calls still have what they need."
msgstr ""
"<strong>吊销凭证。</strong>对 `spec.authentication.credentials[]` "
"中的每一项，在服务提供方处吊销，而不仅仅是在存储中。最后再删除密钥存储路径，以便吊销调用仍能获取所需信息。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:43
msgid ""
"**Freeze, then sweep wallets.** Set the signer policy to deny-all, then move"
" funds to the owner's address. Cancel cards. Keep the address on record; "
"counterparties may still send to it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>先冻结钱包，再转出资金。</strong>将签名者策略设为全部拒绝，然后将资金转移到所有者地址。注销银行卡。保留该地址的记录；交易对手方可能仍会向其转账。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:44
msgid ""
"**Close accounts.** Inbox, tool accounts, storage buckets. Set an auto-reply"
" or bounce on the inbox for the retention period before deleting it so that "
"late correspondents learn the agent is gone."
msgstr ""
"<strong>关闭账户。</strong>收件箱、工具账户、存储桶。在删除收件箱之前，于保留期内设置自动回复或退信，让迟来的通信者知道该智能体已不复存在。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:45
msgid ""
"**Mark registrations revoked.** Update the DID document with a deactivation,"
" set the ERC-8004 or registry entry to revoked or burn the token, remove the"
" agent card. Do not delete the DID history; others hold signatures that need"
" to verify."
msgstr ""
"<strong>将注册标记为已吊销。</strong>在 DID 文档中更新为停用状态，将 ERC-8004 或注册表条目设为已吊销或销毁该代币，移除 "
"agent card。不要删除 DID 历史记录；他人持有的签名仍需要验证。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:46
msgid ""
"**Export, then purge memory.** Export each store in `spec.memory.stores[]` "
"to the owner's archive, then delete per the `retention` on each. Purge is a "
"provider-side deletion with confirmation, not an unlink."
msgstr ""
"<strong>先导出记忆，再清除。</strong>将 `spec.memory.stores[]` 中的每个存储导出到所有者的归档中，然后按各自的 "
"`retention` 删除。清除是需服务提供方确认的服务端删除，而不是取消关联。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:47
msgid ""
"**Publish a final attestation.** A signed statement from the owner: agent "
"DID, dates of birth and death, reason, and the hash of the exported audit "
"log. Host it where the owner attestation lived. This is the last thing "
"signed with the agent's identity key before that key is revoked."
msgstr ""
"<strong>发布最终证明。</strong>由所有者签署的声明：智能体 "
"DID、诞生与终止日期、原因，以及导出的审计日志的哈希值。将其托管在原所有者证明所在的位置。这是在智能体身份密钥被吊销之前，用该密钥签署的最后一项内容。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:49
msgid "What is retained and what is deleted"
msgstr "保留哪些内容、删除哪些内容"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:51
msgid "Retain"
msgstr "保留"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:51
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:53
msgid ""
"Audit log for the full retention period; it is the evidence of what the "
"agent did."
msgstr "完整保留期内的审计日志；它是智能体行为的证据。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:53
msgid ""
"Working and episodic memory, unless a retention duration says otherwise."
msgstr "工作记忆和情景记忆，除非保留期限另有规定。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:54
msgid ""
"Financial records: wallet addresses, transaction history, card statements. "
"Tax and accounting rules apply to the owner."
msgstr "财务记录：钱包地址、交易历史、银行卡账单。所有者需遵守相关税务和会计规定。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:54
msgid "Files and semantic stores containing third-party data."
msgstr "包含第三方数据的文件与语义存储。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:55
msgid ""
"The Birth Profile itself, with a `destroyedAt` timestamp added in "
"`metadata`."
msgstr "诞生档案本身，并在 `metadata` 中添加 `destroyedAt` 时间戳。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:55
msgid "All credentials and the secret store path."
msgstr "所有凭证及密钥存储路径。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:56
msgid "Public keys and DID document history, so past signatures verify."
msgstr "公钥与 DID 文档历史，以便过往签名可被验证。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:56
msgid "Private keys, in every custody model."
msgstr "私钥，在所有托管模式下均如此。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:57
msgid "Final attestation and registry revocation record."
msgstr "最终证明与注册表吊销记录。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:57
msgid "Runtime images and snapshots after forensics are done."
msgstr "取证完成后的运行时镜像与快照。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:63
msgid "DID deactivated; public keys kept; private keys destroyed."
msgstr "DID 已停用；公钥保留；私钥销毁。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:64
msgid "Inbox bounces during retention, then closes; domain stays with owner."
msgstr "收件箱在保留期内退回邮件，随后关闭；域名仍归所有者。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:65
msgid "Credentials revoked at each provider; store path deleted."
msgstr "在各服务提供方处吊销凭证；删除存储路径。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:66
msgid "Runtime stopped, snapshot for forensics, then deleted."
msgstr "停止运行时，留存快照用于取证，随后删除。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:67
msgid "Signer frozen, funds swept, cards cancelled, records kept."
msgstr "冻结签名器，转出资金，注销卡片，保留记录。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:68
msgid "Gateway keys revoked; tool accounts closed."
msgstr "吊销网关密钥；关闭工具账户。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:69
msgid "Exported to owner archive, then purged per retention."
msgstr "导出至所有者归档，随后按保留策略清除。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:70
msgid "Delegations revoked or allowed to expire; approval channels archived."
msgstr "吊销委托授权或任其过期；归档审批渠道。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:71
msgid "Registrations marked revoked; final attestation published."
msgstr "将注册记录标记为已吊销；发布最终证明。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:72
msgid "Audit log frozen and retained; kill switch retired last."
msgstr "冻结并保留审计日志；紧急停止开关最后退役。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:74
msgid "Orphaned agents"
msgstr "孤儿智能体"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:76
msgid ""
"An agent is orphaned when its owner disappears: a person leaves the company,"
" a company folds, a key is lost, or nobody remembers who set it up. The "
"agent keeps running, keeps spending its budget, and keeps holding "
"credentials, with no one able to review or stop it. This is one of the "
"failure modes OWASP lists under rogue agents ([Security & "
"Governance](../standards/security-and-governance.md))."
msgstr ""
"当智能体的所有者消失时，它就成为孤儿：某人离职、公司倒闭、密钥丢失，或者没人记得是谁部署了它。该智能体继续运行、继续消耗预算、继续持有凭证，却无人能够审查或停止它。这是"
" OWASP 在失控智能体条目下列出的失效模式之一（[安全与治理](../standards/security-and-governance.md)）。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:78
msgid ""
"The `spec.governance.recovery` field exists for this case. It should name, "
"in plain language, how a second party regains control: who holds the second "
"recovery share, where the kill-switch controller credential is escrowed, and"
" which legal entity owns the agent's accounts. Combined with "
"`spec.governance.reviewCadence`, it gives a mechanical test for orphanhood: "
"an agent that has missed two reviews with no owner response should be "
"suspended by whoever holds the recovery path, then retired if no owner "
"reappears. Delegations with `expires` set provide the same protection from "
"the authority side; an orphaned agent whose delegations lapse becomes an "
"agent that can no longer act, which is the safe default."
msgstr ""
"`spec.governance.recovery` "
"字段正是为这种情况而设。它应以通俗语言说明第二方如何重新获得控制权：谁持有第二份恢复分片、紧急停止开关控制器凭证托管在何处，以及哪个法律实体拥有该智能体的账户。结合"
" "
"`spec.governance.reviewCadence`，它为孤儿状态提供了一个机械化的判定标准：连续错过两次审查且所有者无响应的智能体，应由恢复路径的持有者将其暂停，若所有者仍未出现则将其退役。设置了"
" `expires` 的委托授权从权限侧提供同样的保护；委托授权失效的孤儿智能体将无法再行动，这正是安全的默认状态。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:82
msgid ""
"**Destroying instead of suspending.** Suspension costs nothing and is "
"reversible. Do not skip to Destroyed because an anomaly looked serious."
msgstr "<strong>直接销毁而非暂停。</strong> 暂停零成本且可逆。不要因为某个异常看起来严重就直接跳到 Destroyed。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:83
msgid ""
"**Deleting the secret store before revoking.** The revocation calls fail, "
"and the credentials stay live at the provider with no record of them."
msgstr "<strong>在撤销之前删除密钥存储。</strong> 撤销调用将失败，凭证在提供方处仍然有效，却没有任何记录。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:84
msgid ""
"**Purging memory before exporting.** Retention obligations and the owner's "
"own records are lost."
msgstr "<strong>在导出之前清除记忆。</strong> 留存义务和所有者自身的记录都会丢失。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:85
msgid ""
"**Burning the registry token without a revocation notice.** Counterparties "
"see a missing entry, not a retired agent, and may treat cached data as "
"current."
msgstr ""
"<strong>未发布撤销通知就销毁注册表令牌。</strong> 交易对手看到的是缺失的条目，而不是已退役的智能体，可能会把缓存数据当作最新数据。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:86
msgid ""
"**Leaving a funded wallet.** Sweep first. Dust left behind attracts phishing"
" against the owner."
msgstr "<strong>留下仍有资金的钱包。</strong> 先清空资金。留下的零散余额会招致针对所有者的钓鱼攻击。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:87
msgid ""
"**No final attestation.** Without a signed end, the agent's identity can be "
"resurrected by anyone who obtains an old key."
msgstr "<strong>没有最终证明。</strong> 缺少签名的终结记录，任何获得旧密钥的人都可以复活该智能体的身份。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:91
msgid "[Birth](birth.md) for the procedure this reverses."
msgstr "[诞生](birth.md)：本流程所逆转的流程。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:92
msgid "[Migration](migration.md) for the Migrating state."
msgstr "[迁移](migration.md)：Migrating 状态。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:93
msgid ""
"[Credential Rotation](credential-rotation.md) for revoke-first handling."
msgstr "[凭证轮换](credential-rotation.md)：先撤销的处理方式。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:94
msgid ""
"[10. Governance](../stack/10-governance.md), [9. "
"Trust](../stack/09-trust.md), [7. Memory](../stack/07-memory.md), [5. "
"Economic Identity](../stack/05-economy.md)."
msgstr ""
"[10. 治理](../stack/10-governance.md)、[9. 信任](../stack/09-trust.md)、[7. "
"记忆](../stack/07-memory.md)、[5. 经济身份](../stack/05-economy.md)。"

#: docs/lifecycle/death.md:95
