"[Observability & Human-in-the-loop](../providers/observability-and-hitl.md) "
"for audit sinks, [Accounts & Legal Entity](../providers/accounts-and-legal-"
"entity.md) for who legally owns what the agent leaves behind."
msgstr ""
"[可观测性与人在回路](../providers/observability-and-"
"hitl.md)：审计接收端；[账户与法律实体](../providers/accounts-and-legal-"
