#: docs/manifest.md:1
msgid "birth.yaml — the Agent Birth Manifest"
msgstr "birth.yaml — 智能体诞生清单（Agent Birth Manifest）"

#: docs/manifest.md:3
msgid ""
"**Status: experimental.** The manifest is a seed, not a specification. Field"
" names may change. Every section is optional and every object accepts extra "
"keys, so you can use it today to _describe_ an agent without waiting for it "
"to be finished."
msgstr ""
"<strong>状态：实验性。</strong> "
"该清单是种子，而非规范。字段名可能会变化。每个部分都是可选的，每个对象都接受额外的键，因此你今天就可以用它来<em>描述</em>一个智能体，而无需等待它完成。"

#: docs/manifest.md:5
msgid ""
"The Agent Birth Manifest (ABM) is a machine-readable statement of what an "
"agent has been provisioned with, one section per layer of the [Birth "
"Stack](birth-stack.md). One agent's manifest is its **Birth Profile**."
msgstr ""
"智能体诞生清单（Agent Birth Manifest，ABM）是一份机器可读的声明，说明智能体已被配置了哪些内容，[诞生栈](birth-"
"stack.md)的每一层对应一个部分。单个智能体的清单就是它的<strong>诞生档案（Birth Profile）</strong>。"

#: docs/manifest.md:7
msgid ""
"Schema: [`manifests/schema.json`](https://github.com/MatrixA/agent-"
"birthbook/blob/main/manifests/schema.json) (JSON Schema 2020-12)"
msgstr ""
"Schema：[`manifests/schema.json`](https://github.com/MatrixA/agent-"
"birthbook/blob/main/manifests/schema.json)（JSON Schema 2020-12）"

#: docs/manifest.md:8
msgid ""
"Example: [`manifests/examples/research-"
"agent.birth.yaml`](https://github.com/MatrixA/agent-"
"birthbook/blob/main/manifests/examples/research-agent.birth.yaml)"
msgstr ""
"示例：[`manifests/examples/research-"
"agent.birth.yaml`](https://github.com/MatrixA/agent-"
"birthbook/blob/main/manifests/examples/research-agent.birth.yaml)"

#: docs/manifest.md:10
msgid "Why a file"
msgstr "为什么用文件"

#: docs/manifest.md:12
msgid "Three uses, in order of how soon they are realistic:"
msgstr "三种用途，按实现的时间先后排列："

#: docs/manifest.md:14
msgid ""
"**A checklist that cannot be skipped.** Writing the profile forces every "
"layer to be answered, including the ones teams forget (who holds the kill "
"switch, what the daily budget is, when keys rotate). An empty section is a "
"finding."
msgstr ""
"<strong>一份无法跳过的检查清单。</strong> "
"编写档案会强制回答每一层的问题，包括团队常常忘记的那些（谁持有紧急停止开关、每日预算是多少、密钥何时轮换）。空白的部分本身就是一个发现。"

#: docs/manifest.md:15
msgid ""
"**An audit artifact.** A profile plus an audit log is enough to answer "
"\"what could this agent do, and what did it do\" after an incident."
msgstr "<strong>审计产物。</strong> 一份档案加上一份审计日志，就足以在事件发生后回答“这个智能体能做什么，以及它做了什么”。"

#: docs/manifest.md:16
msgid ""
"**Provisioning input.** Eventually a tool can read a profile and drive "
"[Birth Providers](providers/README.md) to create the inbox, the sandbox, the"
" wallet and the limits. Nothing in this repo does that yet."
msgstr ""
"<strong>配置输入。</strong> "
"最终可以有工具读取档案并驱动[诞生服务提供方](providers/README.md)来创建收件箱、沙箱、钱包和限额。本仓库目前尚未实现这一点。"

#: docs/manifest.md:18
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "规则"

#: docs/manifest.md:20
msgid ""
"**No secrets.** `secretRef` fields point into "
"`spec.authentication.secretStore`. The profile is safe to commit."
msgstr ""
"<strong>不含机密。</strong> `secretRef` 字段指向 "
"`spec.authentication.secretStore`。档案可以安全地提交到代码库。"

#: docs/manifest.md:21
msgid ""
"**Owner is mandatory.** `metadata.owner` is the only field besides `name` "
"that is required. An agent without a responsible party is not born, it is "
"loose."
msgstr ""
"<strong>所有者是必填项。</strong> `metadata.owner` 是除 `name` "
"之外唯一必需的字段。没有责任方的智能体不是诞生，而是失控。"

#: docs/manifest.md:22
msgid ""
"**Layer names are fixed.** The ten keys under `spec` match the stack. Put "
"anything that does not fit under the closest layer with an extra key rather "
"than inventing an eleventh."
msgstr ""
"<strong>层名称是固定的。</strong> `spec` "
"下的十个键与诞生栈对应。任何不适配的内容都应作为额外的键放入最接近的层，而不是发明第十一层。"

