#: docs/manifest.md:83
msgid ""
"Quote timestamps in YAML (`\"2026-09-10T00:00:00Z\"`); unquoted, most YAML "
"parsers turn them into native datetimes and the `date-time` string check "
"fails."
msgstr ""
"在 YAML 中请给时间戳加引号（`\"2026-09-10T00:00:00Z\"`）；若不加引号，多数 YAML 解析器会将其转换为原生 "
"datetime 类型，导致 `date-time` 字符串校验失败。"

#: docs/manifest.md:85
msgid "Reading the example"
msgstr "阅读示例"

#: docs/manifest.md:87
msgid ""
"The example profile describes a research agent named `scout`. Its values are"
" the defaults this book recommends; change one only when you have a reason, "
"and the linked chapter tells you what the reason would have to be. Layer by "
"layer:"
msgstr ""
"示例档案描述了一个名为 `scout` "
"的研究型智能体。其中的取值即本书推荐的默认值；只有在有充分理由时才应修改，而所链接的章节会告诉你该理由需要是什么。逐层来看："

#: docs/manifest.md:89
msgid ""
"Its DID is `did:web` on `agents.example.com`, a subdomain the owner "
"controls, so one NS record unplugs it. Its identity key is `custody: "
"provider` — the wallet platform holds it under policy, so a compromised "
"sandbox cannot exfiltrate it. See [Identity](stack/01-identity.md), [Domains"
" & DNS](providers/domains.md) and [Wallets & Keys](providers/wallets.md)."
msgstr ""
"它的 DID 是位于 `agents.example.com` 上的 `did:web`，这是所有者控制的子域，因此只需一条 NS "
"记录即可将其下线。其身份密钥为 `custody: "
"provider`——由钱包平台按策略托管，即使沙箱被攻破也无法将其外泄。参见[身份](stack/01-identity.md)、[域名与 "
"DNS](providers/domains.md)和[钱包与密钥](providers/wallets.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:90
msgid ""
"It has an email on the owner's subdomain, not a consumer mailbox, and no "
"phone number. See [Presence](stack/02-presence.md)."
msgstr "它的电子邮箱位于所有者的子域上，而非消费者邮箱，且没有电话号码。参见[在线存在](stack/02-presence.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:91
msgid ""
"One `secretStore` path per agent: the provisioner writes, the agent reads. "
"Its GitHub credential rotates daily (`P1D`) because it is a GitHub App "
"installation token; its mail API key rotates every 90 days. See "
"[Authentication](stack/03-authentication.md) and [Credential "
"Rotation](lifecycle/credential-rotation.md)."
msgstr ""
"每个智能体只有一个 `secretStore` 路径：由配置系统写入，智能体只读。其 GitHub 凭证每日轮换（`P1D`），因为它是 GitHub "
"App 安装令牌；其邮件 API 密钥每 90 "
"天轮换一次。参见[身份验证](stack/03-authentication.md)和[凭证轮换](lifecycle/credential-"
"rotation.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:92
msgid ""
"Isolation is `microvm` and egress is an allowlist of four hosts — the ones "
"behind the credentials it holds. See [Compute](stack/04-compute.md)."
msgstr ""
"隔离方式为 `microvm`，出站访问为四台主机的白名单——即它所持凭证对应的主机。参见[计算资源](stack/04-compute.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:93
msgid ""
"The budget is written before the wallet address and enforced at the signer. "
"It may pay up to 2 USD per call over x402 without asking. See [Economic "
"Identity](stack/05-economy.md)."
msgstr ""
"预算在钱包地址之前写入，并在签名器处强制执行。它可以通过 x402 在无需询问的情况下为每次调用支付最多 2 "
"美元。参见[经济身份](stack/05-economy.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:94
msgid ""
"Both models go through one gateway (`via: openrouter`) so the meter sits "
"outside the agent's code; tools are pinned by `source`. See "
"[Capabilities](stack/06-capabilities.md) and [Models & "
"Skills](providers/models-and-skills.md)."
msgstr ""
"两个模型都经由同一个网关（`via: openrouter`），因此计量器位于智能体代码之外；工具通过 `source` "
"固定版本。参见[能力](stack/06-capabilities.md)和[模型与技能](providers/models-and-"
"skills.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:95
msgid ""
"Every store has a finite `retention` except `files`; `forever` is chosen, "
"not defaulted. See [Memory](stack/07-memory.md)."
msgstr ""
"除 `files` 外，每个存储都有有限的 `retention`；`forever` "
"是主动选择的，而非默认值。参见[记忆](stack/07-memory.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:96
msgid ""
"Delegations are scoped, `canSubDelegate: false`, and the financial one "
"expires. Anything above 2 USD is an `approvals[]` entry routed to Slack. See"
" [Authority](stack/08-authority.md)."
msgstr ""
"各项委托授权都有明确范围，`canSubDelegate: false`，且金融相关的委托授权会过期。任何超过 2 美元的操作都会作为 "
"`approvals[]` 条目路由到 Slack。参见[权限](stack/08-authority.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:97
msgid ""
"One `OwnerAttestation` at a stable URL is the minimum a counterparty needs. "
"See [Trust](stack/09-trust.md)."
msgstr ""
"在稳定 URL 上发布一份 `OwnerAttestation` 是交易对手所需的最低要求。参见[信任](stack/09-trust.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:98
msgid ""
"The kill switch `mechanism: all` means suspend runtime, revoke credentials "
"and freeze the wallet in one action; `reviewCadence: P30D` because it spends"
" money. See [Governance](stack/10-governance.md)."
msgstr ""
"紧急停止开关的 `mechanism: all` 表示在一次操作中暂停运行时、吊销凭证并冻结钱包；由于该智能体会花费资金，因此 "
"`reviewCadence: P30D`。参见[治理](stack/10-governance.md)。"

#: docs/manifest.md:100
msgid "What is deliberately missing"
msgstr "刻意省略的内容"

#: docs/manifest.md:102
msgid ""
"**Versioning and signatures.** A real spec needs a signed profile so a "
"counterparty can trust it. That belongs with the [Trust](stack/09-trust.md) "
"layer and is not designed yet."
msgstr ""
"<strong>版本管理与签名。</strong> "
"真正的规范需要经过签名的档案，交易对手才能信任它。这属于[信任](stack/09-trust.md)层，目前尚未设计。"

#: docs/manifest.md:103
msgid ""
"**Provider drivers.** The requirement → interface → provider chain is "
"described in prose; there is no driver interface for tools to implement."
msgstr "<strong>提供方驱动。</strong> 需求 → 接口 → 提供方链条仅以文字描述；尚无供工具实现的驱动接口。"

#: docs/manifest.md:104
msgid "**Conformance tests.** Only the example is validated."
msgstr "<strong>一致性测试。</strong> 目前仅对示例进行了验证。"

#: docs/manifest.md:106
msgid ""
"If you are building any of these, open an issue first so the field names can"
" be agreed."
msgstr "如果你正在构建上述任何内容，请先提交 issue，以便就字段名称达成一致。"

#: docs/related.md:3
msgid ""
"Birthbook deliberately does not cover agent frameworks, model rankings or "
"MCP server catalogues. These projects do, or they inspired the shape of this"
" book."
msgstr "Birthbook 刻意不涵盖智能体框架、模型排名或 MCP 服务器目录。以下项目涵盖了这些内容，或启发了本手册的形态。"

