msgstr ""
"[DIF Universal Resolver](https://github.com/decentralized-"
"identity/universal-resolver) - 一个抽象接口、多个可插拔驱动；这是 Birthbook 需求 → 能力 → 接口 → "
"提供方链条背后的模式。"

#: docs/related.md:12
